<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">Psalm</book>
  <para style="h">Psalm</para>
  <para style="toc1">Psalm</para>
  <para style="toc2">Psalm</para>
  <para style="mt">Psalm</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi suaksualte remruat anga awm ngai lova, Mi sualte kawng pawha ding ngai lova, Hmusittute ṭhutphah pawha ṭhu ngai lo mi chu, a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A lâwmna chu Lalpa dânah a ni zâwk a; A dân thu chu a chhûn a zânin a ngaihtuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chu tui luang kianga thing phun, A hun têa rah ṭhîn, A hnah pawh uai ngai lo ang hi a ni a; A thiltih apiang chu a hmuingîl zêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi suaksualte erawh chu chutiang an ni lo va; Buhsî thliin a len bo ang hi an ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi suaksualte chu rorêlna hmaah chuan an ding thei lo vang a, Mi sualte pawh mi felte inkhâwmnaah chuan an ding thei hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi felte kawng chu a hre si ṭhîn a; Mi suaksualte kawng erawh chu a boral ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hnam tin chu engati nge an thinura, Mi tinin engati nge thil sâwt lo an ngaihtuah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Leia lalten an ep huai huai a, Hotute pawhin Lalpa leh a hriakthiha chu an phiar hlawm a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“An phuarnate hi tichatin, An hruihrualte hi kan hnên ata i paih daih ang u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vâna ṭhua chu a nui ang a; Lalpa chuan anniho chu a nuihzatbûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan thinurin an hnênah thu a sawi ang a, Thinrim takin anmahni a timangang tawh ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Keimah ngeiin ka tlâng thianghlim Zion-ah chuan, Ka lal siam chu ka ṭhuttîr ta a ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuruat chu ka hril dâwn: Lalpan ka hnênah, “Nang zawng ka Fapa i ni e; Vawiin hian ka hring che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dîl rawh; tichuan, i rochun atân hnam tin ka pe ang chia, Kâwlkil tâwp thlengin i ro atân ka pe bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anni chu thîrtiangin i tikeh ang a; Bêlvawtu bêl an paih keh sawm ang hian i paih keh sawm ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutichuan, aw lalte u, fing tawh ula; Leia rorêltute u, thununin awm tawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ṭih chungin Lalpa rawng bâwl ula, Khûr chungin lâwm rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Fapa chu fâwp rawh u; chuti lo chuan, a thinur ang a, kawng lakah in boral dah ang e, A thin chu a thawk thuai dâwn si a. Amaha an rinna nghat zawng zawngte chu an eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , mi dotute hi an va pung ta êm! Mi beitute hi tam tak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka chungchâng thu an sawi a, “Pathianin a pui lo vang,” an ti a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , nang chu ka vêlin ka phaw i ni a; Ka ropuina leh ka lû dâwm kângtu i ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka awin Lalpa chu ka au va, A tlâng thianghlim aṭangin mi chhâng ṭhîn a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei zawng ka mû chu ka lo muhîl ta a; Ka han harh leh a, Lalpa chuan mi lo chelh reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi dova, mi hual vêltu, Mi sîngkhat pawh hi ka hlau lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tho la, aw ka Pathian, mi chhandam rawh; Mi dotute zawng zawng chu an biang ruhah i vaw si a; Mi suaksualte hâ chu i tibal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chhandamna chu Lalpa ta a ni. I malsâwmna chu i mite chungah awm rawh se. (Selah)
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka felna Pathian, ka koh hun che chuan mi chhâng ang che; Ka manganin nangin mi tithawveng ṭhîn a: Mi khawngaih la, ka ṭawngṭaina hi mi ngaihthlâksak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw mihring fate u, ka ropuina hi eng chen nge mualphonaa in chantîr dâwn? Eng chen nge thil eng mah lo hi in ngainat anga, dâwt thu in zawn dâwn? (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Pathian ngaihsak mi chu ama tân a dah hrang tih hi hre zâwk rawh u; Lalpa chuan ka koh apiangin a lo ngaithla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hlau ula, thil tisual suh u; In khumlaizâwlah chuan in thinlungin inngaihtuah ula, ngawi ṭhiap rawh u. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Felna inthawinate chu hlân ula, Lalpa chu ring rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Ṭhatna rêng rêng tuin nge mi hmuhtîr ta ang le?” titute chu tam tak an awm. Lalpa , nang ngeiin i hmêl êng khân mi han ên ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An buh leh an uain lo hlâwk chânga an lâwmna aia lâwmna nasa zâwk, Ka thinlungah hian i awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thlamuang takin ka mû ang a, ka muhîl bawk ang; Lalpa , nangmah ngei hi a ni, Mahni chauh pawha him taka mi awmtîr ṭhîn hi ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka thûah hian beng lo chhi la, Ka ngaihtuahna hi ngaihtuah ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka Lal leh ka Pathian, Ka au thâwm hi ngaithla ang che, I hnêna ṭawngṭai ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , zîngah chuan ka aw hi i lo hre ṭhîn ang a; Zîngah chuan ka ṭawngṭaina hi i hmaan ka rêl fel diam ang a, Ka lo ngaihven ṭhîn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suahsualnaa lâwm ṭhîn Pathian i ni si lo va; Mi sual chu i hnênah an thleng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi uangthuangte chu i mit hmuhah an ding thei lo vang a; Thil tisualtute zawng zawng chu i haw ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dâwt thu sawi hmangte chu i tiboral ang a; Lalpan thisen chhuah hmang leh bum hmang mi chu a ten riau ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei erawh chu, i ngilneihna nasa tak avângin, i inah ka lo lût ang a; Ṭih chung chein i biak in thianghlim lam hawiin chibai ka bûk ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka hmêlmate avâng hian i felna avâng chuan mi hruai la; I kawng chu ka hmaah hian titluang ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An kâah chuan rinawmna rêng rêng a awm lo va; An kawchhûng chu suahsualna hlîr a ni; An hrawk chu thlân inhawng a ni a; An leiin mi an fak der ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, anniho hi thiam loh chantîr ang che; Anmahni remruat ngeite chu tlûk phah nân hmang rawh se: An bawhchhiatna tam tak avâng hian nam chhuak ang che; I chungah an hel si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangmaha an rinna nghat zawng zawngte erawh chu nangmahah chuan lâwm sela, I hum ṭhin avângin hlimin au kumkhua hlawm rawh se; I hming ngainate pawh chu nangmahah chuan lâwm takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi fel chu mal i sâwm dâwn si a; Aw Lalpa , ani chu phaw ang hian duhsaknain i hual vêl ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thinurin mi zilhhau suh la, Thinrimin mi thunun hek suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi khawngaih ang che, a chau zo ta si a; Aw Lalpa , mi tidam ang che, ka ruhte hi a na vek si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunna pawh a mangang êm êm bawk a ni; Aw Lalpa , nangin eng chen nge mi thlahthlam dâwn le aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , lo kîr leh la, ka nunna chhan him la; I ngilneihna avângin mi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thih hnu chuan nangmah hriat rengna a awm si lo va; Seol-ah tuin nge lâwmthu hrilh dâwn che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka rûmna lamah ka chau ta; Zan tin ka mutna chu mittuiin a huh a; Ka khum chu ka mittuiin ka tihuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hmuh pawh ka hmu thei ta lo; Hmêlma avângin ka ṭap a, ka mit pawh a thim zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni thil tisualtu zawng zawngte u, mi kalsan vek rawh u; Lalpan ka ṭap thâwm a hre tawh si a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpan khawngaih ka dîlna chu a ngaithla tawh a; Lalpan ka ṭawngṭaina chu a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi dotute zawng zawng chu an mualphovin an mangang êm êm ang a; An kîr leh ang a, Vawi leh khatah an la mualpho thut ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, nangmahah ka rinna ka nghat a; Mi ûmtute zawng zawng lakah hian mi chhandamin mi chhan him ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuti lo chuan, chhanhimtu awm lovin, sakeibaknei angin, Ka nunna hi pawt sawmin, a sawisa dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, hetianga ti ka lo niha, Ka kuta sualna lo awm a niha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ṭhian chu sualnaa thungrûl ka lo nih chuan, A ni, enga khaw lawilova mi dotu hi ka chhan him zâwk a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dotu hian ka nunna hi ûmin, ûm phâk mai rawh se. A ni, ka nun hi leiah chîl thluin, Ka ropuina hi vaivut zîngah dah mai rawh se. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thinurin tho la, Mi dotute thinrimna dovin thawk la; Ka tân intiharh rawh; dikna i phût si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, mi tin inkhâwmho chuan hual vêl che rawh se; Tin, nang chu an chung lamah chuan kîr leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpan mi tin ro a rêl ṭhîn; Aw Lalpa , keimaha ka felna leh ka rilru ṭhatna awm ang zêl hian ro mi rêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, mi suaksualte suahsualna chu lo tâwp tawh sela, Mi felte erawh chu tinghet ang che; Pathian fel tak chuan thinlungte leh rilrute a fiah ṭhîn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka phaw chu Pathian hnênah a awm, Amah chu thinlung dik tak pu chhandamtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian chu rorêltu fel tak a ni, A ni, ni tin mi sualte chunga lungnih lohna nei Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi a hawi kîr loh zawngin ani chuan a khandaih a tât hriam ang; A thal ngul chu a kuai a, a peih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thihna hriamhreite chu amah thah nân a siam ta diam bawk a; A thalte chu alh theiin a siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />En teh, sualna a vei a; A ni, suahsualna a pai a, Dâwt thu a hring ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuarkhurum a siam a, thûk takin a lai a, Ama hum siamah chuan a tla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A suahsualna chu ama lu chung ngeiah a kîr leh ang a, Râwng taka a thiltih chu ama chhîp ngeiah a tla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A felna avâng hian, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi ang a, Lalpa Chungnungbera hming fakin ka zai bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Lalpa, Lei chung zawng zawngah hian i hming chu a va ṭha êm! I ropuina chu vân chungahte khian i dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmêlma leh phuba latu tihdaihna tûrin, Nangmah dotute avângin Nausênte leh hnute hne laite kâa chhuak chuan chakna i tinghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I vân, i kutchhuakte, Thla leh arsi i ruathote khi, ka ngaihtuah châng chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mihring hi eng nge maw a niha, i hriat reng ṭhin ni? Mihring fapa pawh hi eng nge maw a niha, i kan ṭhin ni?” ka ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chu Pathian aia hnuai deuh chauhvin i siam a, Ropuina leh chawimawina i khumtîr si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I kutchhuak chungahte hian thu i neihtîr a; A ke hnuaiahte engkim i dah a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Berâm leh bâwng zawng zawngte nên, A ni, ramsate nên pawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chunglêng sava leh tuifinriat sangha, Tuifinriat kawnga kal apiangte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kan Lalpa , Lei chung zawng zawngah hian i hming a va ṭha êm!
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan ka thinlung zawng zawngin lâwmthu ka sawi ang a; I thilmak tih zawng zawng chu ka hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan ka lâwmin ka hlim ang a; Aw, nang Chungnungber, i hming fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi dotute chu an tlânchhiat veleh, I hmaah chuan an petek a, an boral a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka tâna âwm rêngah leh ka thûah hian nangin mi ṭan si a; Fel taka rorêlin lalṭhutphahah chuan i ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hnam tin i zilhhau va, mi suaksualte chu i tiboral a, An hming chu kumkhaw tlaitluan atân i thai bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dotute chu an mang zo va, kumkhua atân eng mah nei lovin an awm ta; I khaw tihṭiau tawhte chu, Anmahni hriat rengna lamin a boral ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chu kumkhua atân lalah a ṭhu a; A lalṭhutphah chu rorêlna tûrin a buatsaih ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan khawvêl hi fel takin ro a rêlsak ang a, Thlei bîk nei lovin mi tin ro chu a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chu hnehchhiahna tuarte tân chuan kulhbîng sâng a lo ni ang a; Mangan hunahte chuan kulhbîng sâng a lo ni ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tichuan, i hming hretute chuan an ring ang che; Nang zawngin Lalpa , nangmah zawngtute chu i kalsan ngai si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa , Zion-a awm chu fakin zai ula; Mite zîngah chuan a thiltihte chu hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thisen chhuah chhuahchhâl ṭhîntu chuan anni chu a hre reng si ṭhîn a: Mi retheite au thâwm a theihnghilh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi khawngaih la; Thihna kawngkhâr ata mi kai chhuak ṭhîntu, Mi hawtute avânga ka manganna hi en teh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangmah fakna zawng zawng chu ka hriattîr theihna tûrin; Zion fanu kawngkâahte chuan. I mi chhandamnaah hian ka hlim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam tin chu an khuarkhurum siamah chuan an pil a; An lên phah rûkah chuan anmahni ke ngei a âwk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chu a inhriattîr a, ro a rêl ta a; Mi suaksual chu ama kutchhuak ngeiah chuan a âwk ṭhîn a. (Higgaion. Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chu Seol-ah an kîr leh ang, Hnam tin, Pathian theihnghilh hmang zawngte nên chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pachhiate chu theihnghilhin an awm fo lo vang a, Retheite beiseina chu kumkhua chuan a bo hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tho teh; mihring maiin ngam che suh se. Hnam tin chu i mit hmuhah rorêlsakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , anni chu tihlau la; Hnam tinin mihring mai an ni tih inhre rawh se. (Selah)
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , engati nge hla taka i din ṭhin le? Engati nge mangan laitea i inthup ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chapona avângin mi retheite chu ûm nekin an awm ṭhîn; An thil sual ngaihtuah chhuahahte chuan anmahni ngei âwk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan a thinlung duh zâwng a chhuang a, Mi duhâm chuan Lalpa chu a paih thla a, a hmusit ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan chapo hmêl puin, “A phût lo vang,” a ti ṭhîn. A ngaihtuahna zawng zawng chu, “Pathian rêng a awm lo,” tih hlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A awm dânte chu eng lai pawhin a nghet reng a; I rorêlnate chu chung lam hla takah, a hmuh phâk lohvah a awm daih a; Amah dotute zawng zawng lah chu a nuihsan mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A rilru chuan, “Ka nghîng lo vang; Chhuan zawng zawng thlengin mangangin ka awm lo vang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kâ chu ânchhe lawhna te, tihderna te, tihduhdahna tein a khat a; A lei hnuaiah chuan thil tihsualna leh khawlohna a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Khaw tina chân rûkna hmunahte a ṭhu ṭhîn a; Hmun fianrialahte chuan pawi khawih lo mite a that ṭhîn; A mitin eng mah ti thei lo mi chu a châng ru reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sakeibakneiin a pûka a châng ru angin, ani chuan fianrialah a châng ru reng ṭhîn a; Mi rethei man tûrin a châng ṭhîn a; Mi rethei chu a man ngei a; Tichuan, a lênin a hnûk bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A bawk pêr a, a kûn a, Eng mah ti thei lo mite chu a mi chakte tihtlûkin an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A rilru chuan, “Pathianin a theihnghilh a ni; A hmai chu a thup a; eng tikah mah a hmu lo vang,” a ti ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tho la; Aw Pathian, i kut han lek teh! Mi retheite chu theihnghilh suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Eng vângin nge mi suaksual chuan Pathian a hmuhsita, A rilruin, “I phût lo vang,” a tih ṭhin ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hmuh chu i hmu tawh reng a; i kuta thungrûl tûrin thil tihsual leh tihvuina i en reng si a; Eng mah ti thei lo mi chu i hnênah a inkawltîr ṭhîn a: Pa nei lo ṭanpuitu i nih ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi suaksual bân chu titliak la; Mi sual chu a suahsualna zawng chhuak ang che, I hmuh loh ṭhuai hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chu kumkhaw tlaitluan atâna Lalber a ni a: Hnam tin chu ama ram ata an boral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , leia mi chu hlauhawm taka a awm leh tawh lohna tûrin, Pa nei lo leh hnehchhiahna tuarte rorêlsak nân, Thuhnuairawlhte duh zâwng chu i ngaithla tawh a; An thinlung chu i buatsaih ang a, i beng chu i ngaihthlâktîr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa -ah chuan ka rinna ka nghat ṭhîn. Eng tizia nge ka nunna hnênah hian, “In tlângah chuan sava angin thlâwk bo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />En teh u, thinlung dik tak pu thim hnuaia an kah theihna tûrin, Mi suaksualte chuan thal ngul an kuai a, An thal chu a hruiah an vuah diam saw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungphûmte chu tihchhiata a awm chuan, Mi felin eng nge a tih theih ang?” in tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu a biak in thianghlimah a awm a, Lalpa chu, a lalṭhutphah zawng vânah a awm; Mihring fate hi a mitin a en a, an thiltihte a fiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi fel chu a fiah ṭhîn a; Mi suaksual leh nunrâwnna ngaina erawh chu a nunnain a haw ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chungah chuan thangte a sûrtîr ang a; Mei leh kât leh thli lum tak hi an no chan tûr a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu a fel si a, felna hi a ngaina ṭhîn a; Mi dik takte chuan a hmêl an la hmu ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , min ṭanpui rawh; Pathian ngaihsak mi an awm tawh si lo va; Mihring fate zîng ata hi mi rinawm an bo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tinin an vêngte hnênah thu eng mah lo mai mai an sawi ṭhîn a: Mi fak derna hmui leh bumna thinlung puin thu an sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan fak derna hmui zawng zawng chu a hlep ang a, Thu chapo tak sawina lei nên chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chuan, “Kan lei hian kan hneh ang; Kan hmuite hi keimahni ta ngei alâwm, Tu nge kan chungah lal awm ni?” an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan, “Retheite an hnehchhiah avâng leh, Pachhiate rûm avângin ka tho nghâl mai ang a; An nuihsana chu him takin ka awmtîr teh ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa thute hi thu thianghlim tak a ni; Tangkarua, lei chunga rawh tuina meia fiaha, Vawi sarih tihthianghlim tawh hnu ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin anni chu i vawng ṭha ang a, Hêng ṭhangtharte lakah hian kumkhuain i humhim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring fate zîngah hian sualna chu chawimawia a awmin, Mi suaksualte chu an vâk vêl ruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , eng chen nge mi theihnghilh dâwn? Kumkhuain em ni? Eng chen nge ka lakah hian i hmai i thup dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nilêngin ka thinlunga lungngaihna neiin, Eng chen nge ka rilruin rem ka ruat ka ruat dâwn? Eng chen nge ka hmêlma chu ka chungah chawimawia a awm dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, ngaihtuah la, mi chhâng teh khai; Ka mit mi tihvârsak ang che; chuti lo chuan, thihna muthilhin ka muhîl dah ang e;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmêlma chuan, “Amah ka ngam ta,” a ti dah ang e; Ka nghînin mi dotute an lâwm dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei zawngin i ngilneihna hi ka ring a; I mi chhandamnaah hian ka thinlung a lâwm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka chungah ṭha taka a tih tâk avângin, Lalpa chawimawiin hla ka sa ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi â chuan a rilruin, “Pathian rêng a awm lo,” a ti a. An chhe zo va, thil tenawm tak an ti a; Tu mah thil ṭha ti rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Hre thiama, Pathian zawng rêng rêng an awm emaw,” tiin, Lalpa chuan vân aṭangin mihring fate hi a zuk en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni lo lamah an pêng ta vek a; bawlhhlawh takin an lo awm ta hlawm a; Tu mah thil ṭha ti rêng an awm lo, Pakhat tê mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil tisualtute zawng zawng chuan hriatna rêng rêng an nei lo vem ni? Chhang an ei angin ka mite an ei zo vek ṭhîn a, Lalpa lah an ko ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chu mi fel thlahte zîngah a awm ṭhin avângin, An hlau êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi rethei remruat chu in mualphosak ṭhîn, Lalpa chu a inhumhimna a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Israel-ho chhandamna chu Zion aṭangin lo chhuak teh sela aw! Lalpa chuan a mite sala an awm chu a hruai kîr leh hunah, Chumi hunah chuan Jakob-ho chu an hlim tawh ang a, Israel-ho chu an lâwm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , i puan inah chuan tu nge lo mikhual ang? I tlâng thianghlimah chuan tu nge lo awm ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dik taka awma, fel taka tia, A rilrua thu tak tak sawi mi chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A leia mi rêl ngai lova, A ṭhian chung pawha thil sual ti ngai lova, A vêngte hming pawh sawi chhe ngai lo mi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi sual tak chu a hmuhsitin a awm ṭhîn a; Lalpa ṭihtute erawh chu a chawimawi ṭhîn. Mahni tâna pawi tûr pawh chhechhama tiam tawh chu tidanglam ngai lova,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A pung ûm tûra a tangka pûktîr ngai lova, A thiam zâwk thiam loh chantîrna tûra thamna pawh la ngai lo mi chu. Chûng thil titu chu eng tikah mah a nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi humhim rawh; Nangmahah chuan ka rinna ka nghat si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Nang chu ka Lalpa i ni a; Nangmah lo chu ṭhatna rêng rêng ka nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leia mi thianghlim awmte zawng, Anni chu mi ṭha, ka lâwmna zawng zawng awmna chu an ni,” ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa aia pathian dang thlangtute chu, An lungngaihnate a la pung ang; An thisen hlan in mite chu ka hlân ve lo vang a, Ka hmuiin an hmingte ka lam hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka ro chan tûr leh ka no chan tûr chu a ni; Nangin ka chanpual chu mi tihnghehsak ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tehna hruite chu hmun nuam takahte ka pualah a tla ta hlauh a ni; A ni, ro ṭha tak ka luah ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , rem mi ruatsaktu chu ka fak ang; A ni, zânahte hian ka rilruin mi thunun ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka hmaah ka awmtîr fo va; Ka ding lama a awm avângin ka nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thinlung hi a lâwm a, ka ropuina hi a hlim a; Ka tisa pawh him takin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thlarau Seol-ah i hnutchhiah dâwn si lo va; I mi thianghlim hi ṭawihna hmuh i phal dâwn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangin nunna kawng chu mi hriattîr ang; I hmaah chuan hlima khah liamna a awm a; I kut ding lamah chuan kumkhaw lâwmna a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka felna thu hi hria la, Ka au thâwm hi ngaithla la; Dâwt sawi ngai lo hmui aṭanga chhuak, ka ṭawngṭainaah hian beng lo chhi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka chunga thutlûkna chu i hma aṭanga chhuak ni sela; I mitin thlei bîk neih lohna chu en rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi i fiah a; zânah mi tlawh a; Mi fiah tawh a, eng mah i hmu si lo va; Ka kâin a sawi sual lo vang ka ti tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring thiltihah zawng, i hmuia thuchhuak avângin Mi nunrâwng kawnga kal lo tûrin ka invawng ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka ke pênte hian i kawng chu a zawh tlat a, Ka kete hi a tleu ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka ko ṭhîn chia, nangin mi chhâng dâwn si a; Ka lamah hian i beng rawn dawh la, Ka thusawi hi ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw, nangmaha rinna nghat apiang anmahni beitute laka i kut ding lama chhandam ṭhîntu, I ngilneihna mak tak chu lantîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi suaksual, mi tichhetu, Mi do tlata mi hual vêltute lakah chuan mitnautê angin mi vawng ṭha la, I thla hnuaiahte mi thukru ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mahni an inchâwm thau va, An kâin chapo takin an ṭawng thîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tûnah zawng kan ke pênna apiangah min hual vêl tawh a, Leia min titlu tûrin an mitte chu kan chungah an fûktîr tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Anni chu sakeibaknei sa seh châk tak ang leh, Sakeibaknei vânglai hmun fianrialtea bawk reng ang mai chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tho la, Amah chu hmachhawn la, kûntîr tlat rawh; Ka nunna hi mi suaksualte lakah i khandaihin chhan him ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i kutin mihringte lakah, Khawvêl mihringte lakah hian chhan him ang che; Anni chanvo zawng tûn dam chhûnga an neih hi a ni a, An pum chu i rovin i tihkhahsak ṭhîn; Fate lungawi tâwk zetin an nei a, An sum hman bâng chu an fa sênte an thihsan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kei erawh zawngin felna neiin i hmêl ka hmu ang a; Nangmah anna neia ka men hunah chuan ka lungawi tâwk zet ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka chakna, ka hmangaih a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka lungpui leh, ka kulhpui leh, mi chhanhimtu a ni; Ka Pathian, ka lungpui nghet tak a ni a, amahah chuan rinna ka nghat ang; Ka phaw leh, ka chhandamna ki leh, ka kulhbîng sâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fak tlâk Lalpa chu ka ko vang a; Chutichuan, mi dotute lakah chhandamin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thihna hruihrualte chuan mi zem a, Pathian ngaihsak lohna tuiliante chuan mi tihlau va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Seol hruihrualte chuan mi phuar vêl a; Thihna thangte chuan mi âwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka manganin Lalpa chu ka ko ṭhîn a, Ka Pathian ka au ṭhîn; Ani chuan a biak in aṭang chuan ka aw a hria a, A hmaa ka au thâwm chu a bengah a lût ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu veleh lei hi a nghîng a, a khûr ta a, A thinur avângin tlângte pawh chu A nghahchhante lamin a khûrin a nghîng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A hnâr aṭang chuan meikhu a chho ta ngut ngut a, A kâa chhuak mei chuan a kâng ta hluah hluah a; Chu chuan meihawl pawh a tialh ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan vânte pawh a tikûn a, a chhuk ta a; A ke hnuaiahte chuan thim chhah mup hi a lo awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cherub chungah a chuang a, a thlâwk ta a, A ni, thli thlaah te chuan a thlâwk ta thuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thim hi a bihrûkna hmunah, amah hual vêlna bûktêah a siam a; Tuia thimna, vâna chhûm chhah mupte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A hmaa ênna avâng chuan a chhûm chhah mupte chu a kiang a, Rialte leh meilingte a tla ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chu vânahte khian a ri dur dur bawk a, Chungnungbera chuan a aw a chhuah a; Rialte leh meilingte a tla ta dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, a thalte chu a kâp chhuak a, anniho chu a tidarh a; A ni, kâwl te a phêttîr zawih zawih reng a, a tibuai ta nuaih hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chu veleh, aw Lalpa , i zilhhau avânga, I hnâra thaw chhuakin a chhêm vak avâng chuan, Tui luannate chu a lo lang a, Leilung nghahchhante chu tihlanin a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan chung lam aṭangin a rawn ban a, mi chelh a; Tui tam tak ata mi hnûk chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi dotu chak tak lakah chuan mi chhan him a, Mi hawtute lakah pawh, keia tân chuan an chak lutuk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chuan ka vânduai nî chuan mi bei a; Nimahsela, Lalpa chu ka rin pui ber a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan hmun thâwl takah mi hruai chhuak a; Ka chunga a lâwm avângin mi lo chhan him ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka felzia ang ngeiin ka chungah a ti a; Ka kutte a thianghlimzia ang ngeiin mi rûl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa kawngte chu ka zawh a, Ka Pathian hnên ata sual takin ka kal bo ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A rorêlna zawng zawng chu ka hmaah a awm ṭhîn a, A thuruatte chu ka paih ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ama lakah chuan sawisêl bo ka ni bawk a, Ka khawlohna ata ka inthiarfihlîm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan ka felzia ang zêlin mi lo rûl ta a, Ka kutte a mit hmuha a thianghlimzia ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khawngaih thei tak lakah chuan khawngaih thei takin i intilang ang a; Mi ṭha famkim lakah chuan ṭha famkimin i intilang ang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi thianghlim lakah chuan thianghlimin i intilang ang a; Tin, mi luhlul lakah chuan luhlulin i intilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hrehawm tuar mite chu i chhandam dâwn si a, Mit chapote erawh chu i titlâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nangin ka khâwnvâr hi mi hâlsak dâwn si a; Lalpa ka Pathian chuan ka thimna hi a tiêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nangma ṭanpuiin râl ka bawh si a; Ka Pathian ṭanpui bawkin kulh bang ka zuan khûm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian zawng, a kawng chu a ṭha famkim a; Lalpa thu chu fiah a ni tawh; Amaha rinna nghat zawng zawngte tân chuan ani chu phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa lo chu tu nge Pathian awm ni? Kan Pathian lo chu tu nge lungpui awm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chaknaa ka taia mi hrêngtu leh, Ka kawng tiṭha famkimtu Pathian chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani chuan ka ke hi zukpui ke angin a siam a, Ka hmun sâng takahte mi awmtîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka kutte hi râl kâp tûrin a zirtîr ṭhîn a, Chutichuan, ka bânte hian dâr thal ngul a kuai zo hial a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Nangin i chhandamna phaw chu mi pe bawk a; I kut ding lamin mi kai a, I inngaihtlâwmnain mi siam lian ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Ka hnuaia ka ke pênna chu i tizau va; Tichuan, ka kete hi a tleng lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi dotute chu ka ûm ang a, ka ûm phâk mai ang; Tihborala an awm hma loh chuan ka hawi kîr tawh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An thawh leh theih lohna tûrin ka sât chhawk ang a; Ka ke hnuaiah hian an tlu hlawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Nangin inbeihna atân chuan chaknain ka taiah mi hrêng si a; Mi rawn beitute chu ka hnuaiah i tudawl ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Mi hawtute chu ka tihboral theihna tûrin, Nangin mi dotute chu mi hnuchhawnin i awmtîr ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Anni chu an au va; nimahsela, chhandamtu tûr tu mah an awm lo va; Lalpa ngei chu an au va; nimahsela, a chhâng si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chu veleh vaivut thli chhêm len ang maiin ka vaw sawm dep a; Kawtlai chirhdiak ang mai hian ka paih chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Nangin mite insualna lakahte chuan mi chhan him a; Hnam tin lûah mi siam a; Ka hriat ngai loh mite chuan ka rawng an bâwl tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Ka chanchin an hriat veleh ka thu an zâwm ang a; Mikhualte chu ka hnênah an intulût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Mikhualte chu an zâm ang a, An kulhbîng atate chu khûr chungin an lo chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Lalpa chu a nung reng e; ka lungpui chu fakin awm sela; Mi chhandamtu Pathian chu chawimawiin awm rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Phuba mi lâksaktu leh, Mi tin ka hnuaia tudawltu Pathian ngei chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Ani chuan mi dotute lakah mi chhan chhuak a; A ni, nangin mi beitute chung lamah chuan mi chawi kâng a; Mi nunrâwng lak ata chu mi chhan him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Chuvângin, aw Lalpa , hnam tin zîngah chuan lâwmthu ka hrilh ang chia, I hming fakin ka zai bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Ani chuan chhandamna ropui tak a lal siam hnênah a pe ṭhîn a; A hriak thiha chungah, Davida leh a thlahte chung ngeiah chuan, Kumkhuain a ngilneihzia a lantîr ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vânte khian Pathian ropuizia chu a hriattîr a; Boruak zau tak khian a kutchhuak chu a lantîr ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhûn hian chhûn hnênah thu a sawi chhâwng zêl a, Zân hian zân hnênah hriatna a lan chhâwntîr zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thusawi rêng rêng leh ṭawng rêng rêng a awm lo va; An aw chu benga hriat theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An tehna hrui chu leilung luah zawng zawngah zam chhuahin a awm a; An thu chu kâwlkil thlengin a thang chhuak ta a. Chûngahte chuan ni tân khian puan in a zâr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu ni chu mo neitu tûr a pindan ata chhuak ang chu a ni a, Mi chak tak angin a tlânna kawnga a tlân tûr chu a hlim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A chhuahna chu kâwlkil tâwp aṭangin a ni a, A tlân kualna chu a tâwp lehlam thlengin a ni a, A lum hre lova thuhrûk rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa dân chu a ṭha famkim a, nunna a siam ṭha ṭhîn; Lalpa thuhriattîr chu a rinawm a, mi mâwl a tifing ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa thununna thu chu a dik a, thinlung a tilâwm ṭhîn; Lalpa thupêk chu a thianghlim a, mitte a tivâr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa ṭihna chu a fai a, kumkhua atân a awm ṭhîn; Lalpa rorêlnate chu a tak a, a fel vêl vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chûng chu rangkachak aia duhawm zâwk a ni a, a ni, rangkachak thianghlim tam tak ai pawhin; Khawizû leh khawithlâr aiin a thlum zâwk bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu, chûng chuan i chhiahhlawh hi zilhin ka awm ṭhîn a: Chûng zawm chu lâwmman nasa tak neihna a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuin nge mahni tihsualte hre thei ang? Sual inthupte lakah hian mi tifihlîm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thil tisual lui lo tûrin i chhiahhlawh hi mi chelh tlat la; Ka chungah thu neihtîr suh ang che; Chutichuan, ṭha famkimin ka awm ang a, Bawhchhiatna nasa tak lakah sawisêl bovin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka lungpui leh mi tlantu, Ka kâa thuchhuakte leh ka thinlunga ngaihtuahnate hi i mit hmuhah lawm tlâk takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mangan ni chuan Lalpan chhâng che rawh se; Jakoba Pathian hming chuan hmun sângah hlâng che rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hmun thianghlim aṭang chuan ṭanpuina tirhsak che sela, Zion aṭang chuan tichak che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I thilhlan zawng zawng chu hre reng sela, I hâlral thilhlan chu lâwm rawh se; (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I thinlung duh zâwng chu pe phal che sela, I remruat zawng zawng chu hlawhtlintîr che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I chhandamnaah chuan hlimin kan zai ang a, Kan Pathian hmingin kan puanzârte hi kan la zâr ang: Lalpa chuan i dîlna zawng zawng chu hlawhtlintîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpan a hriak thiha hi a chhandam tih tûnah ka hre ta; A kut ding lam chhandamna thain a vân thianghlim aṭang khian amah a la chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ṭhenkhatin tawlailîrte an ring a, ṭhenkhatin sakawrte an ring. Keini erawh chuan Lalpa kan Pathian hming chu kan lam zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni zawng an kûn a, an tlu ta a; Keini erawh chu kan tho va, kan ding mar ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , chhandam rawh; Kan koh hun chuan Lalberin min chhâng rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , lal chu i chaknaah hian a hlim ang a, I chhandamnaah hian a va hlim nasa dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thinlung duh zâwng chu i pe a, A hmuia a thil dîl chu i phal lo lo ve. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭhatnaa malsâwmnatein i hmuak si a; Rangkachak thianghlim lallukhum i khumtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan nunna a dîl chia, i lo pe a; Kumkhaw tlaitluana dam rengna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I ṭanpui avângin a ropui êm êm a; Chawimawina leh ropuina a chungah i nghat ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumkhua atân malsâwmna nasa tak dawngin i siam si a; I hmaa hlimnain i tilâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lal chuan Lalpa chu a ring si a, Chungnungbera ngilneihna avângin a nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I kutin nangmah dotu zawng zawng chu a zawng chhuak vek ang a; I kut ding lamin nangmah hawtute chu a zawng chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I thinur hunah chuan anni chu rawh tuina mei alh hluah hluah angin i siam ang. Lalpa chuan anni chu thinurin a lem zo vang a, Mei chuan a kâng ral mai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An rahte chu lei ata i tiboral ang a, An thlahte chu mihring fate zîng ata i tiboral bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I chungah khân thil sual tih an tum si a; Thil sual an ngaihtuah chhuak a, an hlen thei si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nangin anni chu i hnungchhawntîr dâwn si a, I thal hruite chu an hmai tinin i kuai peih diam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chaknaah chuan chawimawiin lo awm ang che; Chutichuan, i thiltihtheihna fakin hla kan sa ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka Pathian, ka Pathian, engah nge mi kalsan? Engah nge mi ṭanpui tûrin i hlat êma, ka rûmna thute aṭanga i hlat le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, chhûnah ka au va; nimahsela, i chhâng si lo va; Zânah ka au bawk a, ka ngawi chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw nang Israel-ho faknaa chêng ṭhîn, Nang zawng i thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan thlahtute chuan an lo ring chia; An ring a; tichuan, nangin i lo chhan him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An au chia; tichuan, chhan himin an lo awm ṭhîn a; An ring chia; tichuan, mualphovin an awm ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei erawh chu mihring rêng rêng ka ni lo va, changpât mai ka ni a; Mihringte sawi chhiat leh mite hmuhsit ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hmu apiangin mi nuihsan a; An hmui an kum a, an lû an thing a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Lalpa chungah innghat ta che; ani chuan amah hi chhan him ang hmiang; A chunga a lâwm avângin chhan him ang hmiang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang erawh chu chhûl ata mi la chhuaktu chu i ni a; Ka nu hnute chunga ka awm lai khân nangin mi rintîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chhûl aṭang rêngin nangma chunga nghah ka ni a; Nang chu ka nu pum chhûng aṭang rêngin ka Pathian i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi hlat lul suh ang che; manganna tûr a hnai si a; Ṭanpuitu tûr rêng rêng an awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Bâwngpa tam takin mi hual vêl a; Basan rama bâwngpa chak takte chuan mi hual vêl khup a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sakeibaknei koham hâhum hmang angin an kâin mi ân khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tui anga leihbuakin ka awm a, Ka ruh zawng zawng pawh a pelhsawlh zo va; Ka thinlung hi khawihnûn ang a ni a; Ka rîl zîngahte hian a tui zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka tha hi lampei angin a ro zo va; Ka lei pawh hi ka dangah a bet ta tlat a; Nangin thihna vaivutah hian mi hruai lût ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Uite chuan mi hual vêl si a; Thil ṭha lo titu awm khâwmte chuan mi hual tlat a; Ka kut leh ka kete hi an tipawp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka ruh zawng zawng hi ka chhiar thei a; Anni lah chuan mi enin mi melh reng a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka silhfênte an insem a, Ka kawr atân ṭhum an vâwr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan, aw Lalpa , mi hlat lul suh la; Aw, mi tichaktu, mi ṭanpui tûrin hmanhmawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nunna hi khandaih lakah chuan chhan him la; Ka neih chhun tak hi ui thiltihtheihna lakah chuan chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sakeibaknei kâ aṭang chuan mi chhandam ang che; A ni, selepa kîa mi chu nangin mi chhâng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka unaute hnênah i hming ka hril ang a; Inkhâwmho zîngah chuan ka fak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa ṭihtute u, amah chu fak rawh u; Jakoba thlah zawng zawngte u, amah chu chawimawi rawh u; Israela thlah zawng zawngte u, amah chu hlau rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani chuan hrehawm tuartu hrehawmzia chu a hmusit si lo va, a ten hek lo; A hmai chu a lakah a thup hek lo; Amah a auhvin a ngaithla zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Inkhâwmna ropui taka ka fak ṭhinna che hi nangma hnêna mi a ni; Amah ṭihtute hmaah chuan ka thutiam ka hlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte chuan an ei ang a, an tlai ang; Amah zawngtute chuan Lalpa chu an fak ang. In thinlung chu kumkhuain nungin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kâwlkila mi zawng zawng pawhin an hre leh ang a, Lalpa lam an hawi tawh ang; Hnam tina chi tin i hmaah an kûn ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ram chu Lalpa ta a ni a, Hnam tin chunga rorêltu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Leia mi neinung zawng zawngte chuan an eiin chibai an bûk ang a; Vaivuta chhuk tûr zawng zawngte chu a hmaah an la kûn ang, Mahni nunna tinung reng thei lote pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ṭhangtharten a rawng an bâwl ang a; Ṭhangthar lo awm zêlte hnênah chuan Lalpa chanchin chu an hril ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />An lo kal ang a, A thu anga lo la piang tûrte hnênah chuan a felna chu an puang ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi vêngtu a ni a; Ka tlachham lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ani chuan hlobet hring dup hmunahte mi bawhtîr ṭhîn a; Chawlhna tui kamahte mi hruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunna hi mi siam ṭhat ṭhîn a, Ama hming avângin felna kawngahte mi hruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ni, thihna hlim kawr ruam zawh mah ila, Thil ṭha lo rêng rêng ka hlau lo vang; Nang ka hnênah i awm si a; I talhtum leh i tiangin mi thlamuan ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi dotute mit hmuhah ka hmaah hian dawhkân i buatsaih ṭhîn a; Ka lû hi hriak i thih tawh a; Ka novah hian a liam reng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Matheilovin ṭhatna leh ngilneihnain ka dam chhûng zawng hian mi zui zêl ang a; Tichuan, Lalpa inah kumkhuain ka awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leilung leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi Lalpa ta a ni a, Khawvêl leh a chhûnga chêngte nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuifinriat chungahte amahin a din a ni si a, Luipui chungahte pawh a tinghet bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa tlângah tu nge chho vanga, A hmun thianghlimah tu nge ding ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kut fai leh thinlung thianghlim neia, A rilru eng mah lo mai mai lama dah ngai lova, Bum tuma chhechham ngai lo mi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan Lalpa hnên ata malsâwmna a dawng ang a, A chhandamtu Pathian hnên ata felna a dawng bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian zawngtute chu chutiang mi chu an ni, Aw Jakoba Pathian, i hmêl zawngtute chu. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw kulh kawngkâte u, in lu chungte kha chawi sâng ula; Nangni kawngkhâr hlunte u, inkhai sâng rawh u; Tichuan, ropuina Lal hi a lo lût dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ropuina Lal chu tu nge ni? Lalpa chak tak leh thiltithei tak, Lalpa , indonaa thiltithei tak chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw kulh kawngkâte u, in lu chungte kha chawi sâng ula, A ni, kawngkhâr hlunte u, chawi sâng rawh u; Tichuan, ropuina Lal hi a lo lût dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu ropuina Lal chu tu nge ni? Sipaihote Lalpa chu, Amah ngei hi ropuina Lal chu a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka rilru hi i hnênah ka dah tlat ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, nang ka ring chia, Mualphovin mi awmtîr suh la; Mi dotute mi ngam chu phal suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani, nangmah nghâktu rêng rêng chu tu mah mualphovin an awm lo vang; A vâng awm lova vervêk taka titute erawh chu mualphovin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i kawngte chu mi hriattîr la; I kalkawng chanchinte mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thutakah chuan mi hruai la, mi zirtîr ang che, Nang chu mi chhandamtu Pathian i ni si a; Nilênga ka nghah reng che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i lainatnate leh i ngilneihziate chu hre reng ang che; Hmasânga lo awm kumkhua tawh a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka tleirâwl lai sualnate leh ka bawhchhiatnate chu hre reng suh ang che; Aw Lalpa , i ṭhatna avângin, I ngilneihna avângin mi hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ṭhain a dik a ni; Chuvângin, mi sualte chu kawng a entîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte chu rorêlna felah a hruai ang a; Thuhnuairawlhte chu ama kawng chanchin a zirtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A thuthlun leh a thu hriattîrte zâwmtute tân chuan, Lalpa kalkawng zawng zawngte chu ngilneihna leh thutak vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i hming avângin Ka khawlohna ngaidam ang che, nasa tak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa ṭih mi chu tu nge ni? Chu mi chu a kawng thlan tûr chu a la entîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A nunna chu nuamsa takin a awm ang a; A thlahte chuan ram chu an la luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa thurûk chu amah ṭihtute hnênah a awm a, A thuthlun chu anmahni a hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka mitin Lalpa lam a en fo ṭhîn; Ani chuan ka kete hi lên ata a la chhuak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka lamah hian lo hawi la, mi khawngaih ang che; Khawhar leh hrehawm takin ka awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thinlung buainate hi a lo nasa ta a; Aw, ka manganna atate hi mi hruai chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka hrehawmzia leh ka manganzia hi ngaihtuah la, Ka sual zawng zawng ngaidam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi dotute chu ngaihtuah teh, tam tak an ni a; Nasa takin mi haw si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw, ka nunna vawng ṭha la, mi chhan him ang che; Mualphovin mi awmtîr suh ang che, Nangmahah chuan ka rinna ka nghat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka rilru ṭhatna leh ka diknain mi chhan him rawh se, Ka nghâk reng si chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Pathian, Israel-ho hi an manganna zawng zawng ata chhan chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ro mi rêlsak ang che, Rilru ṭha tak puin ka awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi en fiahin, mi fiah la; Ringhlel lovin Lalpa chu ka ring bawk a. Ka rilru leh ka thinlung hi tithianghlim ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ngilneihna chu ka hmaah a awm si a, I thutakah ka awm fo bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi eng mah lo mai maite hnênah ka ṭhu ngai lo va; Vervêkte hnênah pawh ka lût hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo titute inkhâwmho chu ka hua a, Mi suaksualte hnênah ka ṭhu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kutte hi sawisêl bonain ka sil ang a, Chutiangin, aw Lalpa , i maichâm chu ka kal hual ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawina hla ka sak theih a, I thilmak tih zawng zawng thute chu ka hrilh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa , i awmna in chu ka ngaina a, I ropuina awmna pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nunna hi mi sualte zîngah la tel suh la, Ka nun pawh hi thisen chhuah hmangte zîngah la tel hek suh ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />An kutah chuan ngaihtuahna sual a awm a, An kut ding lam chu thamnain a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei zawng rilru ṭha puin ka awm ang; Min tlan la, min khawngaih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ke hi hmun zâwl takah a ding a; Inkhâwmnaahte chuan Lalpa chu ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka êng leh mi chhandamtu a ni; tu nge ka ṭih ang? Lalpa chu ka nunna kulhbîng a ni; tu nge ka hlauh vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo tiho, mi dotute leh ka hmêlmate chuan, ka sa ei tuma mi beih lai khân, An inchhuih a, an tlu ta hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sipai pâwlhovin mi beih tumin mi ep reng mah sela, Ka thinlung hian a hlau lo vang; Ka chungah indona lo chhuak mah sela, Chuti pawhin ka ring tlat ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah thil pakhat ka dîl a, chu mawlh chu ka zawng ang; Lalpa mawizia hmu tûr leh, a biak ina thu zâwt tûrin, Ka dam chhûng zawnga Lalpa ina ka awm reng theihna tûr chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mangan ni chuan a bûktêah mi dah ru dâwn si a, A humhimna puan inah chuan mi thukru ang a; Lungpui chungah mi hlâng kai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah chuan mi dotu, mi hual vêltute chung lamah ka lû hi chawi kânin a awm ang; Tichuan, a puan inah chuan hlimna inthawinate ka hlân ang a; Ka zai ang, a ni, Lalpa fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka awa ka auh che chuan ngaithla ang che; Mi khawngaih la, mi chhâng bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Ka hmêl zawng rawh u,” tia i sawi lai khân ka thinlung chuan i hnênah, “ Lalpa , i hmêl ka zawng ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka lakah hian i hmai thup suh la; I chhiahhlawh hi thinurin tibo suh ang che; Nang chu mi ṭanpuitu i ni ṭhîn a; Aw, mi chhandamtu Pathian, mi paih thla suh la, mi kalsan lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka nu leh ka pa chuan mi kalsan ta si a, Nimahsela, Lalpa chuan mi la pawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i kawng chu mi entîr la; Ka hmêlmate avâng hian kalkawng phei takah mi hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi dotute duh duha tihah mi pe lul suh ang che; Hretu derten mi bei a, nunchhiat thu chhâk chhuak ṭhîntute chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi nung ramah hian Lalpa ṭhatna hmuh inring suh ila chuan ka chau tawh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chu nghâk reng rawh; Chak takin awm la, i thinlung chu intihuai rawh se; A ni, Lalpa chu nghâk reng rawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka koh dâwn che hi; Ka lungpui, ka lakah i beng chhu ngawng suh ang che; Chuti lo zawng, nangin mi ngawihsan chuan, Khuarkhuruma chhukte ang maiin ka lo awm dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka auh chea, ka kutte hi i biakna hmun thianghlim lama ka phar chuan, Khawngaih ka dîlna awte hi ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi suaksualte zîngah leh thil tisualtute zîngah chuan mi hnûk bo tel suh ang che; Chûnghote chuan an vêngte hnênah remna thu an sawi ṭhîn a; Nimahsela, an thinlungahte chuan suahsualna a awm reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thiltih ang zêl leh, an thiltihte a sualzia ang zêlin rûl la; An kuta an thawh ang zêlin rûl la; An sual man hmuhtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa hnathawhte leh a kuta a thiltih chu an ngaihsak loh avângin, Ani chuan anniho chu siam ṭha lovin a tichhia ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawngaih ka dilna awte hi a ngaihthlâk avângin Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka chakna leh ka phaw a ni a; Ka thinlung hian amah chu a ring a, tichuan, puihin ka awm a; Chuvângin, ka thinlung hi nasa takin a hlim a; Ka hlain amah ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu an chakna a ni a, A hriakthiha tân chuan chhandamna kulhbîng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I mite chu chhandam la, i ro chan chu malsâwm ang che; Anniho chu châwm la, kumkhuain pawm ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, mi thiltithei tak fate u, Lalpa hnênah pe ula; Lalpa hnênah chuan ropuina leh chakna pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah a hming ropuina chu pe ula; Thianghlim mawina inbelin, Lalpa chu chibai bûk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa aw chu tui chungahte chuan a ri a; Ropuina Pathian chu a lo ri dur dur a, Lalpa ngei chu tui tam tak chungahte a lo ri a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa aw chu thiltithei tak a ni a; Lalpa aw chu ropui tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa aw chuan sidar thingte chu a titliak ang a; A ni, Lalpa chuan Lebanon tlânga sidar thingte chu a titliak seng sung ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bâwngno tualchai angin a chêttîr ṭhîn a; Lebanon leh Sirion tlângte chu seleno ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa aw chuan mei alhte a phel ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa aw chuan thlalêr a nghawr nghîng a; Lalpa chuan Kadesh thlalêr chu a tinghîng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa aw chuan zukpuite chu no a chhiattîr a, Ngawpui thing hnahte chu a nuai kawlh vek ṭhîn; A biak inah chuan thil engkimin, “A ropui e,” an ti ṭheuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chu tuilêt lai khân lalah a ṭhu a, A ni, Lalpa chu kumkhua atân lalah a ṭhu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite hnênah chakna a pe ang a, Lalpa chuan a mite chu thlamuannain mal a sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka chawimawi ang che, nangin mi kai chhuak a, Mi dotute chu mi diriamtîr loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, Ka au chia, nangin mi tidam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin ka nunna hi Seol ata chu i hruai chhuak a; Khuarkhuruma ka chhuk lohna tûrin nangin mi humhim zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, a mi thianghlimte u, Lalpa fakin zai ula, A hming thianghlim chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thinur chu mit khap kâr chauh a ni si a; A duhsaknaah chuan nunna a awm ṭhîn; Ṭahna hi riak tûrin tlai lamah a lo lût thei a, Zîngah erawh chuan hlimna a lo thleng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei zawngin ka nun khaw nawm lai chuan, “Eng tikah mah ka nghîng lo vang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa , nangin i duhsakna avângin ka tlâng chu i lo din nghehtîr tawh a; Nimahsela, i hmai i thup a, ka lo mangan tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang ka au chia; Lalpa hnên ngeiah chuan khawngaihna ka dîl kha;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thi ila, leilâwtah chhuk ila, i tân hlâwkna eng nge awm? Vaivutin a fak dâwn che em ni? I thutak hi a hriattîr dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ngaithla la, mi khawngaih ang che; Lalpa , nang mi ṭanpuitu ni ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mitthi ngaihna chu ka tân lâmnaah i chantîr a; Ka saiip puan chu mi hlihsak a, hlimnain ka taiah mi hrêng ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka ropuina hi ngawi reng lova, nangmah faka a zaina tûrin. Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, kumkhuain lâwmthu ka hrilh fo vang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmahah chuan ka rinna ka nghat ṭhîn a; Eng tikah mah mualphovin mi awmtîr suh la, I felna avângin mi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lamah hian i beng rawn dawh la, mi chhan him thuai la; Ka tân lungpui nghet tak, mi chhandamna tûra humhimna in lo ni ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang chu ka lungpui leh ka kulhpui i ni si a; Chuvâng chuan, i hming avângin mi hruaiin mi kai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka awh nân a rûka lên an phah lakah hian mi hnûk chhuak ang che; Nang chu ka kulhbîng i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I kutah ka thlarau ka kawltîr e; Aw Lalpa , thutak Pathian, nangin mi tlan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thil lawilo mai maite ngaihsakho chu ka hua a; Kei erawh zawngin Lalpa ka ring a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I ngilneihna avâng hian ka hlimin ka lâwm ang, Ka manganna hi i hmu si ṭhîn a; Ka nunna hi a hrehawm laite pawhin i hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tin, mi dotu kutah nangin mi khung lo va; Ka ke hi hmun thâwl takah i nghat ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi khawngaih ang che, mangangin ka awm si a; Ka mit hi lungngaihna avângin a râwp telh telh a, a ni, ka nunna leh ka taksa lamin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng hi lungngaiin a ral ta si a, Ka kumte hi rûmin a ral ta bawk a ni; Ka khawlohna avângin ka tha a ṭhum a, Ka ruhte pawh a râwp zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi dotute avângin ka hming hi a lo chhe ta a, A ni, ka vêngte lakah nasa takin a chhe ta a ni, Ka hmêlhriatte tân pawh hlauhawm tak ka ni ta; Kawtlaia mi hmute lah khân mi tlânsan ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mitthi an theihnghilh ang takin theihnghilhin ka awm a, Bêl keh ang mai ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi tam tak mi hêkna ka hre si a, Ka vêla hlauhawm awm chu; Mi phiar ho lai khân, Ka nun mi lâksak an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , ka ring chia, “Ka Pathian i ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka hunte chu i kutah a awm a; Mi dotute kut ata leh, mi tiduhdahtute lakah hian mi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hmêlin i chhiahhlawh hi han chhun êng la, I ngilneihna avângin mi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mualphovin mi awmtîr suh ang che, ka ko si chia; Mi suaksualte chu mualphovin awm sela, Seol-ah ngawi rengin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hmui dawtheite chu ṭawng thei lovin awm rawh se; Chûngte chuan chapo leh hmusit chungin, Ṭawng chaltlai takin mi fel an sawi chhe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, i ṭhatna, nangmah ṭihtute tâna i khâwl khâwm chu a va ropui êm! Mihring fate mit hmuha nangmaha rinna nghatte tâna i tihsak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni chu mihring phiarna lakah chuan i humhimna mit hmuhah i thukru ang a, Lei hnialhrâtna lakah chuan bûktêah i dah ru ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se, A ngilneihna mak tak chu khawpui nghet takah mi hmuhtîr si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kei lah chuan, ka hamhaihin, “I mit hmuh ata paih bovin ka awm ta,” ka lo ti ta mai a; Nimahsela, ka auh che khân, khawngaih ka dîlna awte kha i lo hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw, a mi thianghlim zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chu hmangaih rawh u; Lalpa chuan mi rinawm chu a humhim a, Chapo taka titu chu nasa takin a rûl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa beisei zawng zawngte u, Chak takin awm ula, in thinlung chu intihuai rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="32" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A bawhchhiatna ngaihdama awma, A sualna hliahkhuha awma chu, a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi, Lalpan khawlohna neia a ruat lohva, A thlarauva tihderna rêng rêng awm lova chu a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ngawih reng lai khân, nilênga ka rûm ṭhinna lamah ka ruhte hi a chang zo vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A chhûn a zânin i kutin mi delh si a, Ka taksa hnâwnna pawh, ṭhâl rumin thil a tidanglam angin, a lo danglam tâk hial kha. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka sualna chu i hnênah ka puang a, Ka khawlohna chu ka zêp ta lo va: “Ka bawhchhiatna chu Lalpa hnênah thupha ka chawitawh ang,” ka ti a; Tichuan, ka sual khawlohna chu i lo ngaihdam tâk kha. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan, Pathian ngaihsak mi tin chu zawn hmuh awla i awm laiin i hnênah ṭawngṭai ṭheuh rawh se; Tui liante chu a lo liam hun chuan anni chu a chîm pha ṭhuai dâwn lo nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang chu ka bihrûkna hmun i ni a; Nang chuan manganna lakah mi humhim ang a; Chhanhimna hlatein mi hual vêltîr ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Fing taka awmtîr chein i kalna tûr kawng chu ka entîr ang chia; Ka mita en reng chung chein rem ka ruatsak zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngaihtuahna nei hlei lo sakawr emaw, sabengtung emaw angin awm suh u; Chûng chuan thunun nân lakam thîr barh leh hrui an ngai a; Chuti lo chuan, i kiangah an lo kal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi suaksual tân chuan lungngaihna tam tak a awm ang a; Lalpa ringtu erawh chu ngilneihnain a hual vêl zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi felte u, Lalpa -ah chuan hlimin lâwm ula; Thinlung dik tak pu zawng zawngte u, hlimin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="33" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, mi felte u, Lalpa -ah chuan hlimin zai rawh u; Mi dik tân chuan Pathian fak hi a âwm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ṭingṭangin Lalpa hnênah chuan lâwmthu sawi ula, Perhkhuang hrui sâwm nei mi nên amah fakin zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Amah chawimawiin hla thar sa ula, Thâwm nasa tak nên thiam takin tum rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa thu chu a dik a, A thiltih zawng zawng chu rinawm taka tih a ni si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Felna leh rorêlna fel hi a ngaina ṭhîn a, Leilung hi Lalpa ngilneihnain a khat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa thuin vânte chu siam a ni a; Chûnga awmho zawng zawngte pawh chu a kâa thaw chuan siam an ni bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan tuifinriat tuite chu englo dah khâwm thûr angin a tikhâwm a; Tui thûk takte chu dah khâwmna inahte a dah ṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Leilung luah zawng zawng chuan Lalpa chu ṭih sela; Khawvêla awm zawng zawng chu amah hlauvin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan a sawi a, a lo awm ta a; Thu a pe a, a lo awm nghet ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpan hnam tin remruat chu eng mah lovah a chantîr a; Mi tin ngaihtuahte chu eng mah sâwtna nei lovin a siam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa remruat erawh chu kumkhuain a awm nghet ang a, A thinlunga a ngaihtuahte chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a awm nghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa Pathiana nei hnam chu an eng a thâwl e; Ama ro chana a thlan mite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan vân aṭang khian a thlîr a; Mihring fate zawng zawng hi a hmu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Leia awm zawng zawng hi a awmna hmun aṭang khian a rawn thlîr ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An zaa thinlung siam ṭhîna, An thiltih zawng zawng ngaihtuah ṭhîntu chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lal rêng rêng hi sipaiho tam vâng ngawta chhandama awm an awm ngai lo; Mi chak hi chak êm êm vâng ngawtin chhan him an ni ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sakawr hi inchhandam nân eng mah a ni lo va, A chak êm êm avâng maiin tu mah a chhan him hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa mit chu amah ṭihtute chungah chuan a fu reng ṭhîn a, A ngilneihna beiseitute chungah chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An nunna thihna laka chhan him tûr leh, Ṭâm tlâka anmahni tungnung tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan nunna hian Lalpa a nghâk reng a; Ani chu min ṭanpuitu leh kan phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Amahah chuan kan thinlung hi a hlim dâwn a ni, A hming thianghlim kan rin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna chu kan chungah awm rawh se, Kan beisei ang zêl chein.
  </para>
  <chapter number="34" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Eng lai pawhin Lalpa chu ka fak ang a; Amah fakna chu ka kâah a chhuak fo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna hian Lalpa chu a chhuang ang a; Thuhnuairawlhte chuan chu chu an hria ang a, an lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa chu mi fakpui ula, A hming chu i chawimawi tlâng ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka zawng a; tin, ani chuan mi chhâng a, Ka hlauh zâwng zawng zawng lakah chuan mi chhan him ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah an en a; tin, an lo êng ta a; An hmêlte chu eng tikah mah a zak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He mi rethei hi a au va; tin, Lalpa chuan a hria a, A manganna zawng zawngah chuan a chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amah ṭihtute chu, an vêlah Lalpa vântirhkoh chuan a awm chilh a, A chhan him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa ṭhatzia chu tem chhin teh rêng u; Amaha rinna nghat mi chu a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, a mi thianghlimte u, Lalpa chu ṭih rawh u! Amah ṭihtute tân chuan tlâkchhamna rêng rêng a awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sakeibaknei vânglaite chu an tlachhamin an ril a ṭâm ṭhîn a; Lalpa zawngtute erawh chuan thil ṭha rêng rêng an tlachham lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hawh u, naupangte u, ka thu ngaithla rawh u; Lalpa ṭih dân ka lo zirtîr ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ṭhatna a hmuh theih nâna nunna duha, Dam rei ngaina mi chu tu nge ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I lei chu sual lakah vêng ṭha la, I hmui chu tihderna thu sawi lo tûrin vêng ṭha rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Sual kalsan la, thil ṭha ti rawh; Remna zawng la, a ûmin ûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa mit chuan mi felte lam a en ṭhîn a, A beng chuan an au hre tûrin a ngaithla reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa hmêl chuan thil tisualtute chu a do ṭhîn. Anmahni hriat rengna chu lei ata tiboral tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi felte chu an au va; tin, Lalpa chuan a lo hria a, An manganna zawng zawngah chuan a chhan chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thinlunga lungchhiate chu a hnaih ṭhîn a, Rilrua inchhîr apiangte chu a chhandam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi fel hrehawmnate chu a tam a; Nimahsela, Lalpan chûng zawng zawngah chuan a chhan chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A ruh zawng zawng a vawng ṭha a, Pakhat mah tihtliah a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thil ṭha lovin mi suaksualte chu a tihlum ang a, Mi fel hawtute chuan thiam loh an chang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhiahhlawhte nunna chu a tlan ṭhîn a, Amaha rinna nghatte chu pakhat mah thiam loh chang an awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="35" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi beitute chu nangin bei la; Mi dotute chu nangin do vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Phaw tê leh phaw lian chelh la, Mi ṭanpui tûrin ding ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Fei pawh phawi la, mi ûmtute kawng lo dang la; Ka nunna hnênah hian, “I chhandamtu ka ni e,” ti ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nunna tihbo tuma zawngtute chu, tihmualphova tihzahin awm sela; Mi tihchhiatna tûr suangtuahtute chu tlânchhiattîrin, hrilhhai takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkohvina khalh zêl siin, Buhsî, thli len angin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa vântirhkohvina ûm zêl siin, An kawng chu thim tak leh nâl tak ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A vâng awm lovin mi awh nân an lên chu khuarkhurumah an phah ru a, A vâng awm lovin ka nunna tlâk nân khuarkhurum an lai si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A inrin loh hlânin chhiatna a chungah thleng sela; A lên phah rûkah khân amah ngei âwk bawk sela, Chumiah chuan tla chhe rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, ka nunna hi Lalpa -ah chuan a hlim ang a; A chhandamnaah chuan a lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ruh zawng zawng hian, “ Lalpa , mi rethei a khin zawh rual loh laka chhanhimtu, A ni, rethei leh pachhia, a ram ṭhîntu laka chhanhimtu, Nang ang rêng rêng tu nge awm?” a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hretu fel lo takte an lo tho va; Ka thil hriat hauh loh thûahte mi chhâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nunnain thil chân khawpin, thil ṭha, thil sualin mi rûl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei erawh chuan an dam loh laiin saiip puan ka sin a, Chaw ngheia intiretheiin ka ṭawngṭai a; Nimahsela, ka ṭawngṭaina chu chhân lohvin ka hnênah a lo lêt leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Keima ṭhian emaw, ka unau ngei emaw chunga ka awm dân tûr ang maiin ka awm a, Mahni nu sûna ṭap ang maiin anmahni sûnin ka kaikûn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei ka bai chuan anni chu an lâwm zâwk a, an inkhâwm hial a; Mi sual mai maite chu mi bei tûrin an inkhâwm a, chu chu ka lo hre si lo va; Bâng duh lovin mi sawisa nek a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ruai ṭhehnatea nuihza fiamthu sawitute mai mai angin an ha mi ṭhial khum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa , nangin eng chen nge i en dâwn le? Ka nunna hi tihchhiat an tumna lakahte chuan chhan chhuak la, Ka neih chhun tak hi sakeibaknei lakahte chuan chhan chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Inkhâwmna ropui takah chuan lâwmthu ka hrilh ang chia, Mi tam tak zîngah ka fak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka hmêlmate chuan dik lo takah mi diriam suh se; Enga khaw lawilova mi hawtute chu an mitin inbe hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Remna thu rêng an sawi si lo va, He rama awm hle hlete bumna thute an suangtuah zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A ni, an kâin mi ân khum huau va, “Chei! Chei! Kan mitin kan hmu ta,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin i hmu e, ngawihsan suh ang che. Aw Lalpa , mi hlat lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ka Pathian leh ka Lalpa , ka rorêl tûrin, A ni, ka thûa mi ṭan tûrin intiharh la, meng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, i felna avângin ro mi rêl la; Anni chuan mi diriam suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An rilru chuan, “Chei! Chutiang chu alâwm kan duh ni,” ti suh se; “Ani chu kan lem zo ta,” ti hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka chhiatna chunga lâwmte chu mualpho tak leh hrilhhai takin awm hlawm sela; Ka chunga intiliante chu mualphona leh zahna sintîrin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka felna chunga lâwmte chu hlima auvin lâwm takin awm sela; A ni, “A chhiahhlawh vânneihna chunga lâwm ṭhîn Lalpa chu chawimawiin awm rawh se,” ti fo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tichuan, ka lei hian felna thu a sawi ang a, I fakna thu pawh nilêngin a sawi bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="36" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi suaksual bawhchhiatna chuan ka thinlung chhûngah hian thu a sawi a, “A mit hmuhah Pathian hlauhna rêng rêng a awm lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka khawlohna an hmu chhuak lo vang, an haw hlei lo vang e,” tiin, Mahni mit hmuhah mahni vêk a infak chawp si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kâa thuchhuakte chu sualna leh bumna thu hlîr a ni ṭhîn a; Finvâr leh thil ṭha tih a bâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A khumlaizâwlah chuan thil sual a suangtuah ṭhîn a; Kawng ṭha lovah chuan a kal lui a, sualna chu a ten lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna chu vânahte khian a awm a; I rinawmna chuan vân dumte khi a tawng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I felna chu Pathian tlângte ang a ni a; I rorêlte chu tui thûk zau tak ang a ni; Aw Lalpa , mihring leh sa i humhim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i ngilneihna chu a va hlu êm! Mihring fate chuan i thla hnuai an chuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Anni chu i in chhûng thil ṭhain an tlai êm êm ang a; I lâwmna luia mi chu i intîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nunna tuikhur chu i hnênah a awm si a; I êngah chuan êng kan la hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw, nangmah hretute chungah chuan i ngilneihna chu lantîr zêl la; Thinlung dik tak pute chungah pawh i felna chu lantîr zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chapo ke chu mi bei tûrin ka lamah pên suh sela, Mi suaksual kut pawhin mi hnawt bo suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sawtah sâwn thil tisualtute chu an tlu reng a; Nam thlûk an ni a, an tho thei tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="37" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo titute avângin intilungngai duh suh la, Fel lo taka tite chu awt hek suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hlobet angin ah thlûkin an awm thuai ang a, Hnim hring angin an vuai dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu ring la, thil ṭha ti rawh; He ramah hian awm la, rinawmna ûm zêl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chungah chuan lâwm bawk rawh; Tichuan, i thinlung duh zâwngte chu a pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I awm dân tûr chu Lalpa chungah nghat la; Amah chu ring la, aman a ti vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I felzia chu êng angin a chhuahtîr ang a, I thiam chanzia pawh chhûn lai ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa -ah chuan châwl la, amah chu nghâk fan fan rawh; A awm dâna vânneihna dawngtu avângin intilungngai duh suh, Ngaihtuahna sualte puitlintu avâng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thinur hi bânsan la, thinrim hi sim rawh, Intilungngai duh suh, thil tihsualah a lo tlâk mai ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo titute chu tihboralin an awm dâwn si a; Lalpa nghâktute erawh chuan ram hi an luah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rei lo tê achinah mi suaksual chu a awm tawh dâwn si lo; A ni, a awmna hmun chu en en mah la, a awm tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte erawh chuan ram hi an luah ang a, Remna chênin an hmuingîl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan mi fel a phiar a, A hâ a ṭhial khum ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ani chu a nuihsan ang, A nî a lo thleng dâwn tih a hriat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Rethei leh pachhiate tithlum tûr leh awm dân dikte tihlum tûrin, Mi suaksualte chuan khandaih an phawi a, an thal ngul an kuai bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An khandaih chuan anmahni thinlung chu a chhun ang a, An thal ngulte chu tihtliahin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi fel thil tlêm tê neih chu mi suaksual thil tam tak neih rei rui ai chuan a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi suaksual bânte chu tihtliahin a awm dâwn si a; Mi fel erawh chu Lalpan a chelh reng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi ṭha famkim nite chu a hria a, A rochun tûr chu kumkhuaa awm reng tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hun ṭha lovah an mualpho lo vang a, Ṭâm kumahte pawh an puar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi suaksualte erawh chu an boral ang a, Lalpa dotute pawh phûl hnim duah ang an ni ang. Tihboralin an awm ang a, meikhuah an zâm ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan a pûk a, a pe leh ṭhîn lo va; Mi fel erawh chuan mi a khawngaih a, a pe zâwk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A malsâwmna dawngtute chuan ram hi an luah dâwn a, A ânchhe lawh dawngtute chu tihboralin an awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lalpa chuan an kalna tûrah a hruai ṭhîn a, A duh zâwng titute chu a vêng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tlu mah sela, an tlu hlen lo vang, Lalpan a kutin a chelh reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Naupang ka lo ni tawh a, tûnah tar ka lo ni ta a; Nimahsela, mi fel chu kalsana a awm ka hmu ngai lo va, A thlahte chaw khawn pawh ka hmu ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nilêngin mi a khawngaih a, a pûktîr ṭhîn a; A thlahte pawh an eng a thâwl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sual kalsan la, thil ṭha ti rawh; Tichuan, kumkhuain chêng reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Lalpa chuan rorêlna fel a ngaina si a. A mi thianghlimte chu a kalsan ngai lo; Kumkhua atân vawn ṭhatin an awm a, Mi suaksual thlahte erawh chu tihboralin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi felte chuan ram hi an luah ang a, A chhûngah hian kumkhuain an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi fel kâ chuan finna thu a sawi ṭhîn a, A lei chuan rorêl felna thu a sawi bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A Pathian dân chu a thinlungah a awm a, A pênsan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan mi fel chu a enthla a, Tihhlum a tum ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpan ani chu a kutah a kalsan lo vang a, A ro an rêl hunah chuan thiam loh chantîr a phal hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpa chu nghâk la, a kawng chu zawh rawh; Tichuan, ram hi luah tûrin a chawimawi ang che; Mi suaksualte tihborala an awm lai chu i la hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi suaksual chu nasa taka thu neia, A ṭona hmuna thing chawr duah hluah anga a ṭawi bum lai ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, kawngah mi a va kal a; tin, ngai teh, ani chu a lo awm ta lo mai a; A ni, ka zawng a; nimahsela, hmuh theih a ni ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Mi sawisêl bo chu chhinchhiah la, mi dik tak chu en rawh, Chutiang mi tâwpna tûr chu thlamuanna a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bawhchhetute erawh chu a ruala tihchhiatin an awm hlawm ang a, Mi suaksualte tâwpna chu boralna a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Amaherawhchu, mi felte chhandamna chu Lalpa lak ata a ni a; Ani chu mangan laia an kulhbîng a ni ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Lalpan anni chu a ṭanpuiin a chhan him ṭhîn a, Amahah chuan an tlûk luh avângin mi suaksualte lakah chuan a chhanhimin a chhandam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="38" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , thinurin mi zilhhau suh la, Thinrimin mi thunun hek suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I thalte chu ka pangah a bûr tlat a, I kutin mi nem tlawk tlawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I lungnih lohna avângin ka tisaah hian dam lai rêng a awm lo va; Ka sualna avângin ka ruhahte hian hrisêl lai rêng a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka khawlohnate chuan ka lû hi a chîm pil a, Phur rit tak ang, ka zawh rual loh hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka âtna avângin Ka pemte hi a uihin a khawlo zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nâ a, ka kun tlawk tlawk a; Nilêngin lungngaiin ka vân ruai ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka kâwng hi a sa hluah hluah vek a, Ka tisaah pawh hian dam lai rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka chau va, ka sil ûrh a; Ka thinlung nawm lohna avângin ka rûm vak vak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , ka duh zâwng zawng zawng hi i hmaah a awm vek a; Ka rûm pawh hi i lakah thuhrûk a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thin hi a phu hlawp hlawp a, thahrui ka nei ta lo va; Ka mit vârna lah chuan mi awm lohsan ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi hmangaihtute leh ka ṭhiante chu ka thil vei lakah hian an inthiarfihlîm ṭhîn a; Ka laichînte pawh hla takah an ding ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka nunna tihbo tuma zawngtute chuan mi awh nân thangte an kam ṭhîn a; Ka chhiatna tûr zawngtute pawh chuan thu ṭha lo takte an sawi a, Nilêngin bumna thute an ngaihtuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chu mi bengngawng angin hre lovin ka awm a; Ṭawng thei lo mi, kâ âng ngai lo angin ka awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ni, mi ṭawng hre thei lo, A kâa zilhhauna rêng chhuak ngai lo angin ka awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmah ka beisei si chia; Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, nangin mi chhâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Chuti lo chuan, mi diriam ang a, Ka ke a tleu veleh ka chungah an intilian dah ang e,” ka ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka bai dâwn dâwn si a, Ka lungngaihna pawh ka hmaah a awm fo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka khawlohna chu ka puang ang a; Ka sualna avânga lungngaiin ka awm dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, mi dotute chu an thothâng a ṭhain,an chak a; Dik lo taka mi hawtute chu an pung ta luai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thil ṭha thil suala rûl ṭhîntute hi Thil ṭha ka ûm avângin mi dotute an ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi kalsan lul suh la; Aw ka Pathian, mi hlat lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi chhandamtu, Mi ṭanpui tûrin hmanhmawh ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="39" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka lei hian thil ka tihsual lohna tûrin, Ka awm dânte hi ka vêng ṭha ang a; Mi suaksualte ka hmaa an awm chhûng zawng, Ka kâ hi hmui phuarnain ka phuar ang,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutichuan, ngawi rengin, ṭawng lovin ka awm a, A ṭha lamah pawh ka ngawi reng a; Nimahsela, ka lungngaihna chu chawhthawhin a awm zâwk mah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kawchhûngah hian ka thinlung a sa huam huam a; Ka ngaihtuah ka ngaihtuah chuan mei chu a alh chhuak a; Tin, ka lei hian thu ka sawi ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“ Lalpa , ka tâwpna tûr leh, ka dam chin tûr chu engtin nge ni tih mi hriattîr la; Ka derdêpzia hi mi hriattîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, ka dam chhûng hi kutphah bawk lekin i siam a; Ka kum hi i mit hmuhah chuan eng mah tham a ni lo va; Mi tin hi an ṭhat lai ber pawhin an pumin eng mah lo mai an ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tin hi hlim angin an lêng tak meuh va; An buai thlâwn tak meuh ṭhîn a ni; Ro a khâwl khâwm ṭhîn a, a khâwmtu tûr a hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa , tûnah eng nge ka nghah le? Nangmahah a ni ka beiseina a awm ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka bawhchhiatna zawng zawng lakah mi chhan chhuak la; Mi â sawichhiatin mi awmtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nangma tih a nih avângin ka ṭawng lo va, ka kâ ka âng hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I mi vuakna hi ka hnên ata mi lâk sawnsak la; I kutthlâka tihboral ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi a bawhchhiatna avânga zilhhaunatea i thunun hian, A duhawmna hi sûlrûl angin i tichhe ṭhîn a; Mi tin hi eng mah lo mai an ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla la, ka auhnaah hian beng chhi la; Ka mittui tla hi ngawihsan suh ang che. I mikhual ka ni a, Mi thlahtute zawng zawng ang khân pêm mai ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, heta ta ka chhuaha, ka awm loh hlen daih hma hian, Ka harh lehna tûrin mi zuah ang che.”
  </para>
  <chapter number="40" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka nghâk fan fan a; Tichuan, anin mi rawn thlêk a, ka au chu a ngaithla ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Boralna khuarkhurum ata, chirhdûp ban tak ata chu mi khai chhuak ta bawk a; Tin, ka ke chu lungpui chungah a nghat a, ka ke pênte chu a tinghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hla thar ka kâah a dah ta bawk a, kan Pathian fakna chu; Mi tam takin chûng chu an hmu ang a, an hlau vang a, Lalpa chu an ring tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu a rinchhana neia, Chapote leh dâwt lama pêngte ngaihsak lo mi chu, a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka Pathian, nangin thilmak i tihte leh, Keimahni lam i ngaihtuahnate hi a tam êm êm mai a, Chûng chu i hmaa tihlan sên rual a ni lo va; Hriattîrin hril dâwn ila, Chhiar sên rual a ni lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Inthawina leh thilhlan chungah hian lâwmna rêng i nei lo va; Ka bengte hi mi tih-âwngsak ta a. Hâlral thilhlan leh sual tâna thilhlan chu i phût lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chu veleh chuan keiin, “Ngai teh, ka lo kal e; Lehkhabu zialah chuan ka thu ziak a ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, i duh zâwng tih hi ka lâwm zâwng tak a ni; A ni, i dân thu chu ka thinlungah a awm reng e,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Inkhâwmna ropui takah chuan felna Chanchin Ṭha ka tlângaupui a; Aw Lalpa , ngai teh, Ka kâ hi ka ui lo vang tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I felna chu ka thinlung chhûngah ka zêp lo va; I rinawmna leh i chhandamna thu chu ka tlângaupui zâwk a; I ngilneihna leh i takna chu inkhâwmna ropui taka mite lakah chuan ka thup lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i lainatnate chu ka lakah ui suh la; I ngilneihna leh i takna chuan mi humhim fo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo chhiar sên loh chuan mi hual vêl si a, Ka khawlohnate chuan mi ûm phâk a; chutichuan, ka dâk thei ta lo va; Chûng chu ka samzaite ai hian a tam zâwk a, ka thinlung hi a chau ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin mi chhan him la; Aw Lalpa , mi ṭanpui tûrin hmanhmawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka nunna tihbo tuma zawngtute chu, Mualpho tak leh zak takin awm hlawm sela; Ka chhiatna chunga lâwmte chu hawi kîrtîrin tihzahin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Chei! Chei!” mi titute chu an mualpho avângin mangang takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A zawngtu che zawng zawng chu nangmahah chuan hlim tak leh lâwm takin awm sela; I chhandamna ngainatute chuan, Lalpa chu chawimawiin awm rawh se,” ti fo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei zawng rethei leh pachhe tak ka ni a, Nimahsela, Lalpan mi ngaihtuah ṭhîn a. Nang chu mi ṭanpuitu leh mi chhanhimtu i ni a; Aw ka Pathian, rei rial lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="41" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Retheite ngaihtuah mi chu a eng a thâwl e, Mangan ni chuan Lalpan ani chu a chhan him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpan ani chu humhimin a tinung ang a, leiah hian malsâwmin a awm ang; Amah dotute duh duha tihah pe suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan a chauhna mut hmunah chuan a tichak ang a; Nangin a damloh laiin a mutna i siamsak vek ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Keiin, “Aw Lalpa , mi khawngaih la, Ka nunna hi tidam ang che, i chungah thil ka tisual si a,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi dotute chuan, “Eng tikah nge a thih ang a, a hming a bo vang?” tiin, Mi sawi chhe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tin, an zînga tuin emaw mi rawn kan lahin, thu eng mah lo mai mai a sawi ṭhîn a; A thinlung chuan sualna a la khâwm ṭhîn a; A kal chhuah veleh mi a hrilh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi hawtute zawng zawng chuan mi hêkna thu sêsêin an la a; Mi tihchhiatna tûr an suangtuah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Natna ṭha lo takin a tlâkbuak ta a; Tûna a mu hi a tho leh tawh lo vang,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A ni, ka ṭhian kawmngeih, ka rin tak, Ka chhang eipui ngei chuan a keartui ka chungah a lek ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , nangin mi khawngaih la, Anmahni ka thungrulh theihna tûrin mi kai tho leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hemiah hian ka chungah i lâwm tih ka hria, Mi dotu chuan mi ngam ṭhin loh avâng hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kei zawng rilru ṭha tak ka putnaah hian nangin mi chelh reng a, A hmaah chuan kumkhua atân mi dah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa , Israela Pathian chu, Chatuan ata chatuan thlengin fakin awm rawh se. Amen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="42" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sakhi, luite tui châka a thaw huam huam ang hian, Aw Pathian, ka nunna hi nangmah châkin a thaw huam huam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna hi Pathian châkin, Pathian nung châkin a tuihâl a ni. Eng tikah nge Pathian hma ka thlen anga, ka inlan ang aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mittui hi a chhûn a zânin ka chaw a ni. “Khawiah nge i Pathian le?” mi lo ti châmchi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hêng thil hi ka hre reng a, ka nunna hi ka chhûngah ka leih bua a, Mipui zînga ka kala, hlimna leh fakna ri nêna mi tam tak kût, Pathian biak in pana an hma ka hruai ṭhinziate kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, engah nge i kun reng? Engah nge ka chhûngah hian i buai ni? Pathian beisei rawh; a hmêla damna avângin amah chu ka la fak dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, ka nunna hi ka chhûngah hian a kun reng a; Chuvângin, Jordan leh Hermon ram aṭang te, Mizar tlâng aṭang te hian ka hre reng che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I tui luang ri dur durahte hian tui thûk leh tui thûk chu an inau va; I tuifâwn leh i tui inchhawk zawng zawngte chuan mi vûr pil ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpan a ngilneihna chu chhûnah thu a pe ang a, A hla chuan zânah mi awmpui ang, Ka nunna Pathian hnêna ṭawngṭaina chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian, ka lungpui hnênah chuan, “Engah nge mi theihnghilh le? Engah nge dotu hnehchhiahna avânga lungngaia ka vân ruai ṭhin le?” ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ruha khandaih awm ang maiin mi dotute chuan mi sawi chhe ṭhîn a; “Khawiah nge i Pathian le?” mi lo ti châmchi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, engah nge i kun reng? Engah nge ka chhûngah hian i buai ni? Pathian beisei rawh; amah chu ka la fak dâwn si a, Ka hmêl tidamtu leh ka Pathian chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="43" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ro mi rêl la, Pathian ngaihsak lo hnam chungah hian ka thu mi sawipui ang che; Aw, mi bum hmang mi dik lo lakah hian mi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang chu ka chakna Pathian i ni si a; engah nge mi thlauhthlâk le? Engah nge dotu hnehchhiahna avânga lungngaia ka vân ruai ṭhin le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, i êng leh i thutak chu tîr chhuak la, anni chuan mi hruai sela; I tlâng thianghlim leh i awmnate chu mi thlen rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutichuan, Pathian maichâm kiangah ka kal ang, Pathian, ka hlim êm êmna kiangah chuan; Aw Pathian, ka Pathian, ṭingṭangin ka fak bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, engah nge i kun reng? Engah nge ka chhûngah hian i buai ni? Pathian beisei rawh; amah chu ka la fak dâwn si a, Ka hmêl tidamtu leh ka Pathian chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="44" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, hmasânga an dam laia i thiltihte kha Min thlahtuten min hrilh, kan bengin kan hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangin i kut ngeiin hnam tin chu i hnawt chhuak a, anni chu i phun ta thung a; Mi tin chu i tirethei a, anni chu i zâr zautîr ta thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram hi luah tûra anmahni khandaiha an lâk a ni lo va, Anmahni bâna inchhandam an ni hek lo; An chunga i lâwm avângin I kut ding lam leh, i bân leh, i hmêl êngin a ni zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chu ka Lal i ni; Jakoba chhan him nân thu pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah avângin min dotute chu kan si thlu ang a; I hming avângin min beitute chu kan chîl nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka thal ngul hi ka ring dâwn si lo va, Ka khandaih hian mi chhandam hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi dotute lakah chuan nangin min chhandam ta zâwk a, Min hawtute chu i timualpho ta bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nilêngin Pathian kan chhuang a, I hming chu kumkhuain kan fak bawk ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tûnah erawh chuan nangin min thlauthla a, min tizak a; Kan sipaiho hnênah lah i chhuak ve ta ngai lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dotute lakah chuan min tlânchhiattîr ṭhîn a, Min hawtute chuan sum chu an duh duh an la ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Berâm talh tûr angin min dah a, Hnam tin zîngah min tidarh bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I mite hi eng mah lovah i hralh a, An man chu i hausakpui chuang si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangin kan vêla mite sawichhiatin min awmtîr a, Kan dep vêla mite hmuhsit leh nuihsanin min awmtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nangin hnam tin zîngah a chhe lam tehkhinnaah min awmtîr a, Mi tin zînga mite lû thinsanin min awmtîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka zahna hi nilêngin ka hmaah a awm ṭhîn a, Ka mualphona hian mi khuh zo ta,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sawihnâwmtu leh sawi chhetu aw avâng leh, Hmêlma leh phuba latu avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chu kan chungah a thleng a; Nimahsela, kan theihnghilh ngai lo chia, I thuthlungah hian a derin kan ti ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan thinlung hi a hawi kîr lo va, Kan ke pênte hian i kawng chu a pênsan ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangin sihalte awmnaah min sawisak neka, Thihna daihlima min khuhna tûr hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Kan Pathian hming kan theihnghilh emaw, Ram dang pathian lama kan kutte kan phar emaw chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathianin chu chu a zawng chhuak lo vang em ni? Thinlunga thurûkte hi a hre reng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A ni, nangmah avângin nilêngin thahin kan awm ṭhîn; Berâm talh tûrte anga ngaih kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , harh ta che, engah nge i muthilh ni? Meng la, kumkhua chuan min thlauthla suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Eng vângin nge i hmai i thupa, Kan hrehawmzia leh hnehchhiah kan tuarzia hi i theihnghilh ṭhin ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kan nunna hi vaivut siin a kûn a; Kan pum lah leiah a bet tlat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Min ṭanpui tûrin tho la, I ngilneihna avângin min tlan ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="45" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi thil ṭhain a liam zawih zawih a; Lalber chungchâng thûa ka thil phuah chu ka sawi dâwn e; Ka lei hi lehkha ziak thiam tak kawlawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihring fate ai hian i hmêl a ṭha zâwk a; Khawngaihna hi i hmuiah leih a ni; Chuvângin, Pathianin kumkhua atân mal a sâwm che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, mi chak, i khandaih chu i kâwngah vawng rawh, I ropuina leh i mawina nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thutak leh thuhnuairawlhna leh felna avângin, I mawina inbelin hmuingîl takin sakawr chunga chuangin kal zêl ang che; Tichuan, i kut ding lamin thil râpthlâk takte a zirtîr dâwn che nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thal chu a zum a, Lalber dotute thinlungah chuan a bûr reng a; Mi tin chu i hnuaiah an tlu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i lalṭhutphah chu chatuanin a awm tûr a ni; Thlei bîk neih lohna lal tiang chu i ram lal tiang chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Felna chu i ngaina a, suahsualna chu i huat kha; Chuvângin, Pathian, i Pathian chuan, i ṭhiante aia nasain hlimna hriak a thih tâk che hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I silhfên zawng zawng chu murra rim te, aloe rim te, thakthîng rim te a nam rum rum a; Sainghova siam lal intea ṭingṭang chi hrang hrang ri lo chhuakte chuan a tihlim che a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I hmeichhe ṭhate zîngah chuan lalho fanute an tel ve a; I ding lamah chuan Ophir rangkachaka incheiin lalnu chu a ding a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw ka fanu, ngaithla la, ngaihtuah la, beng chhi rawh; I mite leh i pa ina mite chu theihnghilh rawh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, lalberin i hmêl ṭha tak hi a duh dâwn nia; Ani chu i Lalpa a ni si a; tichuan, amah chu chibai bûk ṭhîn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tura fanu chu thilpêk kengin chutah chuan a awm ang a; Mi zînga hausate ngei chuan i khawngaihna an ngên ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lal in chhûnga lal fanu chu a ropui vêl vek a; A silhfên chu rangkachaka zeh mawi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Puan ṭhui mawi sinin lalber hnênah an hruai ang a; Amah zuitu, a ṭhian nulahote chu I hnênah an hruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lâwm tak leh hlim takin an hruai ang a; Lalber inah chuan an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I pate aiah i fate an awm ang a, Anni chu lei chung zawng zawngah hian mi lianah i siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I hming hi chhuan zawng zawngah hian hriat reng tûrin ka siam ang a; Tichuan, mi tinin kumkhaw tlaitluanin lâwmthu an hrilh ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="46" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chu kan inhumhimna leh kan chakna, Mangan laia ṭanpui vartu hnai reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, leilung hi lo danglamin, Tlângte hi tuifinriat chhûng daihah insawn mah sela, kan hlau lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A tuite chu ri hum humin phûl bulh bulh mah sela, A fâwn nasat avângin tlângte hi nghîng dur dur mah sela, kan hlau chuang hek lo vang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lui pakhat a awm a, chumi pêngte chuan Pathian khawpui chu a tilâwm ṭhîn, Chungnungbera awmna hmun thianghlim chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chu a lai takah a awm a, a nghîng lo vang a; Pathianin khawfîng chah hunah chuan a ṭanpui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam tin an ri hum hum a, ramte chu a nghîng a; Ani chuan a aw a chhuah a, leilung hi a lo tui zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chu kan hnênah a awm a; Jakoba Pathian chu kan kulhbîng sâng a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hawh u, Lalpa thiltihte hi en rawh u, Leilunga thil a tihchhiatziate hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan indonate chu kâwlkil thlengin a tireh ṭhîn a; Thal ngul chu a titliak a, fei chu a sât bung ṭhîn a; Tawlailîrte chu meiah a rawh ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngawi ula, Pathian ka ni tih hi hre rawh u: Hnam tin zîngah chawimawiin ka awm ang a, leiah hian chawimawiin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa chu kan hnênah a awm a; Jakoba Pathian chu kan kulhbîng sâng a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <chapter number="47" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, mi tinrêngte u, in kut bêng ula; Hlimna awin Pathian hnênah au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa Chungnungbera chu a hlauhawm si a; Lei chung zawng zawnga Lal ropui tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan mi tin chu kan hnuaiah a tudawl ang a, Hnam tin chu kan ke hnuaiah a tudawl bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan kan roluah tûr chu min thlansak ang, A hmangaih Jakoba chhuan ber ram chu. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian chu au thâwm nên a chho va, Lalpa chu tawtawrâwt ri nên a chho ta e,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian fakin zai ula, fakin zai rawh u; Kan Lalber fakin zai ula, fakin zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chu khawvêl zawng zawng Lal a ni si a; Hre thiama fakin zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian chu hnam tin chungah lalah a ṭhu a; Pathian chu a lalṭhutphah thianghlimah chuan a ṭhu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abrahama Pathian mite ni tûrin, Mi tin zînga mi liante chu an awm khâwm a; Leilung phawte chu Pathian ta a ni si a; Ani chu nasa taka chawimawiin a awm.
  </para>
  <chapter number="48" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ropui a, nasa taka fak tûr a ni, Kan Pathian khawpuiah, a tlâng thianghlimah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sânziaa mawi tak, khawvêl zawng zawng hlimna chu, Zion tlâng chu a ni, hmâr lam panga Lal ropui tak khawpui chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A lal inahte chuan Pathianin kulhbîng sâng a nih a inhriattîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, lalte chu an inpun khâwm a, An lo kal a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An hmu a; tichuan, mak an ti a; An mangang a, an kal bo ta thuai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chutah chuan khurhnain a man a, Hmeichhe nau vei natna angin a man bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khawchhak thlîin Tarsis lawng liante chu i tichhe ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sipaihote Lalpa khawpuiah, kan Pathian khawpuiah chuan, Benga kan hriat ang ngeiin kan hmu ta: Pathianin chu khawpui chu kumkhua atân a tinghet ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i biak in chhûngrilah chuan I ngilneihzia hi kan ngaihtuah tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i hming ang ngeiin i fakna chu kâwlkil thlengin a awm a; I kut ding lam chu felnain a khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I rorêlnate avângin Zion tlâng chu lâwm takin awm sela, Juda fanute chu hlim takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Zion chu vêlin kal hual ula; a râlvên in sângte pawh chhiar rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kulhte chu chhinchhiah ngun ula, A lal inte chu ngaihtuah rawh u; Ṭhangthar lo awm lehte hnênah in hrilh theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />He Pathian hi kumkhaw tlaitluana kan Pathian a ni dâwn si a: Thih thleng pawha min hruaitu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="49" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi tinrêngte u, hei hi ngaithla ula; Khawvêla awm zawng zawngte u, beng lo chhi rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tê leh mi lian, Mi hausa leh mi rethei pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kâ hian finna thu a sawi ang a; Ka thinlung ngaihtuah chu hriat thiamna thu a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tehkhin thûah ka beng ka chhî ang a; Ka thu ril sawi chu ṭingṭangin ka hrilhfiah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni ṭha lovahte ka keartui bula khawlohna chuan mi hual vêl pawhin, Engah nge ka hlauh vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahni sum ringa, Mahni hausakna nasa tak chhuangtute chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu mân an unau pawh an tlan thei tawp lo vang a, Pathian hnênah tlanna an pêksak thei hek lo vang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />(An nun tlanna tûr chuan thil nasa tak sên tûr a ni a, Kumkhua pawha a tina tin loh mai tûr a ni):
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A dam reng fo va, Ṭawihna a hmuh lohna tûr chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi fingte pawh an thi a, Mi â leh mi mâwlte pawh an boral ve ve a, An sum mi dangte an hnutchhiah ṭhinte chu a hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An rilru ngaihtuah dân chu, An inte chu kumkhuaa awm tûr ang leh, An awmnate chu chhuan zawng zawng thlenga awm tûr angin a ni; An ramte chu anmahni hming vêk an puttîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, mihring hi chawimawiin an awm reng lo va; Sa boral ṭhînte ang mai hi an ni e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûng an awm dân chu an âtna a ni; Nimahsela, an hnuah chuan miten an thusawite chu ṭha an ti ṭhîn. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Berâm rual angin Seol tân ruat an ni a, Thihna chu an vêngtu a ni ang; Khua a vârin mi felten an chungah ro an rêl ang a; An taksa a ral ang a, Seol chu an chênna in tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka nunna erawh chu Pathianin Seol kut ata a tlan chhuak ang; Ani chuan mi lâwm dâwn si a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi tihhausaka a lo awma, A chhûngkaw ropuina chu a lo nasat tulh tulh pawhin, hlau suh ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A thih hunah chuan eng mah a chhawm dâwn lo va; A ropuina chuan a zui thla dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A dam laiin intiengthâwl mah sela (A hlawhtlin avângin miin fak ṭhîn mah se),
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thlahtute chhuan hnênah a kal ang; Eng tikah mah êng hmu tawh lo tûrte hnênah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mihring, chawimawia awma, hriat thiamna nei si lo chu, Sa boral ṭhînte ang mai hi an ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="50" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian, Pathian ngei, Lalpa chuan thu a sawi a, Leilung hi ni chhuahna aṭanga a tlâkna thlengin a ko ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mawi famkimna, Zion aṭang chuan, Pathian chu a êng chhuak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian chu a lo kal ang a, a ngawi reng lo vang: A hma lamah chuan mei a kâng hluah hluah ang a, A vêlah chuan thlipui nasa tak a tleh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mite ro a rêl theihna tûrin Chung lam vânte leh lei hi a ko vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Ka mi thianghlimte ka hnênah rawn hruai khâwm rawh u, Sa talha ka hnêna thu thlungtute chu,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, vânte khian a felna chu a tlangaupui ang, Amah Pathian ngei chu rorêltu a ni si a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aw ka mite u, ngaithla rawh u, thu ka sawi dâwn e; Aw Israel, ngaithla rawh, ka hriat fiahtîr dâwn a che: Kei hi Pathian, i Pathian ngei chu ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I inthawinate avângin ka zilhhau lo vang che; I hâlral thilhlante chu ka hmaah a awm chawt si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I in ata chu bâwngpa rêng rêng ka la chhuak lo vang a, I ran huang ata kêlpate pawh ka la chhuak hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramhnuaia sa tinrêngte hi ka ta a ni si a, Tlâng sângkhat lai chunga ran awmte pawh chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tlânga sava zawng zawng ka hre vek a, Ramsate pawh hi ka ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Rilṭâm mah ila ka hrilh lo vang che; Leilung leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi ka ta a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Bâwngpa sa ka eiin kêl thisen ka in dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pathian hnênah lâwmthu sawi inthawina chu hlân zâwk la; I thutiam pawh Chungnungbera lakah hlen rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, mangan nîah chuan mi ko la; Ka chhan him ang che; tichuan, nangin mi chawimawi dâwn nia,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi suaksual hnênah erawh chuan Pathianin, “Ka thuruat hi engtiziaa hriattîra, Ka thuthlung hi engtiziaa i kâa lam ngun nge i nih?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thunun i hua a, Ka thute hi hnung lamah i paih zêl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rûkru i hmuhin rem i tihpui a, Uirepate lah i kawppui bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />“I kâ hi sual i pe a, I lei hian bumna a siam bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ṭhu chungin i unau i sawisêl a; Mahni nute fapa ngei chu i hêk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chûng thil chu i ti a; nimahsela, ka ngawi reng a; Chutichuan, nangmah ang diakah mi ruat ṭhîn; Nimahsela, ka zilhhau ang chia, i mit hmuhah indawt zêlin ka tilang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nangni Pathian heihnghilhtute u, hei hi ngaihtuah rawh u khai! Chuti lo chuan, ka pawt sawm dah ang che u, Nangmahni chhanhimtu rêng an awm dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tu pawh lâwmthu sawi inthawina hlân apiang chuan mi chawimawi ṭhîn a; Tin, a awm dân vawng ûptu hnênah chuan, Pathian chhandamna ka entîr ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="51" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i ngilneih êm avângin mi khawngaih la; I lainatna nasat avângin ka bawhchhiatnate hi thai bo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka khawlohnate hi mi sil faisak var la, Ka sual hi mi tlen faisak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka bawhchhiatnate hi ka hre ta si a, Ka sual hi ka hmaah a awm fo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chungah, i chung chauhvah thil ka tisual a, I mit hmuha thil sual chu ka lo ti ta a: Thu i sawiin thiam i chan theiha, Ro i rêlin sawisêl bo i nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ngai teh, khawlohnaa dinin ka awm a; Ka nun sualin mi pai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, chhûngril lamahte hian takna i duh ṭhîn a; Tichuan, lang lo lamah hian finna mi hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Husop-in mi tifai la; tichuan, ka fai ang. Mi sil fai la; tichuan, vûr aiin ka vâr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hlimna leh lâwmna chu bengin mi hriattîr ang che; I ruh tihtliahte hi a hlim theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka sualnate lakah hian i hmai thup la, Ka khawlohna zawng zawng thai bo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, keimahah hian thinlung thianghlim tak siam la, Ka kawchhûngah hian thlarau dik tak siam thar leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I hnên ata hi mi paih bo suh la; I thlarau thianghlim hi mi lâksak suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I mi chhandam hlimna chu mi pe leh la, Thlarau tih nuamin mi chelh reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, bawhchhetute chu i kawng chanchinte ka zirtîr ang a; Tichuan, mi sualte chu i lamah an hawi leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang mi chhandamtu Pathian, Thisen chhuahnate lakah mi chhan him ang che; Tichuan, ka lei hian i felna thu hi hlim takin hlaah a sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin ka hmui hi hawng ang che; Tichuan, ka kâ hian i fakna chu a hriattîr dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Inthawina chungah lâwmna i nei si lo va, chuti ni suh sela chuan ka pe ang; Hâlral thilhlan chungah lungawina rêng i nei lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian duh zâwng inthawinate chu thlarau lungchhia hi a ni. Aw Pathian, thinlung lungchhia leh inchhîr ngawih ngawih hi i hmusit lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I duh zâwng takin Zion chungah thil ṭha ti la; Jerusalem kulh chu rem ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chutichuan, felna inthawinate chungah lâwmna i nei tawh ang a, Hâlral thilhlan leh hâlral pumhlan chungah chuan; Chutichuan, i maichâm chungah chuan bâwngpate an hlân tawh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="52" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw mi chak, engati nge thil tihsual i chhuan ni? Pathian ngilneihna chu a awm fo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I leiin thil sual tak tih a suangtuah ṭhîn; Bakmeh chem hriam tak bum hmang ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ṭha aiin sual i ngaina zâwk a; Felna thu sawi aiin dâwt thu sawi i ngaina zâwk bawk a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, nang lei mi bum hmang, Thu mi lem zo thei zawng zawng chu i ngaina ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathianin kumkhua atân a tichhe ve ang che, A man ang chia, i awmna aṭangin a hnûk chhuak ang chia, Mi nung ram ata hi a pawt chhuak daih ang che. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi felte pawhin an hmuin an hlau vang a; An nuihsan ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“En teh u, he mi hi a ni, Pathian a kulhbînga siam duh lova, A hausakna nasa tak ring zâwka, A sualnaa intichak vei chu ni,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kei erawh zawng Pathian ina olive thing chawr duah hluah ang ka ni; Pathian ngilneihna chu kumkhaw tlaitluanin ka ring ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu chu i tih avângin, kumkhuain lâwmthu ka hrilh fo vang che; I mi thianghlimte mit hmuhah chuan i hming chu ka nghâk reng ang, a ṭha si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="53" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Mi â chuan a rilruin, “Pathian rêng a awm lo,” a ti ṭhîn a. An chhe zo va, thil sual tenawm tak an ti a; Tu mah thil ṭha ti rêng an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hre thiama Pathian zawng rêng rêng an awm emaw tih hre tûrin, Pathianin vân aṭangin mihring fate hi a zuk en a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An kîr leh ta ṭheuh va, bawlhhlawh takin an lo awm ta vek a; Tu mah thil ṭha ti rêng an awm lo, pakhat mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thil tisualtute chuan hriat rêng rêng an nei lo vem ni? Chhang an ei angin ka mite an ei zo vek ṭhîn, Pathian lah an lam ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hlauhna rêng rêng awm lohnaah chuan hlau êm êmin an awm a; Pathianin beih tuma eptu che ruhte chu a tidarh ta si a; Pathianin anni chu a paihthlâk avângin i timualpho ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Israel-ho chhandamna chu Zion aṭangin lo chhuak teh sela aw! Pathian chuan a mite sala an awm chu a hruai kîr leh hunah, Chumi hunah chuan Jakob-ho an hlim ang a, Israel-ho an lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="54" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i hmingin mi chhandam la, I chaknain ro mi rêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla la; Ka kâa thuchhuakahte hian beng lo chhi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mikhualte chuan mi bei ta si a. Mi nunrâwngten ka nunna hi tihbo tumin an zawng bawk a; Pathian chu an hmaah an dah lo. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, Pathian chu mi ṭanpuitu a ni a; Lalpa chu ka nunna chelhtute zînga mi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ani chuan sualna chu ka hmêlmate chûngah a thungrûl ang; Nangin anni chu i thutakna avâng chuan tiboral ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mahni duh thûa thilhlanin i hnênah ka inthawi ang a; Aw Lalpa , i hming chu ka fak ang, a ṭha si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka manganna zawng zawngah chuan mi chhan chhuak ta si a; Mi dotute chunga ka duhthusâm thleng chu ka mitin a hmu ta a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="55" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka ṭawngṭainaah hian beng lo chhi la; Khawngaih ka dîlnaah hian inthup suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ngaithla la, mi chhâng ang che; Ka mangan thu avângin ka vân ruai a, ka rûm ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dotu thâwm avâng te, Mi suaksual hnehchhiahna avâng tein. Anni chuan sualnain mi lum khumin, Thinurin mi tiduhdah si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka kawchhûngah hian ka thinlung a na êm êm a, Thih râpthlâknate chuan mi delh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭihna leh khurhnain mi bawh a, Hlauhnain mi khuh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tichuan, “Aw, ṭhuro anga thla neih ka va duh êm! Chutichuan, ka thlâwk daih ang a, thlamuang takin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, hla takah ka lêng ang a, Thlalêrah ka awm ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thli na tak leh thlipui hi Bîkna hmunah ka kalsan thuai tûr,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , an lei chu tichhiain tithlêr ang che, Khawpuiah chuan inpâwngnêkna leh innghirnghona ka hmu si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A chhûn a zânin khawpui chu kulh tlângah an vêl an vêl a: A chhûngah chuan sualna leh hrehawmna a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Suahsualna a chhûngah a awm a; Bumna leh tihderna chuan a kawtlai chu a chhuahsan ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi sawichhetu chu hmêlma a ni si lo va; Ni sela chu, ka tuar thei zâwk tûr. Ka chunga intiliana chu mi hawtu a ni hek lo; Ni sela chu, ka bihrûksan tûr:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang, ka mi anpui, Ka ṭhian, ka ṭhian kawm ngeih i ni miau si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kam thlum taka kan inbiakrâwn ṭhina, Mipui zînga Pathian biak ina kan lên ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thihna an chungah lo thleng thut sela, Khuarkhurumah chuan a nung chungin chhuk rawh se, Suahsualnate chu an awmnaah leh an kawchhûngahte a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kei zawngin Pathian ka ko vang a; Tichuan, Lalpan mi chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tlaiah te, zîngah te, chhûnah te ka mangan thu ka sawiin, ka rûm ang a; Tichuan, anin ka aw a ngaithla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka chunga mi beihna lakah chuan ka nunna hi thlamuang takin a chhan him ta a, Mi beitute chu an tam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian, hmasâng chena awm renga chuan, A ngaithla ang a, anmahni a chhâng ang, (Selah) Danglamna nei ngai lo, Pathian ṭih ngai si lote chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Amah nêna inremte chungah chuan a kut a lek a; A thuthlung chu a tibawrhbâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kâ chu hnute tui khal angin a tlawr a, A thinlung erawh chu indona a ni si a; A thute chu hriak aiin a nâl a, Nimahsela, khandaih phawi sate a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />I rit phurh chu Lalpa chungah nghat la; Tichuan, anin a tichak ang che; Mi fel chu eng tikah mah tihnghîn a phal lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Pathian, nangin anni chu boralna khuarkhurumah chuan i chhuktîr ang; Thisen chhuah hmang mite chu an dam chhûng chanve pawh an dam zo lo vang. Kei erawh chuan nang ka ring ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="56" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi khawngaih ang che; mihringin mi lem zawh an tum si a; Nilêngin mi beiin mi hnehchhiah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hmêlmaten nilêngin mi lem zawh an tum a, Chapo taka mi beitute hi an tam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka hlauh châng apiangin, Nangmah ka ring ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian ka ring a, a thu ka fak ang a, Pathian ka ring a, ka hlau lo vang; Tisa chuan eng nge mi tih theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nilêngin ka thute an la kawi ṭhîn a; An ngaihtuahna zawng zawng chu ka ṭhat lohna tûr lam hlîr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An inkhâwm a, an biru a, Ka hniakte an chhinchhiah ṭhîn a, Ka nunna tihbo tuma an nghâk ṭhîn ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An sual hremna an pumpelh dâwn em ni? Aw Pathian, thinurin mi tin chu titlâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangin ka vahvaihnate hi i chhinchhiah ṭhîn a; Ka mittuite hi i savun pengah chuan thun ang che; I lehkhabuah a chuang hlawm lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka koh hun che ngei chuan mi dotute chu an tlânchhia ang; Hei hi ka hria, Pathianin mi ṭan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathianah chuan a thu ka fak ang a, Lalpa -ah chuan a thu ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian ka ring a, ka hlau lo vang. Mihringin eng nge mi tih theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i hnênah thutiamte ka nei a; Lâwm thu sawi inthawinatein ka rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nunna hi thihna lakah i chhan him si a. Ka kete hi tlu lo tûrin i chhan him a ni lâwm ni? Mi nung êngah hian Pathian hmaa ka lên theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="57" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi khawngaih rawh, mi khawngaih rawh; Ka nunna hi nangmahah chuan a tlu lût si a: A ni, i thla hnuai chu ka chuh ang, Vânduainate hi a kian hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian Chungnungbera chu ka au vang; Pathian, engkim mi tihsaktu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi lem zawh tumtu chuan mi sawi chhiat hunah, Ani chuan vân aṭangin a rawn tîr ang a, mi chhandam ang; (Selah) Pathianin a ngilneihna leh a thutak chu a rawn tîr chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka nunna hi sakeibaknei zîngah a awm a; Mihring kâng zîngah ka awm a, An hâte chu fei leh thal ang a ni a, An lei lah khandaih hriam tak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chu vân khûm daih khian chawimawiin lo awm ang che; I ropuina chu leilung zawng zawng chungah hian lo awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka ke awh nân lên an phah a; Ka nunna hi a kun ngawih ngawih a; Ka hmaah khuarkhurum an lai a; Anmahni ngei a lai takah an tla ta a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi a nghet a ni, Aw Pathian, ka thinlung hi a nghet a ni; Hla ka sa ang, a ni, fakna hla ka sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ropuina, harh rawh; perhkhuang leh ṭingṭangte u, harh rawh u: Kei chu zîng takah ka harh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi tin zîngahte lâwmthu ka hrilh ang che; Hnam tin zîngah nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I ngilneihna chu vân tawng khawpin a nasa si a, I thutak chu vân dum tawng khawpin a nasa bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chu vân khûm daih khian chawimawiin lo awm ang che; I ropuina chu leilung zawng zawng chungah hian lo awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="58" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Felna thu chu ngawi rengin maw in sawi tak tak? Aw, mihring fate u, dik takin maw ro in rêl?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ni, in thinlungah chuan thil sual tak in ti ṭhîn a; Leia in kuta thil râwng taka tih chu in bûk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chu an nu pum chhûng aṭang rêngin Pathian laka ṭhenin an awm a: An pian veleh dâwt thu sawiin an vâk bo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An tûr chu rûl ang a ni a: Rûlrial bengngawng, a beng hup ṭhîn ang chu an ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu chuan rûl dawi ât thiamte aw chu a ngaithla ṭhîn lo, Eng anga thiam pawhin dawi mah sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Pathian, an kâah chuan an hâte chu tibal la; Aw Lalpa , sakeibaknei vânglaite ha lian pui puite chu kher chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Anni chu tui chak taka luang angin tui ral sela; A thaltea tinin, sah chhum angin awm zêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kawngkawrawi, tuia ral mai ṭhîn ang hi ni sela; A hun lova hmeichhe nau hrin, ni hmêl rêng rêng hmu lo ang hi ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />In bêlte chuan hlîng thing lum a hriat hma pawhin ani chuan ṭhâwngaleivirin a la bo vang, A hring leh a kâng lai pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi fel chuan phuba lâkna chu a hmuhin a lâwm ang a; Mi suaksual thisenah chuan a ke chu a sil ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chutichuan, miten, “Mi fel tân chuan lâwmman a lo awm tak tak a; Leiah hian rorêltu Pathian a lo awm tak tak a nih hi,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="59" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, mi dotute lakah mi chhan him la; Mi beitute lak ata hmun sângah mi hlâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil tisualtute lakah mi chhan him la, Thisen chhuah hmangte lakah mi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka bawhchhiatna avâng ni lovin, ka sual avâng ni hek lovin, Ngai teh, ka nunna hi an châng reng si a, Mi chakte chu mi bei tûrin an pung khâwm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka sual loh pawhin an tlân a, an inbuatsaih a; Mi ṭanpui tûrin intiharh la, en rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Israel-ho Pathian, Nangmah ngei chu hnam tinrêng tlawh tûrin tho la; Mi vervêk sual takte rêng rêng chu khawngaih suh ang che. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tlai lamah an lo kal leh a, ui angin an chiau chûl a, Khawpui chu an vêl an vêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ngai teh, an kâin an irh chhuak a; An hmuiah chuan khandaihte a awm a; “Tu nge hria awm ni?” an ti mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , nangin anni chu i nuihsan zâwk ang a; Hnam tinrêng chu i nuihzatbûr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw mi tichaktu, ka nghâk reng ang che, Pathian chu ka kulhbîng sâng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka chunga ngilnei Pathian chuan mi hmuak ang a; Pathianin ka hmêlmate chungah ka thu duhsâm chu mi hmuhtîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni chu that suh ang che; chuti lo chuan, ka miten an theihnghilh dah ang e; Aw Lalpa, kan phaw ber, I thiltihtheihnain tidarh la, titlâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ka sualna avâng leh an hmuia thuchhuak avângin, An chapona ngeiah chuan âwk rawh se, An thusawi ṭhin ânchhe lawhna leh dâwt thu avâng pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Anniho chu thinrimin tiboral la, an awm tawh lohna tûrin tiboral la; Pathianin Jakob-ho zîngah ro a rêl tih hre hlawm rawh se, Kâwlkil thlengin. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tin, tlai lamah lo kal leh sela, ui angin chiau chûl sela, Khawpui chu vêl vêl rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chu ei tûr zawngin an vâk an vâk ang a, An tlai loh chuan an awm zankhua ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chuan i chakna thu hi hlaah ka sa ang a; A ni, zîngah chuan i ngilneihna thu hi hlim takin hlaah ka sa ang; Nang chu ka kulhbîng sâng, Ka mangan nia ka inhumhimna i ni si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw mi tichaktu, nangmah fakin ka zai ang; Pathian chu ka kulhbîng sâng, ka chunga ngilnei Pathian chu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="60" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangin min thlauthla a, min tichhia a; I lo thinur ta a; aw, min tung ding leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />He ram hi i tikhûr a; i tikhi ta a; A kakte chu siam ṭha leh ang che; a nghîng a nghîng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I mite hi thil khirh takte i tawhtîr a; Paina uain chu min intîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah ṭihtute hnênah chuan puanzâr i pe ta a, Thutak avânga zâr a nih theih nân. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I duh takte hi chhanhima an awm theih nân, I kut ding lamin chhandam la, min chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathianin a thianghlimnaah chuan heti hian a sawi a: “Ka hlim ang a; Sekem khua chu ka sem ang a, Sukkoth ruam chu ka sem darh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gilead ram chu ka ta a ni a, Manase ram pawh ka ta a ni; Ephraim ram pawh chu ka lû humhimna a ni a; Juda ram chu ka laltiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Moab ram chu ka insilna bêl a ni a; Edom ramah chuan ka pheikhawk ka paih ang; Philistia ram, nang chu keimah avâng hian au ta che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Khawpui nghet takah chuan tuin nge mi hruai lût ang? Edom ramah chuan tuin nge mi hruai ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangmah ngeiin min thlauthla a ni lâwm ni? Aw Pathian, kan sipaihote hnênah lah i chhuak ve ta si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Dotute bei tûrin min ṭanpui ang che, Mihring ṭanpuina chu eng mah lo mai mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />ṭPathian zârah huai takin kan ti ang, Ani chu min dotute rap bettu tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="61" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka au thâwm hi lo hria la; Ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka thinlung a chauh laiin kâwlkil aṭang hian ka ko vang che; Lungpui ka aia sâng zâwkah chuan mi hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang chu ka tân inhumhimna, Dotute lakah râlvên in sâng nghet tak i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I puan inah chuan kumkhuain ka awm ang a; I thla hnuai bihrûkna hmunah chuan ka tlu lût ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chuan ka thutiamte i ngaithla si a; I hming ṭihtute ram luah chu mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lal dam chhûng hi i tisei ang a, A kumte chu chhuan tam tak tluk a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian hmaah kumkhuain a awm reng ang. Aw, amah humhim theihna tûrin ngilneihna leh thutak buatsaih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutichuan, ka thutiamte ni tin ka hlen theih nân, Kumkhuain i hming fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="62" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka nunna hian Pathian chauh a nghâk a, Amah aṭang chuan ka chhandamna a lo chhuak dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah chauh chu ka lungpui leh mi chhandamtu a ni; Ka kulhbîng sâng a ni a; nasa tak chuan ka nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nangni zawng zawngin, tihlum tûrin, Lung bang âwn bei ang leh, pal tlu lek lek bei angin, Eng chen nge mi pakhat hi in beih dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ropuina aṭanga nam thla tûr ngawtin an inrâwn a; Dâwt sawi hi an lâwm zâwng tak a ni. An kâin mal an sâwm a; nimahsela, an rilruin ânchhia an lawh si ṭhîn. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunna, Pathian chauh nghâk rawh; Ka beiseina hi ama hnên aṭanga chhuak a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah chauh chu ka lungpui leh ka chhandamna a ni; Ka kulhbîng sâng a ni a; ka nghîng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian hnênah ka chhandamna leh ka ropuina a awm a; Ka chakna lungpui leh ka inhumhimna chu Pathianah a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nangni mipuite u, eng lai pawhin amah chu ring ula; In thinlung chu a hmaah chuan leih baw rawh u; Pathian chu kan tân inhumhimna a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi chi tête hi eng mah lo mai an ni a, mi chi liante pawh hi dâwt mai an ni; Bûknaah chuan an kâng daih ang a; Eng mah lo mai mai ai pawhin an zâng zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnehchhiahna hi ring suh ula, Mi ram hman hi chhuanah neih hek suh ula; Hausaknate a lo pun chuan a chungah in thinlung chu nghat suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathianin vawi khat a sawi a; E! Hei hi vawi hnih ka hre ta; Thiltihtheihna hi Pathian ta a ni, tih hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ngilneihna hi i ta bawk a ni: Mi tin an thiltih ang ṭheuhvin i rûl si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="63" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chu ka Pathian i ni a; zîng takah ka zawng ang che; Ram ro chau tak, tui awm lohnaah hian Ka nunna hi nangmah châkin a tuihâl a, ka tisa hian a ngai che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin hmun thianghlimah chuan ka en reng che kha, I thiltihtheihna leh i ropuina hmu tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I ngilneihna hi nunna aia a ṭhat zâwk avângin, Ka hmui hian a fak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chutiang bawkin ka dam chhûng zawngin ka fak ang chia; I hmingin ka kutte ka phar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka nunna hi thlîng leh thauva tlai angin a tlai ang a; Ka kâ hian hlim hmui puin a fak bawk ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka khum laizâwla ka hriat reng chia, Zâna i chungchâng thu ka suangtuah lai chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang chu mi ṭanpuitu i ni si a, I thla hnuaiah chuan hlimin ka zai dâwn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nunna hian a zui tlat chia; I kut ding lamin mi kai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka nunna tihbo tuma zawngtute erawh chu lei hmun hnuaihnungahte chuan an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khandaih thiltihtheihna hnênah pêk an ni ang a; Sihalte chan an ni tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lal erawh chu Pathianah a hlim ang a; Amah chhâla chhechham apiang chuan an chhuang ang; Dâwt thu sawi hmang kâte chu hup a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="64" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka mangan thûah hian ka aw hi lo hria la; Dotute hlauhawmna lakah hian ka nunna humhim ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo titute inrâwn rûkna lakah mi thukru ang che, Thil tisualtute inhâwr khâwmho lakah chuan:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûngte chuan khandaih angin an lei an tât hriam a, Mi sawisêl bo chu hmun fianriala an kah theihna tûrin An thal, thu khâte chuan an tin a; Hlau lovin vawi leh khatah an kâp nghâl thut ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thil sual ti-ah chuan an infuih a; Thang a rûka kam thûahte an inbe ṭhîn a; “Tuin nge chûng chu hmu ang?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khawlohna an zawng chhuak ṭhîn a; “Ṭhahnemngai takin kan zawng zo ta,” an ti a; An chhûng lam ngaihtuahna leh thinlung chu thûk tak a ni ṭheuh nghâl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin anmahni a kâp ang a; Vawi leh khatah thala hliamin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chutiang chuan, anmahni lei ngei chuan anmahni a do avângin, tihpetekin an awm ang a; Anmahni hmu apiangin an lû an thing ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tichuan, mi zawng zawngin an hlau vang a; Pathian hnathawh chu an hril ang a, A thiltih chu fing takin an ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi felte chu Lalpa -ah an lâwm ang a, Amahah chuan rinna an nghat ang a; Thinlung dik tak pu zawng zawngte chuan an chhuang ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="65" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, Zion-ah chuan faknain a nghâk reng a che; Thutiam chu i lakah hlen a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, ṭawngṭaina ngaithlatu, I hnênah tisa zawng zawng chu an lo kal ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khawlohnate chuan mi hneh ṭhîn na a; Kan bawhchhiatnate zawng nangin i tlêng fai ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi, i biak in hung chhûng kawtlaiahte awm thei tûra i thlana, i kiang i pantîra chu a eng a thâwl e. I ṭhatna chuan kan tlai ang, I biak in hmun thianghlim ṭhatna chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw, min chhandamtu Pathian, Thil râpthlâktein fel takin min chhâng ang; Nang kâwlkila mi zawng zawng leh, Tuifinriat chung hla taka awmte rina chu i ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thiltihtheihnaa taia inhrênga, Mahni chaknaa tlângte tinghet ṭhîntu chu i ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuifinriat ri hum hum, a fâwn ri hum humte leh, Mi tin sa mur mur tireh ṭhîntu chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kâwlkil tâwpa awmte pawh chuan i hriattîrnate chu an hlau ṭhîn a; Zîng leh tlai chhuahnate chu hlimin i autîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lei hi i kan a, tuiin i châwm a, Nasa takin i tiṭha ṭhîn; Pathian lui chu tuiin a khat a; Lei hi chutianga i buatsaih hnu chuan an tân buh i siamsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lei hi a leileh rîn khawhna thlûrte chu tui tam takin i châwm a; A vûng thlûrte chu i timuk a; Ruahtuiin i tinêm a; A thil ṭote chu mal i sâwm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kum chu i ṭhatna i khumtîr a; I kalna kawngte chu thil ṭhain a far ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlalêra ran tlatna hmunahte chuan a far a, Tlângte pawh chu hlimnaa phuar vêlin an awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ran tlatna hmunte chu ran rualin a dâpin a dâp a; Ruamte pawh chu buhin a tlim hmur a; Hlimin an au va, hla an sa bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="66" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Leilung luah zawng zawngte u, Pathian chawimawiin hlim takin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hming ropuizia chu hlain sa chhuak ula; A fakna chu tiropui rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian hnênah, “I thiltihte chu a va râpthlâk êm! I thiltihtheihna ropui nasatzia avângin nangmah dotute chu i hnênah an intulût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung luah zawng zawng hian chibai an bûk ang chia, Nangmah fakin an zai ang a; I hming fakin an zai ang,” ti rawh u. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hawh u, Pathian thiltihte hi en rawh u; Mihring fate chunga a thiltihah hian a hlauhawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan tuifinriat kha lei rovah a chantîr a; Luipui kha kein an kal kai a. Chutah chuan amahah kan hlim a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A thiltihtheihna chuan kumkhuain ro a rêl a; A mitin hnam tin a en ṭhîn; Hel hmangte chu inchawimawi suh se. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, mi tinte u, kan Pathian chu fak ula, Amah fakna thâwm chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan kan nunna hi a tinung reng a, Kan kete hi tihsawn a phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangin min fiah a; Tangkaraw fiah angin min fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nangin lênah min hruai lût a; Kan kâwngah hian phur rit tak i nghat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihringte chu tawlailîr chunga chuangin, kan lû chungah i kaltîr a; Mei leh tui kan kal tlang a; Nimahsela, hmun chênghnâwng taka lût tûrin min hruai chhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlante nên i inah ka lût ang a, Ka thutiamte chu i lakah ka hlen ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka hmuiin a sawia, Manganga ka awm laia ka kâin a sawite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sa thau tak hâlral thilhlante i hnênah ka hlân ang a, Berâmpa hâl rimtui nên; Bâwngpate, kêlte nên ka hlân ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Hawh u, Pathian ṭih zawng zawngte u, ngaithla rawh u; Tichuan, ka nunna tâna a thiltih chu ka hriattîrang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ani chu ka kâin ka au va, Ka leia chawimawiin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thinlunga sualna ka ngaihsak chuan, Lalpan mi ngaithla lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin mi ngaithla tak tak a; Ka ṭawngṭaina thâwm chu a bengkhawn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian-ka ṭawngṭaina hlawhchhamtîr lova, ka laka a ngilneih bâng hek lova chu, Fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="67" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathianin min khawngaih sela, mal min sâwm sela, A hmêl chu kan chungah rawn êntîr rawh se; (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I kawng chu lei chunga mi hriat a nih theiha, I chhandamna chu hnam tinrêng zîngah hriat a nih theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi tinin fak che rawh se; Mi tinrêngte chuan fak che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, hnam tin chu lâwm taka awmin, hlimin zai rawh se! Nangin mi tin chu thlei bîk nei lova ro rêlsakin, Lei chunga hnam tin chu i awp dâwn si a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi tinin fak che rawh se; Mi tinrêngte chuan fak che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei hian a thil ṭo chu a pe a; Pathian-keimahni Pathian ngei chuan mal min sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathianin mal min sâwm ang a; Kâwlkila mi zawng zawng pawhin amah an ṭih ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="68" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chu tho sela, a dote chu tihdarhin awm sela; Amah hawtute pawh chu a hmaah tlânchhe rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Meikhu hi len bova a awm angin, anni chu lên bo vang che; Khawihnûn hi mei luma a tui ral angin, Mi suaksualte chu Pathian hmaah boral rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi felte erawh chu lâwm takin awm sela; Pathian hmaah hlim rawh se; A ni, lâwm takin hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian chawimawiin hla sa ula, a hming fakin zai rawh u; Tawlailîra thlalêrte kaltlang tûra tân chuan lamlian sial rawh u; A hming chu JAA a ni a, a hmaah chuan hlim rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian, a awmna thianghlima awm chu, Pa nei lote pa leh hmeithaite ngaihtuahtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chuan mi malte chu chhûngkaw zîngahte a teltîr ṭhîn a; Mi tângho chu a hruai chhuak a, vânneihnaah a hruai lût ṭhîn; Hel hmangte erawh chu ram rovah an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i mite hma hruaia i lo chhuaha, Thlalêra i kaltlang lai khân, (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lei hi a nghîng dur dur a, Vânte pawh khi Pathian hmaah chuan a far a; Sinai tlâng meuh pawh saw Pathian hmaah, Israel-ho Pathian hmaah chuan a nghîn dur dur kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chuan ruah tam tak i sûrtîr a, I ro chan chu a chauh lai khân i tinghet a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I hote chuan chutah chuan awm hmun an khuar a; Aw Pathian, nang chuan i ṭhatnain retheite tân i buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpan thu a pe a, Chanchin hriltu hmeichhe tam takin an hril darh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sipaiho lalte chu an tlânchhia an tlânchhia a; In nghâktunu chuan râllâk sum chu a sem a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ṭhuro thla tangkaruaa tuama, A thla hmâwr pawh rangkachak enga tuam angin berâm huang kârahte i mu dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Engkimtitheian chutah chuan lalte a tihdarh lai chu, Zalmon tlânga vûr sûr lai ang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Basan tlâng chu Pathian tlâng a ni a; Basan tlâng chu tlâng sâng tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlâng sâng takte u, Pathianin a awmna tûra a tlâng duh chu engah nge îtsîka in melh ni? A ni, Lalpa chu chutah chuan kumkhuain a awm reng dâwn asin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian tawlailîr chu a sînga sîng, a sânga sâng tam tak a ni; Lalpa chu Sinai tlânga a awm ang khân, Chûng zîngah chuan hmun thianghlimah a awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nang chu chung lamah i chho va, i mante chu salah i hruai a; Mihringte zîngah thilpêkte i dawng a, A ni, hel hmangte zîngah pawh; Lalpa Pathian chu an hnêna a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa , kan phur ni tina min phurhsaktu, Min chhandamtu Pathian chu, fakin awm rawh se. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Pathian chu kan tân chhanhimtu Pathian a ni; Thihna ata chhuahnate chu Lalpa JEHOVA ta a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathianin amah dotute lû chu a sât phel phawk ang, A thiam lohnaa la kal zêla lû vun sam buk tak chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lalpan , “Basan ram aṭangin ka hruai leh ang a, Tuifinriat mawng thûk tak ata chu ka hruai leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />I ke chu thisena i hnim theiha, I ui leite chuan i dote laka chan a neih theih nân,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i kal laite an hmu a, Ka Pathian, ka Lalber hmun thianghlima kal laite chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Nula khuangte bêngho laiah chuan, Hla satute an kal hmasa a, englo tumtute chuan an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Inkhâwmnaahte hian Pathian fak ula, Israela tuihnaa chhuakte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Fa tlum Benjamin-hovin hma hruaiin, Juda-ho mi liante leh an upahote, Zebulun-ho mi liante, Naphtali-ho mi lianten an zui a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I Pathian chuan i thiltihtheihna chu thu a pe a: Aw Pathian, kan tân thil min tihsak chu tichak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Jerusalem-a i biak in avângin Lalhovin lâwmmante an la rawn kensak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Sakawlh, phairuang zînga chêng chu zilh la, Hnam dang, bâwngchal leh bâwngno rualte chu zilh la, Kûna an tangkate i hmaa an hlan hma chu; Indo châk mite chu tidarh rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aigupta ram aṭangin mi liante an lo chhuak ang a; Ethiopia-ho chu Pathian lama an kut phar tûrin an hmanhmawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Leilung ramte u, Pathian chawimawiin hla sa ula; Aw, Lalpa fakin zai rawh u; (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Vânte vân hmasânga awmte chunga chuanga chu; Ngai teh, a aw a chhuah e, aw nasa tak mai chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Pathian hnênah chuan chakna pe rawh u: A ropuina chu Israel-ho chungah a awm a, A chakna chu vân dumahte khian a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i hmun thianghlim aṭangte chuan i hlauhawm a ni. Amah Israel-ho Pathian ngei chuan a mite hnênah chakna leh thiltihtheihna a pe ṭhîn a ni. Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="69" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi chhandam ang che; Tuite chu ka nunna thleng hian a lût ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chirhdûp thûk tak, rahchhan rêng rêng awm lohnaah ka pil tual tual hi; Tui thûk tak, tui lian mi chîm pilnaahte ka lo luh tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka auna lamah ka chau va; ka dang a ro zo va; Ka Pathian ka nghahnaah hian ka mit a vai zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Enga khaw lawilova mi hawtute chu ka samzai aiin an tam a; Dik lo taka mi dova mi tihboral tumte chu mi chak tak an ni: Ka lâk si loh pawh mi rulhtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chuan ka âtzia hi i hria a; Ka thiam lohnate pawh hi i lakah thup a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian , nangmah nghâktute chu keimah avângin mualpho suh sela; Aw Israel-ho Pathian, nangmah zawngtute chu keimah avângin tihzahin awm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangmah avânga sawi chhiat ka tuar avângin, Zahnain ka hmai a khuh zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unaute lakah mikhual ka lo ni ta a, Ka nu fate lakah hriat ngai loh mi ka lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I ina ka ṭhahnemngaihnain mi ei zo va; Nangmah sawi chhetute sawi chhiatnate chu ka chungah a tla ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ṭaha, chaw nghei chunga ka nunna ka thunun leh, Chu chu mi sawi chhiatna a lo ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka silhfêna saiip ka hman leh, An tân chhe lama tehkhinna ka lo ni zêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulh kawngkâa ṭhute chuan ka chungchâng thu an sawi a; Zu ruih hmangte hla ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , kei zawng hun lâwmawmah i hnênah a ni ka ṭawngṭai ni; Aw Pathian, i ngilneihna nasa tak avângin i chhandamna thutakin mi chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chirhdûp ata hi mi chhan him la, mi piltîr lul suh ang che: Mi hawtute lakah leh tui thûk tak ata hi chhanhimin mi awmtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tui lianin mi chîm pil suh sela, Tui thûk takin mi lem hek suh se; Khuarkhurum pawhin a kâ mi chîp hnan suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi chhâng ang che; i ngilneihna chu a ṭha si a; I lainatna nasatzia ang zêlin ka lam hi lo hawi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh lakah hian i hmai pawh thup suh ang che; Ka mangang si a, mi chhâng thuai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka nunna hi rawn hnaihin, tlan la; Mi dotute avâng hian mi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nangin mi min sawichhiatna te, ka mualphona te, ka zahna te hi i hria e; Mi dotute chu i hmaah an awm vek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi min sawi chhiatna hian ka lung a tichhia a; Nasa takin ka lungngai bawk a; Tichuan, mi khawngaihtu tûr ka zawng a; nimahsela, tu mah an awm si lo va; Mi thlamuantu tûrte ka zawng bawk a; nimahsela, tu mah ka hmu si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka chaw atân englo khâ mi pe a; Ka tuihâl lahin in atân uain thûr mi pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />An hmaa an dawhkân chu thang lo ni sela; Thlamuang taka an awm laiin fal lo ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />An mitte chu, an hmuh theih loh nân tihthimin awm rawh se; An kâwngte chu tikhûr fo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I lungnih loh êm êmna chu an chungah leih bua la, I thinurna nasa tak chuan anni chu man rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An awmna chu lo ram sela; An puan inahte chuan tu mah awm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />I vuaka chu an tiduhdah a, I hliamate lungngaihzia chu an sawi si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An khawlohna chu khawlohnain belhchhah la; Anni chu i felnaah chuan lût suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anni chu nunna bu ata thai bovin awm sela, Mi felte zîngah chuan ziak ni ve suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chu rethei tak leh lungngai tak ka ni a; Aw Pathian, i chhandamna chuan hmun sângah mi dah rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Pathian hming chu hlain ka fak ang a, Lâwm thu sawiin amah chu ka chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chutiang chuan bâwngchal emaw, ki leh tin nei bâwngpa emaw ai chuan, Lalpa a tilawm zawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuhnuairawlhte chuan chu chu an hmu a, an lâwm a; Nangni Pathian zawngte u, in thinlung chu nungin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Lalpan pachhiate chu ngaithlain, A mi tângte chu a hmusit si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lei leh vân chuan amah chu fak rawh se, Tuifinriatte leh a chhûnga thil che thei tawh phawtte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathianin Zion chu chhan chhuakin, Juda khuate chu a din dâwn si a; Tichuan, chutah chuan an awm ang a, an nei nghâl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A chhiahhlawhho thlahte pawh chuan an rochung ang a; A hming ngainatute chu a chhûngah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="70" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi chhan him tûrin hmanhmawh la; Aw Lalpa , mi ṭanpui tûrin hmanhmawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna tihbo tuma zawngtute chu, Mualpho tak leh zak takin awm sela; Ka chhiatna chunga lâwmte chu tlânchhiattîrin tihzahin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Chei! Chei!” titute chu an mualpho avângin tlânchhiattîrin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A zawngtu che zawng zawng chu nangmahah chuan hlim tak leh lâwm takin awm sela; I chhandamna ngainatute chuan, “Pathian chu chawimawiin awm rawh se,” ti fo rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chu rethei leh pachhe tak ka ni a; Aw Pathian, ka hnênah lo kal thuai ang che. Nang chu mi ṭanpuitu leh mi chhanhimtu i ni a; Aw Lalpa , rei rial lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="71" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmahah chuan ka rinna ka nghat ṭhîn a; Eng tikah mah mualphovin mi awmtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I felna avânga mi chhanhimin, mi chhan chhuak la; Ka lamah hian i beng rawn dawhin, mi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tân awmna lungpui, ka kal fo theihna tûr lo ni ang che; Nangin mi chhandam tûrin thu i pe a; Ka lungpui leh ka kulhpui i ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, mi suaksual kut ata mi chhan chhuak ang che, Mi fel lo leh nun chhe tak kut ata chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian , nang chu ka beiseia chu i ni si a; Ka naupan têt ata ka rina chu i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nu pum aṭang rêngin nangma kaihin ka awm ṭhîn; Ka nu rîl ata mi la chhuaktu i ni a; Nangmah a ni ka fak fo dâwn che ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tam tak ngaihin thilmak ang ka ni a; Nimahsela, nang chu ka inhumhimna nghet tak i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kâ hi i faknain a khat ang a, Nilêngin nangmah chawimawinain a khat bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka tar hunin mi paih thla suh la; Ka tha a ṭhum hunin mi kalsan suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi dotute chuan ka chungchâng thu an sawi si a; Ka nunna chângtute an inrâwn bawk a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pathianin a kalsan ta; ûm ula, man rawh u; Chhanhimtu tûr rêng an awm si lo,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi hlat lul suh la; Aw ka Pathian, mi ṭanpui tûrin hmanhmawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka nunna dotute chu mualpho leh boralin awm sela; Ka chhiatna tûr zawngtute chu sawichhiatna leh zahnaa khuhin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei zawngin ka beisei fo vang a, Ka la fak zual deuh deuh vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka kâ hian i felna thu a hril ang a, Nilêngin i chhandamna thu a hril bawk ang; A tam chin ka hre si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian thiltih ropui takte nên ka lo kal a; I felna, nangma felna thu chauh ka sawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka naupan têt ata nangin mi zirtîr a; Tûn thlengin i thilmak tihte chu ka hriattîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A ni, aw Pathian, ka tara ka lû ṭuak hun pawhin mi kalsan lul suh ang che; I chakna hi ṭhangthar lehte hnênah leh, I thiltihtheihna hi lo la awm tûr apiangte hnêna ka hriattîr hma loh zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i felna pawh a sâng êm êm a ni; Aw Pathian, nang thil ropui takte titu, Nangmah ang hi tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang, manganna tam tak leh nasa tak mi hmuhtîrtu chuan, Mi tinung leh ang a, Lei thûk tak ata mi hruai chhuak leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangin ka ropuina mi tihpunsak la, Lo hawi lehin mi thlamuan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Perhkhuangin ka fak bawk ang che, Aw ka Pathian, i thutak ngei chu ka fak ang. Aw nang Israel-ho Mi Thianghlim, ṭingṭang nên nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah faka ka zai hunin ka hmui hi a hlim êm êm ang a; Ka nunna i tlan pawh hi a hlim êm êm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka lei pawh hian nilêngin i felna thu a sawi ang; Ka chhiatna tûr zawngtute chu an mualphovin an zak ta si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="72" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i rorêlnate chu lal pe la, I felna chu lal fapa pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I mite chu felnain ro a rêlsak ang a, I mi retheite chu rorêlna felin ro a rêlsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tlâng lian leh tlâng tête hian felnain mite hnênah thlamuanna an rawn thlen ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan mi zînga retheite chu ro a rêlsak ang a, Pachhe fate chu a chhandam ang a, Hnehchhiahtu erawh chu a tisawm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ni khi a awm chhûng chuan an hlau vang che, Thla awm chhûng zawng pawhin, chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawng chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chu hlobet râwt chunga ruah angin a tla ang a; Lei châwmtu ruahtui ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A dam lai chuan mi felte chu an duah hluah hluah ang a, Thlamuanna nasa tak chu a duah hluah hluah bawk ang, thla awm loh hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan tuifinriat aṭanga tuifinriat dang thleng pawhin thu a nei bawk ang, Luipui aṭanga kâwlkil thleng pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thlalêra awmte chu a hmaah an kûn ang a; Amah dotute pawh chuan vaivut an liak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tarsis ram leh thliarkâra lalten lâwmman an rawn keng ang a; Seba leh Seba ram lalten thilpêkte an rawn hlân ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ni, lal zawng zawng chu a hmaah an bawkkhup ang a; Hnam tinrêngin a rawng an bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pachhiain a auhvin ani chuan a chhan him ang a, Mi rethei, ṭanpuitu nei lo pawh chu a chhan him ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi rethei leh pachhiate chu a khawngaih ang a, Pachhiate nunna chu a chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An nunna chu hnehchhiahna leh nunrâwnna lak ata a tlan ang a, An thisen chu ani ngaih chuan hlu tak a ni dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tin, an nung ang a, Seba ram rangkachak chu amah pêk a ni ang a; Miten ani chu an ṭawngṭaisak fo vang a, Nilêngin mal an sâwmsak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Leiah, tlâng chungahte hian buh tam tak a awm ang a; A vui chu Lebanon angin a nghîng suau suau vang a, Khuaa mite chu lei hlobet angin an duah hluah hluah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A hming chu kumkhuain a dai lo vang a; A hming chu ni a awm chhûng chuan dai lovin a awm zêl ang. Mite chu amahah chuan malsâwmin an awm ang a; Hnam tinrêngin amah chu nihlawh an ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian, Israel-ho Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se, Amah chauh hian thilmak a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A hming ropui tak hi kumkhuain fakin awm bawk sela; Lei pum pui pawh hi a ropuinaa tihkhahin awm rawh se. Amen! Amen!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Jesaia fapa Davida ṭawngṭainate chu a tâwp ta.
  </para>
  <chapter number="73" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chu Israel-ho chungah a lo ṭha ngei mai, Thinlunga thianghlimte chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei zawngin ka rap pelh ṭhelh ṭhelh a; Ka ke pênte hi a tleu lek lek a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi suaksualte vânneihzia ka hmuh hian, Mi uangthuangte chu ka awt si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An thih lai chuan tuarna rêng an nei lo va; An chakna chu a nghet zâwk mah si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi dang anga hrehawmin an awm lo va; Mi dang anga sawisakin an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuvângin, chapona chuan khaidiat angin an nghâwng a vêl a; Nunrâwnna chuan silhfên angin a tuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thau avângin an mit a pâwng a; Thinlunga duhthusâm aia nasa an nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An nuihsan a, sual takin hnehchhiahna thu an sawi a; Chapo takin an ṭawng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An kâ chu vânahte khian an dah a, An lei chuan leilung hi a fang tlang ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, a mite chu chutah chuan an kîr leh a, Nova tui khat chu anmahni in fai kêlhin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Pathianin engtin nge a hriat ang? Chungnungberan a hre chhuak ang em ni?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />En teh, hêngho hi mi suaksualte an nih hi; Nuamsa taka awm fovin an hausa deuh deuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thlâwn maiin a ni ka thinlung hi ka tihfaia, Ka kutte hi sawisêl bonaa ka sil ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nilêngin sawisakin ka awm a, Tûk tin zilhhauvin ka awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Chutiang chuan ka sawi ang,” lo ti ta ila; Ngai teh, i fateho chhuan chungah vervêk taka ti ka lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chu chu ka hriat theihna tûrzia ka ngaihtuahin, Ka tân a har lutuk a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian hmun thianghlimah ka luha, An tâwpna tûr chu ka ngaihtuah hma chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Anni chu hmun nâl takahte i dah ngei a; Chhiatnaahte i paih thla ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Eng tizia nge mit khap kâr chauhva an ṭiau tâk ni aw! Thil râpthlâk taktea tihboral daihin an awm ta a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Miin men hnua mumang an ngainêp angin, Aw Lalpa , i harh hunin anmahni lem pawh chu i ngainêp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi a lungngai a, Ka rilruah pawh chhun angin ka awm si a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi mâwl leh eng mah hre lo ka ni a, I lakah chuan sa ang mai ka nih hial ṭhin kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, i hnênah ka awm fo va; Ka kut ding lam hi i lo chelh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Nangin i remruatnain mi hruai ang a, Chumi hnuah chuan ropuinaah khian mi lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Vânah khian nang lo chu tu nge ka neih? Leiah pawh hian nang lo chu ka duh tu mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka tisa leh ka thinlung hi a chau ta a; Nimahsela, Pathian chu kumkhuaa ka thinlung chakna tûr leh ka chanvo tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ngai teh, nangmah hlata awmte chu an boral dâwn si a; A uiresantu apiang che chu i tiboral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Keia tân erawh zawng Pathian hnaih hi a ṭha a ni; Lalpa Pathian chu ka inhumhimnaah ka hmang a, I hnathawh zawng zawng thu chu ka hrilh theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="74" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, engati nge kumkhua atân min thlauhthlâk le? Engati nge i ran tlatna hmuna berâmte chungah hian i thinur a khûk le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I mite inkhâwmho, hmasanga i lei, Hnam, i ro atân i tlan kha, hre reng ang che; I awm ṭhinna Zion tlâng nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chhe let dêr tawh chu han fang teh, Dotuten hmun thianghlimah chuan thil sual tinrêng an tih tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangmah dotute chu i mite inkhâwmho zingah an haw haw dur dur a; An chhinchhiahnate chu chhinchhiahna tûrin an târ ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi, ngaw bing thing hreipuia tinte angin an lang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tûnah chuan a thil ker mawi zawng zawng chu hreitê leh tubohtein an tichhe hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I hmun thianghlim chu an hâl a; I hming awmna chu titlusawpin an tibawrhbâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An rilruah chuan, “I tichhe vek hlawm ang u,” an ti a; He rama Pathian inkhâwmna in zawng zawng hi an hâl chhe zo ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan chhinchhiahnate chu kan hmu ta lo va; Zâwlnei rêng rêng an awm ta lo va; A rei tûr chin hria rêng rêng kan zîngah an awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Pathian, dotu chuan eng chen nge a sawi chhiat dâwn che? Hmêlma chuan i hming hi kumkhuain a sawi chhe dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Engati nge i kut, i kut ding lam kha i lâk tâk le? Phawrh chhuak leh la, anniho chu tiboral rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian chu hmasâng chena ka Lal a ni, Lei lai taka chhandamna siam ṭhîntu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang chuan i chaknain tuifinriat kha i tiṭhen a; Nang chuan tuia dragon-ho lute chu i tikeh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang chuan leviathan lute chu i tikeh sawm a, Ani chu thlalêra mi awmte hnênah chuan chaw atân i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang chuan tuihna leh tui lian chu i sah huk a; Nang chuan lui lian tak takte i tikang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chhûn hi i ta a ni a, zân pawh i ta a ni; Nangin êntu leh nî khi i buatsaih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nangin leilung ramri zawng zawng chu i kham vek a; Nangin nipui leh thlasik hi i siam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , hei hi hre reng ang che, dotu chuan a sawi chhiat chia, Hnam â tak chuan i hming an sawi chhiat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw, i ṭhuro nunna hi ram sakawlh hnênah chuan pe lul suh la; I mi retheite nunna hi kumkhua chuan theihnghilh suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuthlung kha rawn pawisa ang che; Lei hmun thim laite chu nunrâwnna awmnain a khat si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, hnehchhiahna tuarte chu mualphovin kîr suh sela; Rethei leh pachhiate chuan i hming fak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Aw Pathian, tho la, nangma thu chu insawi chawp la; Mi â chuan nilênga a sawichhiatna che chu hre reng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nangmah dotute thâwm chu theihnghilh suh ang che; Nang beitute sa mur mur chu a chho fo ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="75" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, lâwmthu kan hrilh a che; Lâwm thu kan hrilh a che, i hming a hnai si a; Miten i thilmak tih thute chu an hril ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hun ka ruatah chuan dik takin ro ka rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lei leh a chunga awm zawng zawngte chu an tui ral zo ta; Keiin a bante chu ka phun a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi uangthuangte hnênah chuan, “Uangthuang takin awm suh u,” ka ti a: Mi suaksualte hnênah, “In ki tisâng suh u,” ka ti bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />In ki chu chung lamah tisâng suh ula; Ring khawng chungin ṭawng suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tihsânna chu chhak lam ata a ni lo va, thlang lam ata a ni hek lo. Chhim lam ata lah a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian chu rorêltu a ni zâwk: Ani chuan pakhat a titlâwm a, pakhat a tisâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa kutah chuan no a awm si a, a uain chu a phûl a; Thil dang nêna chawhpawlhin a khat a, chuta mi chu a bun chhuak a; Matheilovin a nawite nên lam leia mi suaksual zawng zawngte chuan an in fai kêlh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nimahsela, kei chuan kumkhuain ka hriattîr ang a, Jakoba Pathian fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi suaksualte ki zawng zawng pawh ka tansak ang a; Mi felte ki erawh chu tihsânin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="76" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda-ho zîngah chuan Pathian chu hriatin a awm a; Israel-ho zîngah chuan a hming chu a ropui a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Salem-ah chuan a bâwktê chu a awm a, Tin, ama awmna chu Zion-ah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chutah chuan thalte chu a tichhia a; Phaw te, khandaih te, indona te nên. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nang chu i ropuiin i va nasa êm, Râllâk sum dah khâwmna tlângah chuan!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasalṭhate chu rawkin an awm a, An muhîl chu an muhîl hlen ta a; Mi chakte pawh tu mahin an kut an lek thei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Jakoba Pathian, i zilhhauna avângin, Tawlailîr leh sakawr pawh muthilhtîr dêrin an awm ve ve a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang, nangmah ngei chu ṭih tûr i ni a; I thinur tawh phawt chuan, tu nge i mit hmuhah ding thei ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I rorêl thu chu vân aṭangin i hriattîr a; Lei hian a hlau va, a ngawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Leia mi thuhnuairawlh zawng zawngte chhandam tûra, Pathian chu rorêl tûra a thawh lai khân. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mihring thinur chuan a tiropui zual che a, I thinurin a hmaihte chuan i inhrêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu tiam ula, Lalpa in Pathian lakah hlen rawh u; A vêla mi zawng zawng chuan ṭih tûra chu lâwmmante rawn sinsak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan rorêltute huaina chu a sât bung ang a; Ani chu leia lalte tân chuan a hlauhawm a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="77" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka awin Pathian chu ka au vang a; Ka awin Pathian ngei chu ka au vang a, ani chuan ka lamah beng a lo chhi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mangan ni chuan Lalpa ka zawng a; Ka kut hi zânah pawh la thla lovin ka phar reng a; Ka nunna hian thlamuan a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian ka hre reng a, ka buai ṭhîn; Ka ngaihtuah a, ka thlarau hi a chau ṭhîn. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka mitte hi i chelh meng reng ṭhîn a; Ṭawng thei lo khawpin ka mangang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmasâng nite ka ngaihtuah a, Hmânlai kumte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zânah ka ngaihtuah neuh neuh va, Ka dâwn vêl a, ka inzâwt ṭhîn a; Ka thlarau pawhin ṭhahnemngai takin a zawng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan kumkhuain a thlauthla dâwn em ni aw? Eng tikah mah a lâwm dâwn tawh lo vem ni aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A ngilneihna chu a bo hlen kumkhua dâwn em ni aw? A thutiam chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a bo dâwn em ni aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian chuan khawngaih a theihnghilh em ni aw? A lainatnate chu thinurin a khâr ta em ni aw? (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tin, “Chu chu ka chak lohna avâng a ni; Nimahsela, Chungnungbera kut ding lam kumte kha ka hre reng ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“ Lalpa thiltih thute kha ka sawi ang a; Hmasânga i thilmak tihte kha ka hre reng ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I hnathawh zawng zawng kha ka ngaihtuah bawk ang a, I thiltihte pawh kha ka chhût ang e,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i kawng chu hmun thianghlimah a awm a; Kan Pathian ang hi pathian ropui tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang chu thilmak ti ṭhîntu Pathian chu i ni a: Mi tin zîngah chuan i chakzia i hriattîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I bânin i mite i chhan chhuak a, Jakoba leh Josefa fate chu. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Pathian, tuite chuan an hmu chia; Tuite chuan an hmu chia, an hlau va; Tui thûk takte chu an khûr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chhûmte khian tui an leih bua a; Vânte khian aw an chhuah a; I thalte pawh a phe zawk zawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I khawpui ri thâwm chu ṭhâwngaleivirah a awm a; Kâwlphete chuan khawvêl hi a ên zawk zawk a; Lei hi khûrin a nghîng dur dur a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />I kawng chu tuifinriatah a awm a, I kalkawngte chu tui zau takah a awm a, I hniakte pawh hmuh theih a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mosia leh Arona kutin I mite chu berâm rual angin i hruai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="78" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka mite u, ka dân thûah hian beng lo chhi ula; Ka kâa thûahte hian in beng rawn dawh rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tehkhin thuin ka kâ ka âng ang a; Hmasânga thuril sawite kha ka sawi chhuak ang:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Chûng chu kan bengin kan hria a, kan rilruin kan hre bawk a, Min thlahtute pawhin min hrilh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chûng chu an fate lakah kan zêp lo vang a, ṭhangthar lo la awm tûr hnênah Lalpa fakna thu leh, A chakzia leh a thilmak tak tihziate chu kan hril zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakob-ho zîngah thuhriattîr a tinghet a, Israel-ho zîngah dân a ruat a. Chûng chu kan thlahtute hnênah thupêkin a pe a. Anni chuan chûng thu chu an fate hnêna an hriattîr tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭhangthar lo la awm tûr, Naupang lo la piang tûrte chuan, an hriat theih nân; Chûngte chu an thawha, an fate an la hrilh chhâwn zêlna tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />An beiseina chu Pathianah an nghah theiha, Pathian thiltihte chu an theihnghilh lohva, A thupêkte chu an zawm zâwk nân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An thlahtute anga chhuan luhlul leh hel hmang, Chhuan thinlung siam dik lo, Pathian laka rilru rinawm lo pua an awm loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ephraima thlahte chu râlthuama inthuama, thal ngul kengin, Inbeih nîah chuan an tlânchhia a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian thuthlung chu an zâwm lo va. A dân an zâwm lo bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A thiltihte chu an theihnghilh a, A thilmak tih a hmuhtîrte nên khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An thlahtute mit hmuhah thilmak takte a ti ṭhîn, Aigupta ramah, Zoan phûlah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuifinriat chu a tiṭhen phawk a, Anni chu a kal kaitîr a; Tuite chu englo dah khâwm thûr angin a dintîr luah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chhûnah chuan chhûmin a hruai a, Zankhuain mei êngin a hruai bawk ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thlalêrah chuan lungpuite a tiphel a, Tui thûk tak ata ang mai hnianghnâra in tûr a pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lungpui aṭang chuan luite a tichhuak a, Tuite chu luipuite angin a luan thlâktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin a chungah thil an la tisual ta cheu va, Thlalêrah chuan Chungnungbera lakah an hel a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An châkna tihreh nâna ei tûr dîlin, An thinlungin Pathian an fiah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A ni, Pathian an sawi hnâwm a: “Thlalêrah hian Pathianin dawhkân a buatsaih thei em maw chu?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngai teh, lungpui chu a vua a, tuite kha a lo khawh chhuakin, Luite chu a kuang a liam dûl dûl ta tak a; Chaw pawh a pe thei nghâl em maw chu? A mite tân hian sa a buatsaih ang em maw chu?” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Chutichuan, Lalpa chuan a lo hria a, a thin a rim ta a: Jakob-ho chungah mei a lo alh chhuak a, Israel-ho chungah thinurna a lo chho ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pathian an rin lohva, A chhandamna pawh an rin loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Nimahsela, chung lam vân dumte khi thu a pe a, Vân kawngkhârte khi a hawnsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />An ei atân manna kha an chungah a zuk sûrtîr a, Vân buh chu a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mihringten mi chakte chhang chu an ei a; Puarna khawpin chaw a rawn pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Khawchhak thli chu vânah atlehtîr a; A thiltihtheihnain chhim thli chu a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sa chu vaivut zât laiin an chungah a sûrtîr a, Sava thla nei chu tuifinriata ṭiau vaivut zât laiin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />An riahhmun laiah a tlâktîr a, An awmna bûk kiang vêlahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutichuan, an ei a, an puar hle a; An châk chu a pe ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An châk a la reh lo va, An chaw chu an kâah a la awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chumi lai tak chuan Pathian thinurna chu an chungah a chho va, An mi nalh nalh ṭhenkhat a that a, Israel tlangvâlte chu a vaw thlu hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin thil an la tisual ta cheu va, A thilmak tihte chu an ring chuang lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Chuvângin, an dam chhûng nite chu eng mah lo ang maiin a tihralsak a, An dam chhûng kumte chu hlauhnain a tihralsak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Anmahni a thah apiangin amah chu an zawng ṭhîn a. An kîr leh a, zîng takah Pathian an zawng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pathian chu an lungpui a ni tih leh, Pathian Chungnungbera chu an tlantu a ni tih an hre chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Nimahsela, amah chu an kâin an fak der a, An leiin a hnênah dâwt thu an sawi ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />An thinlung chu a lakah a dik si lo va, A thuthlungah chuan an rinawm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nimahsela, ani chu lainatnaa a khah avângin an khawlohna chu a ngaidam a, anni chu a tiboral lo; A ni, vawi tam tak a thinurna chu a la kîr a, A thinrimna chu a zain a chawk tho duh ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tisa chauh an ni tih a hre reng a; Thli, lêt leh lo tûra tleh liam ṭhîn ang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Thlalêrah khân a chungah an va hel zingin, Ram rovah khân amah chu an va tilungngai zing êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Hawikîr lehin Pathian an fiah a, Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima chu an tivui ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A kut chu an hre reng lo va, Dotu laka a chhan him ni chu an hre reng ṭhîn hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Aigupta ramah a chhinchhiahnate a dah a, Zoan phûlah a thilmakte a dah bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />An luipuite leh an luitête chu thisenah a chantîr a; Tichuan, an in thei ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />An zîngah tho tam tak a tîr a, chûng chuan anmahni a ei zo va; Chungûte a tîr bawk a, chûng chuan anmahni a tiboral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />An thil ṭote pawh chu pangang a pe a, An thawh rim rah chu khaukhuap a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />An grêp hruite chu rialin a tithi a, An theipui kûngte pawh chu vûrin a tithi bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />An rante pawh chu rial a pe a, An ran rualte chu ṭêk sa tak a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />A thinur nasa tak chu an chungah a thlâk a, Thinrimna te, lungnih loh êm êmna te, manganna te, Thil ṭha lo tak thlentu tirhkoh pâwl te chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />A thinurna atân chuan kawng a siamsak a, An nunna chu thihna lakah a hum lo va, An nun chu hri a pe ta zâwk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aigupta rama fa tîr awm zawng zawng a tihlum a, Hama puan intea an chakna rah hmasa berte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Nimahsela, ama mite chu berâm angin a hruai chhuak a, Ran rual angin thlalêrah khân a hruai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Him takin a hruai a; chutichuan, eng mah an hlau lo va; Nimahsela, tuifinriat chuan an hmêlmate chu a khuh zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Tin, a hmun thianghlim ramri chu a hruai thleng a, He tlâng, a kut ding lama a leia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Hnam tin chu an hmaah a hnawt chhuak a, Anni chu hruia tehin ro chan atân a sem a, An puan inahte chuan Israel hnamte chu a awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Nimahsela, Pathian Chungnungbera chu an fiah a, a chungah an hel a, A thuhriattîrte chu an zâwm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Hawi kîrin, an thlahtute angin vervêk takin an ti ta zâwk a; Thal ngul rinawm lo angin an kal kawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />An hmun sângtein amah chu an tithinur si a, An milem siamtein an thîktîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Pathianin chu chu a lo hriatin a thin a rim a, Israel-ho chu a ten ta êm êm a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />Chutichuan, Silo biak bûk, Mihring zînga a puan in dah chu a kalsan a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />A chakna chu salah a mantîr a, A ropuina chu dotu kutah a mantîr ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />A mite chu khandaih hnênah a pe a; A ro chan chungah chuan a thin a rim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Meiin an tlangvâlte chu a kâng ral a, An nulate chuan inneihna hla rêng rêng an nei ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />An puithiamte chu khandaiha tihtlûkin an awm a; An hmeithaite chu ṭah rêng rêng an ṭap lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Lalpa chu, mi an muhîl an harh angin a harh ta a, Mi chak uain vânga au ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Amah dotute chu a vaw kîr a, Kumkhaw hmingchhiatna a hlawhtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Chu lo pawh chu Josefa puan in chu a duh lo va, Ephraim hnam chu a thlang lo bawk a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Juda hnam chu a thlang ta zâwk a, A hmangaih Zion tlâng chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />A in thianghlim chu vân sângte ang khian a sa a, Kumkhua atâna a tihngheh leilung ang hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Davida chu a thlang a, Berâm huang ata te chu a la chhuak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />Berâmpui no hruaite zuitu aṭangin a hruai chhuak a, A mite, Jakob-ho leh a ro chan Israel-ho châwm tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Chutichuan, ani chuan a thinlung ṭhatna ang zêlin anniho chu a châwm a; A kut thiamnain a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="79" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, hnam tin i ro chanah hian an lût a; I biak in thianghlim hi an tibawlhhlawh a; Jerusalem hi lung chim khâwmah an siam ta thluah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte ruang chu chunglêng savate chawah an pe a, I mi thianghlimte sa chu ramsate an pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An thisen chu Jerusalem vêlah hian tui angin an leih bua a; Anmahni phûmtu tûr lah tu mah an awm si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kan vêla mite sawichhiatin kan lo awm a, Kan dep vêla mite hmuhsit leh nuihsanin kan lo awm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thinur kumkhua dâwn em ni? I thîkna chu mei angin a alh dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmah hre lo hnam tin chungah hian i thinur chu leih bua ang che, I hming lam lo ram chungahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakob-ho chu an ei zo va, An awmna chu an tiram ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Min thlahtute khawlohnate kha kan lakah chuan hre reng suh ang che! I lainatnate chuan min hmuak thuai rawh se, Nasa taka tihhniamin kan awm ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, min chhandamtu Pathian, i hming ropui nân min ṭanpui la; I hming avângin min chhan him la, kan sualte hi tlêng fai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Engati nge hnam tinin, “Khawiah nge an Pathian kha le?” an tih ni? I chhiahhlawhte thisen chhuak phuba lâkna chu, Kan mit hmuhah hnam tin zîngah hian hriat ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi tâng rûm chu i hmaah thleng rawh se; I thiltihtheihna nasat avângin thi tûra ruatte chu humhim la;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmah an sawichhiatna che kha, Kan vêla mite hi an ângchhûngah a lêt sarihin rûl leh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chutichuan, keini i mite, i ran tlatna hmuna berâmte hian, Kumkhuain lâwmthu kan hrilh ang chia; Chhuan zawng zawng thlengin nangmah fakna chu kan hriattîr zêl ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="80" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Israel-ho Vêngtu, Berâm pâwl anga Josef-ho hruaitu, beng lo chhi ang che; Nang cherub-te chunga ṭhua chu, lo êng chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ephraim-ho leh Benjamin-ho leh Manase-ho mit hmuhah chuan i chakna kha chawk tho la, Min chhandam tûrin lo kal ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pathian, min hawi kîrtîr leh la; I hmêl kha tiêng ang che; tichuan, chhandamin kan awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Eng chen nge i mite ṭawngṭaina chungah hian i thinur dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu mittui chhangin i châwm a, Mittui hi in tûrin tehna lian takin i pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangin kan vêla mite tân inhnialnaah min siam ṭhîn a, Min dotute chu an nui tlâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw, Sipaihote Pathian, min hawi kîrtîr leh la; I hmêl kha tiêng ang che; tichuan, chhandamin kan awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aigupta ram ata grêp hrui i rawn la a; Hnam tin chu i hnawt chhuak a, i phun ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A hma i tifai zêl a, Thûk takin zung a kai a, ram chu a awh ta vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlângte chu a hlima tuamin a awm hlawm a, A pêngte chu Pathian sidar thingte ang mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ṭangte chu tuifinriat thlengin a zâm chhuahtîr a, A chawrnote chu Luipui thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Engati nge a palte chu i tihchhiat ni? Kawnga kal apiangin an pawh thlâk tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ramhnuaia sanghal chuan a tichhia a, Ramsate pawhin an tlân ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, Sipaihote Pathian, khawngaih takin hawi kîr leh ang che; Vân aṭang khân rawn en chhuk la, he grêp hrui hi en la, rawn kan ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A kûng i kut ding lamin a phun leh, A pêng i tâna i tihkhauh nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Meiah a kâng ta, kihin a awm ta; I hmêla zilhhauna avângin an boral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />I kut kha i ding lama mi chungah awm rawh se, Mihring fapa, i tâna i tihchaka chungah hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chutichuan, kan kîrsan lo vang che; Min tiharh la; tichuan, i hming kan lam dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, min hawi kîrtîr leh la; I hmêl kha tiêng ang che; tichuan, chhandamin kan awm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <chapter number="81" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian min tichaktu chawimawiin hlim takin zai ula; Jakob-ho Pathian chawimawiin hlim takin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fakna hla sa ula, khuangtê te, Ṭingṭang ngaihnawm tak te, perhkhuang te nên rawn keng rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thla tharah chuan tawtawrâwt hâm ula, Thla hlei ngaa kan kût nîah nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu chu Israel-ho tâna thuruat a ni si a, Jakob-ho Pathian dân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chu chu Josef-ho zînga thu hriattîr nân a ruat a ni, Aigupta ram aṭanga a kal chhuah lai khân; Ṭawng ka la hriat loh ka hriat kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An koki chu thil rit aṭangin ka la sawn a; An kutte chu kho ka thlahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manganin mi ko va, ka chhan him che u a; Khawpui ri bihrûkna hmunah khân ka chhâng che u a; Meriba tuiahte khân ka fiah che u kha. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, ka mite u, ngaithla ula, ka hriattîr ang che u; Aw Israel-hote u, ka thu ngaithla duh teh ula aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ram dang pathian rêng rêng chu in zîngah a awm tûr a ni lo va; Mi dang pathian rêng rêng chu in be tûr a ni hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kei hi Lalpa in Pathian chu ka ni, Aigupta ram ata hruai chhotu che u kha; In kâ âng zau ula, ka tikhat dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka mite chuan ka aw an ngaithla si lo va; Israel-ho chuan mi duh loh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tichuan, an thinlung sak vângin ka thlahthlam a, An duh ang anga awm tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw, ka mite hian ka thu ngaithlain, Israel-ho hi ka kawngahte hian kal sela chu aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An hmêlmate chu ka titlâwm thuaiin, Anmahni dotute chungah chuan ka kut ka lek tûr.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa hawtute chu a hmaah khûrin an kûn ang a; Kumkhuain hrem an tuar ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nangni chu buhchangrumin ka châwm ang che u a, Lungpuia khawizûin ka titlai ang che u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="82" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian chu Pathian inkhâwmna siamah chuan a ding a; Pathianhote zîngah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Eng chen nge dik lo taka ro in rêl anga, Mi suaksualte chu in duhsak bîk dâwn? (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Retheite leh pa nei lote ro chu rêl ula; Hrehawm tuarte leh pachhiate chungah chuan dik takin ti rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Retheite leh pachhiate chu chhan ula; Mi suaksual kut ata chhan him rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“An hre lo va, hriat thiamna an nei hek lo; Thimah chuan an vei an vei a; Leilung nghahchhan zawng zawng chu a nghîng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />‘Pathiante in ni a, In zain Chungnungbera fate in ni,’ ka tih kha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nimahsela, mihringte ang maiin in la thi ang a, Mi lian pakhat ang khân in la tlu ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Pathian, tho la, lei ro hi rêl ang che; Hnam tinrêng hi i rochung dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="83" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ṭawng lovin awm suh ang che; Aw Pathian, ngawi reng suh la, awm hle hle lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, nangmah dotute chu an sa mur mur a; Nangmah hawtute chu an dâk hraw hraw a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I mite hi vervêk takin an phiar a, I mi thuhrûkte chungah hian a chhe lamin an inrâwn hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Hawh u, an hnam hloh khawpin i tiboral ang u! Israel-ho hming rêng rêng hi hriat renga a awm tawh lohna tûrin,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Thu khat vuain an inrâwn a; I chungah a chhe lama ti tûrin thu an intiam hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Edom-ho leh Ismael-ho puan inte, Moab-ho leh Hagar-hote;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Gebal-ho leh Amon-ho leh Amalek-hote; Philistia-ho Tura khuaa awmte nên;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Assuria-ho pawh an lamah an ṭang ve a; Lota thlahte chu an ṭanpui a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Anniho chu Midian-ho chunga i tih ang te, Kison luia Sisera chunga i tih ang te, Jabina chunga i tih ang te khân ti ve ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu mite chu En-dor khuaah an boral a; Lei tân êkdûr ang mai an lo nih tâk kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An mi liante chu Oreba leh Zeeba ang khân siam la, A ni, an lal zawng zawngte chu Zeba leh Zalmuna ang khân siam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chu mite chuan, “Pathian awmnate chu I luahsak ang u,” an tih kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw ka Pathian, anniho chu vaivut vir chung chung ang hian siam ang che; Buh sisawp thli chhêm lên ur ur ang mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ram kângtu mei ang leh, Tlâng kângtu mei alh ang hian;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anni chu i thlipuiin ûm la, I thli na takin tihlau ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i hming an zawn theih nân An hmêl chu zahnain tikhat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kumkhuain mualpho leh mangang takin awm sela; A ni, tihzaha awmin boral rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangmah chauh hi JEHOVA hming pu, Leilung zawng zawng chunga Chungnungber i nih an hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <chapter number="84" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , I awmnate chu a va duhawm êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna hian Lalpa biak in hung chhûng kawtlaite chu a ngai êm êm a, a ni, a chauh phah hial a; Ka thinlung leh ka tisa hi Pathian nung hnênah chuan a au chhuak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , ka Lal leh ka Pathian, I maichâm bulahte chuan chawngzawngin bu a chhep a, Vamûr pawhin bu a nei, a no dahna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ina awmte chu an eng a thâwl e: Nang chu an fak fo vang che. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmaha chakna nei mi chu a eng a thâwl e; A thinlunga Zion panna lamliante awma chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭahna ruam chu an zawhin tuihna awmnate an siam ṭhîn a, A ni, ruahtui tla hmasa chuan malsâwmnain a khuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chakna aṭangin chak lehzualnaah an kal ṭhîn a, Zion-ah Pathian hmaah chuan an inlan ṭheuh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Ka ṭawngṭaina hi mi ngaihthlâksak la; Aw Jakob-ho Pathian, beng lo chhi ang che. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pathian, kan phaw ber, en teh, I hriakthiha hmêl hi en teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I biak in hung chhûng kawtlaia ni khat awm hi, ni sângkhat aiin a ṭha zâwk si a. Suahsualna puan intea awm ai chuan, Kan Pathian ina kawngkhâr vêngtu nih pawh ka duh zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa Pathian chu ni leh phaw a ni si a; Lalpa chuan khawngaihna leh ropuina a pe ang a: Dik taka awmte lakah chuan thil ṭha rêng rêng a ui lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Sipaihote Lalpa , Nangmah ring mi chu a eng a thâwl e.
  </para>
  <chapter number="85" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , i ram chungah hian i lâwm a; Jakob-ho sala an awm chu i hruai kîr leh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I mite khawlohnate i ngaidam a, An sualna zawng zawng i khuh zo ta a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I thinrimna zawng zawng chu i la bo va; I thinurna nasa tak chu i hawisan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw, min chhandamtu Pathian, min hawi kîrtîr la, Kan chunga i thinurna chu tibâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan chungah i thinur kumkhua dâwn em ni le? I thinur chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin i lantîr zêl dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangmahah chuan i mite an hlim theih nân Min tiharh leh dâwn lâwm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna chu min hmuhtîr la, I chhandamna chu min pe bawk ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian, Lalpa thu sawi tûr chu ka ngaithla ang; A mite leh a mi thianghlimte hnênah thlamuanna thu a sawi dâwn si a; Nimahsela, anni chu âtna lamah hawi leh tawh suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A chhandamna chu amah ṭihtute hnaihah chuan a awm ngei ngei ṭhîn a ni; Kan ramah hian ropuina a awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngilneihna leh thuta an intâwk a; Felna leh remna an infâwp a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thutak chu lei aṭangin a chawr chhuak a; Felna chuan vân aṭangin a rawn en chhuk ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ni, Lalpa chuan thil ṭha a pe ang a; Kan ram hian a thil ṭo chu a pe bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Felna chuan a hma a hruai ang a, A hniakte chu kawngah a siam ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="86" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka lamah hian i beng rawn dawh la, mi chhâng ang che; Rethei leh pachhe tak ka nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna hi vawng ṭha ang che; Pathian ngaihsak mi ka ni si a; Aw, nang ka Pathian, nangmah ringtu, i chhiahhlawh hi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi khawngaih ang che, Nilêngin ka au si ṭhîn chia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh nunna hi tihlim ang che; Aw Lalpa , ka rilru hi i hnênah ka dah tlat si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , nang chu i ṭha a, ngaihdam i peih a, A kotu che apiang chungah ngilneihna i ngah si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ṭawngṭainaah hian beng lo chhi la; Khawngaih ka dîlna aw hi ngaithla ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka mangan ni chuan ka ko vang che; Nangin mi chhâng dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , pathiante zîngah nang ang rêng rêng an awm lo va, I thiltihte ang hi thiltih rêng rêng a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i siam hnam tinrêngte chu an lo kal ang a, I hmaah an lo kûn ang a; I hming chu an rawn chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang chu i ropui si a, thilmakte i ti bawk ṭhîn a; Nangmah chauh hi Pathian i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i kawng chu mi entîr ang che; I thutakah ka awm ang; I hming ṭih tûrin thinlung sakhat mi puttîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, ka thinlung zawng zawngin ka fak ang chia; I hming hi kumkhuain ka chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka chunga i ngilneihna chu a nasain, Ka nunna hi khuarkhurum hnuaihnung ber ata i chhan him si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi chapote chuan mi bei a, Mi nunrâwng awm khâwmte chuan ka nunna hi tihbo tumin an zawng a, nang chu an hmaah an dah ṭhîn lo che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa , nang chu Pathian, lainatnaa khat, mi khawngaih thei, Thinnel, ngilneihna leh thutak ngah i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw, ka lam lo hawi la, mi khawngaih ang che; I chhiahhlawh hi i chakna pe la. I bâwihnu fa hi chhandam ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi duhsakna chu lantîr ang che; Mi hawtute chuan chu chu an hmuha an mualphona tûrin; Lalpa , nangin mi ṭanpui a, mi thlamuan si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="87" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A lungphûm chu tlâng thianghlimahte chuan a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion kulh kawngkhârte chu Jakob-ho awmna zawng zawng aiin a ngaina zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Pathian khawpui, I chungchâng thu ropui takin an sawi ṭhîn a ni. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi hretute zîngah an tel ve tiin, Rahab leh Babulon chungchâng thu ka sawi ang; Philistia leh Tura hi, Ethiopia nên hian, en teh u; He mi hi chuta piang chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, “He mi leh saw mi saw amaha piang an ni a; Chungnungbera ngei chuan amah chu a tinghet ang,” tiin Zion chungchâng thu chu an sawi ang
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpan mi tin hming a ziak hunah chuan, “He mi hi chuta piang chu a ni,” tiin a chhiar ang. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hla satuten, a lâmate nên chuan, “Ka tuihna zawng zawng chu nangmahah a ni a awm ni,” an ti ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="88" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi chhandamtu Pathian, A chhûn a zânin i hmaah ka au ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭaina hi i hnên thleng sela; Ka au thâwmah hian i beng rawn dawh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka nunna hi mangannatein a khat a, Ka nun hian Seol chu a rawn hnaih ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuarkhuruma chhukte zînga chhiar tel ka ni a; Chakna rêng rêng nei lo mi ang ka ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Râl thahho thlâna mute anga mitthi zînga paih thlâk ka ni; Chûngte chu i hriat tawh loh, I kut ata tihboral an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Khuarkhurum hnuaihnung berah mi muttîr ta a, Hmun thim tak, thûk takahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I thinrimna chuan mi delh tlat a, Nangin i tuifâwn zawng zawngin mi tihrehawm ta a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hmêlhriatte chu mi hlatah i awmtîr a; An tâna tenawm takah mi siam ta a; Kârkhipin ka awm a, ka chhuak lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hrehawmna avângin ka mit a chhe telh telh a: Aw Lalpa , ni tin ka ko chia, I lamah ka kutte ka phar a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mitthite tân chuan thilmak i ti dâwn em ni? Thi tawhte chuan thovin an fak dâwn che em ni? (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ngilneihzia chu thlânah hriattîrin, I rinawmzia chu Boralna Hmunah hriattîrin a awm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I thilmak tihte chu thimah hriatin a awm dâwn em ni? I felna chu theihnghilhna ramah hriatin a awm bawk dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kei erawh chuan ka au chia, Ka ṭawngṭaina chuan zîngah a hmuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa , engati nge ka nunna hi i thlauhthlâk le? Engati nge ka lakah i hmai i thup ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka naupan têt ata hrehawm tuar leh thi lek lekin ka awm thîn a; I thil râpthlâk takte ka tuarin ka thauvah mi man ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thinrim nasa tak chuan mi vûr pil a; I thil râpthlâk takte chuan mi tiboral ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chûng chuan nilêngin tui angin mi vêl a, Mi hual vêl hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mi hmangaihtu leh ka ṭhian chu mi hlatah i awmtîr ta a, Ka hmêlhriatte chu thimah i awmtîr ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="89" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa ngilneihna thute chu kumkhuain hlaah ka sa ang a; Ka kâ-in i rinawmzia chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin ka hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ngilneihna chu kumkhua atân rem chhohvin a awm ang; I rinawmna chu vânahte ngei khian i tinghet ang,” ka ti ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka mi thlan hnênah chuan thu ka thlung a, Ka chhiahhlawh Davida hnênah chhia ka chham ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“I thlahte chu kumkhua atân ka tinghet ang a, I lalṭhutphah pawh chhuan zawng zawng thlengin ka rem chho vang,” tiin. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , vânte khian i thilmak tih hi an fak ang a; Mi thianghlimte inkhâwmnaah khian i rinawmna hi an fak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vân dumahte khian Lalpa nêna tehkhin theih tu nge awm ni? Mi thiltithei tak fate zîngah khian Lalpa ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte inrâwn khâwmnaah Pathian hlauhawm tak, A kiang vêla mi zawng zawng aia ṭih ber tûr chu, tu nge awm ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Sipaihote Pathian, Aw Jaa , nang anga mi chak tu nge awm? I rinawmna chu i vêlah a awm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nang chuan tuifinriat chapona chungah ro i rêl ṭhîn a; A tuifâwn invawrh laite chu i tireh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang chuan Rahab chu râl thah angin i tikeh sawm a; Nangmah dotute chu i bân tha chakin i tidarh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vânte khi i ta a ni a, lei pawh hi i ta a ni; Khawvêl leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi nangma din a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhim leh hmâr chu nangma siam a ni a; Tabor leh Hermon chu i hming avângin hlimin an zai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nang chuan bân thiltithei tak i nei a; I kut chu a chak a, I kut ding lam chu chawimawiin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Felna leh rorêlna fel chu i lalṭhutphah nghahchhan a ni a: Ngilneihna leh thutak chu i hmaah an kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thâwm hlimawm hre ṭhîn hnam chu an eng a thâwl e! Aw Lalpa , anni chu i hmêl êngah an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hming avângin nilêngin an hlim ṭhîn a, I felna avângin chawimawiin an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Nang chu an chakna ropuina i ni si a, I duhsakna avângin kan ki hi chawimawiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kan phaw hi Lalpa ta a ni si a; Kan lal hi Israel-ho Mi Thianghlima ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan i mi thianghlimte hnênah inlârnaah thu i sawi a, “Mi pakhat chak tak chungah chuan ṭanpuina ka nghat a; Mi pakhat, mite zînga thlan chhuah chu ka chawimawi ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka chhiahhlawh Davida chu ka chhar a; Ka hriak thianghlim chu amah chu ka thih ta a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka kut hi a hnênah tihnghehin a awm ang a; Ka bân hian ani chu a tichak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hmêlma chuan a ngam lo vang a; Mi sual chuan a titlâwm hek lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Amah dotute chu a hmaah ka vaw thlu ang a, Amah hawtute chu ka sawisa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ani hnênah erawh chuan ka rinawmna leh ka ngilneihna chu a awm ang a; Ka hming avângin a ki chu chawimawiin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A kut chu tuifinriatah chuan ka nghahtîr ang a, A kut ding lam chu luipuiahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ani chuan, ‘Nang chu ka Pa, Ka Pathian, ka inchhandamna lungpui i ni,’ tiin mi au vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tin, keiin ani chu fa tîrah ka siam ang a, Leia lalte zînga chungnung berah ka siam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a tân ka vawn ṭhatsak ang a, Ka thuthlun chu a hnênah a awm nghet ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A chi thlahte chu kumkhuain ka awmtîr ang a, A lalṭhutphah chu vân awm chhûng ni chenin ka awmtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />“A fate chuan ka dân hi an hawisana, Ka rorêlnate anga an awm lohva,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ka thuruat an bawhchhiata, Ka thupêkte an vawn ṭhat loh chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An bawhchhiatnate chu tiangin ka rawn kan ang a, An khawlohnate chu vuakin ka rawn kan ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka ngilneihna chu a hnên ata ka lâksak vek lo vang a, Ka rinawmna chu dâwta chan ka phal hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka thuthlung chu ka bawhchhe lo vang a, Ka hmuia thuchhuak chu ka tidanglam hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Vawi khat ka thianghlimna chhâlin chhia ka chham a; Davida hnênah dâwt ka sawi lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />A chi thlahte chu kumkhuain an awm ang a, A lalṭhutphah chu ka hmaah ni angin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thla angin kumkhua atân tihnghehin a awm ang a, Vân duma hretu rinawm ang khian,” i ti a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Nimahsela, nang chuan i thlauthlain i duh lo va, I hriak thiha chungah chuan i thin a rim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh thuthlun chu i ten a, A lallukhum chu leia paih thla hialin i titlâwm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />A dai zawng zawng chu i titlu a; A kulhbîngte chu i tichhe ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Kawnga kal apiangin a thil an lâksak ṭhîn a; A vêla mite sawichhiatin a lo awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Amah dotute kut ding lam chu i chawimawi a; A hmêlma zawng zawngte chu i tihlim ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />A ni, a khandaih hma chu i bêng per a, Ani chu inbeihnaah chuan i din nghehtîr ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />A ênna chu i tihrehsak a, A lalṭhutphah chu leiah i paih thla ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A tlangvâl lai nite chu i tihtawisak a; Ani chu mualphonain i khuh ta si a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i biru kumkhua dâwn em ni? Eng chen nge i thinrim chu mei anga a alh dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aw, ka hun hi a tawi tûrzia hre reng la: Mihring fate zawng zawng hi i va siam eng mah lo êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Eng mi nge thih ni hmêl hmu lova nunga, Seol kut aṭanga a nunna chhan him tûr chu? (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />Lalpa , i hmânlai khawngaihna, i rinawmnaa Davida hnêna chhechhama i tiamte kha, Khawiah nge a awm tâk?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Lalpa , i chhiahhlawhte an sawi chhiatna hi hre reng ang che; Hnam chak takte zawng zawng sawichhiatna ka ângchhûnga ka tuar ṭhinzia hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmah dotute sawichhiatna, I hriakthiha hniakte sawichhiatna chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Lalpa chu kumkhuain fakin awm rawh se. Amen. Amen.
  </para>
  <chapter number="90" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa, nang chu chhuan zawng zawng chenah kan awmna i ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlângte pian hmaa, Leilung leh khawvêl i din hma pawh khân, Chatuan ata chatuan thleng pawhin nang chu Pathian i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang chuan mihring hi boralnaah i kîrtîr ṭhîn a; “Mihring fate u, kîr leh rawh u,” i ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nanga ngaih chuan kum sângkhat hi nimin ral ta ang lek kha a ni si a, Zân vên khat chhûng ang lek bawk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu tui lian angin i lên bo ṭhîn a, ṭhang khat mu ang chauh an ni; Zîngah chuan hlobet chawr chhuak ang an ni:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zîngah chuan a lo duahin a chawr chhuak a; Tlai lamah chuan ah thlûkin a awm a, a vuai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I thinurnaa tihboralin kan awm a, I thinrimnaa tihmanganin kan awm bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan khawlohnate chu i hmaah i dah a, Kan sual zêp rûkte chu i hmêl êngah i dah ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng ni zawng zawng hi i thinrimnaah a ral ṭhîn a; Kan dam chhûng kumte hi thawnthu angin kan titâwp ṭhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng kumte chu kum sawmsarih a ni a, Chakna avângin kum sawmriat pawh a ni thei e; Nimahsela, a reina chu thawhrimna leh lungngaihna mai a ni; A ral thuai a, keini pawh kan thlâwk bo ṭhîn a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuin nge i thinurna thiltihtheihzia hriaa, Nangmah ṭih tûrzia anga i thinrimna chu hria le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan dam chhûng nite chhiar dân tûr min zirtîr ang che, Finna thinlung kan neih phah hialna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , lo kîr leh ang che; eng chen nge i thinur dâwn? I chhiahhlawhte chung thûah chuan i rilru lamlêt ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Aw, zîngah chuan i ngilneihnain min titlai ang che; Kan dam chhûng zawng zawng hian kan hlima kan lâwm theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nangin min tihhrehawm ni leh, Thil ṭha lo kan tawh kum chhûng hun angte khân min tilâwm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I hnathawh chu i chhiahhlawhte hnênah lang sela, I ropuina chu an fate hnênah lang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tin, Lalpa kan Pathian mawina chu kan chungah awm rawh se; Kan kut hnathawh hi kan chungah tinghet bawk ang che; A ni, kan kut hnathawh hi tinghet ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="91" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Chungnungbera bihrûkna hmuna awma chu, Engkimtitheia hlimah chuan a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chung thûah chuan, “Ani chu ka inhumhimna leh ka kulhpui a ni a; Ka Pathian, ka rina chu a ni,” ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan thangkamtu thang lakah leh Hri ṭha lo tak lakah chuan a chhan him dâwn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thlain a khuh ang chia, A thla hnuaiah chuan i tlu lût ang; A thutak chu phaw tê leh phaw lian a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zâna thil râpthlâk chu i hlau lo vang a, Chhûna thal lo lêng ṭhîn chu i hlau hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thim hnuaia hri lêng ṭhîn chu i hlau lo vang a, Chhûn laia thil tichhe ṭhîn chhiatna chu i hlau hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I sîrah sâng an tlu ang a, I ding lamah sîng an tlu bawk ang; Nimahsela, nang chu a hnaih lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I mitin i en ang a, Mi suaksualte rulhna chu a hmuhin i hmu chauh vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang chu ka inhumhimna i ni si! Chungnungbera chu i awm nân i hmang a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo rêng rêngin a tawk lo vang chia, Hri rêng rêng pawhin i puan in chu a rawn hnaih hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I kawng tinrênga humhim tûr chein, I chung thûah zawng a vântirhkohte chu thu a pe dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An kutin an dâwm ang chia; Chuti lo chuan, i kein lung i chhuih dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sakeibaknei leh rûlrial chu i rap ang a, Sakeibaknei vânglai leh rûlpui chu i chîl nek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka chungah a hmangaihna a nghah tlat avângin ka chhan him ang a, Ka hming a hriat avângin hmun sângah ka hlâng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ani chuan mi ko vang a; tichuan, ka chhâng ang; Kei chu a mangan lai chuan a hnênah ka awm ang a; Amah chu ka chhanhimin ka chawimawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Dam reinain ka tilungawi ang a, Ka chhandamna chu ka hmuhtîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="92" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna lâwmthu sawi leh, Aw Chungnungber, i hming faka zai hi thil ṭha tak a ni a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thil tum theih hrui sâwm nei mi te, perhkhuang te, ṭingṭang ri lung tichhe thei tea zînga i ngilneihna tihlan leh, Zan tin i rinawmna tihlan hi thil ṭha tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa , nang chuan i hnathawhin mi tilâwm si a; I kut thiltihte avângin hlimin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thiltihte chu a va ropui êm! I ngaihtuahnate chu a thûk êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi mâwl chuan hei hi a hre lo va, Mi âin a hre thiam hek lo:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi suaksualte hlobet anga an lo chawra, Thil tisualtute zawng zawng an lo duah hluah hluah hian, Kumkhua atân tihboralin an awm dâwn a lo ni ṭhîn, tih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang erawh chu kumkhua atân sâng taka awm reng i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ngai teh, nangmah dotute hi, Ngai teh, nangmah dotute hi an boral dâwn a ni; Thil tisualtute zawng zawng hi tihdarhin an awm vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nimahsela, ka ki hi selepa ki angin i chawimawi a; Hriak thara thih ka ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka mitin ka hmêlmate chunga ka thu duhsâm thleng chu a hmu ta a, Ka bengin thil ṭha lo titu, mi rawn beitute chunga ka thu duhsâm thleng thâwm chu a hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi fel chu tûm angin a duah hluah hluah ang a, Lebanon tlânga sidar thing angin a ṭhang uak uak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa ina phunte chu Kan Pathian biak in hung chhûng kawtlaiah chuan an duah hluah hluah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tar hnuah pawh an la rah fo vang a; Tui pai ṭeuhvin an hring hluah hluah ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi dik tak a ni tih lantîrna tûrin; Ani chu ka lungpui a ni a, amahah chuan fel lohna rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="93" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu lalah a ṭhu a, a ropuinain a inthuam a; Lalpa chu a inthuam a, chaknain a taiah a inhrêng ta a. Khawvêl pawh hi, a nghîn theih lohna tûrin tihnghehin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I lalṭhutphah chu hmasânga lo tihngheh tawh a ni a; Nang chu chatuana awm tawh i ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , luipuite chuan an chhuah a, Luipuite chuan aw an chhuah a, Luipuite chuan an ri nasa tak chu an chhuah a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tui tam tak awte aiin, Tuifinriat fâwn chak takte ai pawhin, Chung lama Lalpa chu a chak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu a rinawm êm êm a: Aw Lalpa , kumkhuain thianghlimna hi i in nên a inmawi a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="94" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang phuba lâkna thu neitu Pathian, Nang phuba lâkna thu neitu Pathian, êng chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang leia rorêltu, thawk la; Chapote chu an sual man rûl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , mi suaksualte chuan eng chen nge, Mi suaksualte chuan eng chen nge an ngam dâwn le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Anni chu an ṭawng mai mai a, chaltlai takin thu an sawi a; Thil tisualtute zawng zawng chu an infak chawp ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i mite chu an tikeh sawm a, I rochan chu an tihrehawm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hmeithai leh mikhual chu an tihlum a, Pa nei lo chu an that ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“ Lalpan a hmu lo vang a, Jakob-ho Pathianin a ngaihtuah hek lo vang,” an ti ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi zînga mi mâwlte u, ngaihtuah rawh u; Mi âte u, eng tikah nge in fin ang aw?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Beng vuahtu chuan a hre lo vang em ni? Mit siamtu chuan a hmu lo vang em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam tin thununtu chuan a zilhhau lo vang em ni, Mihring finna zirtîrtu chuan?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mihring ngaihtuahte chu eng mah lo mai mai a ni tih a hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa , i thununna dawngtute chu an eng a thâwl e, I dân thu ata i zirtîrna dawngtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mangan ni ata i chawlhtîr dâwn si a, Mi sualte tân khuarkhurum laih zawh a nih hma chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite a paih thla dâwn si lo va, A ro chan chu a kalsan hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Rorêlna chu felna lamah a kîr leh ang a, Thinlung dik tak pu zawng zawng chuan chu chu an zui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tu nge thil ṭha lo titute mi beihsak tûrin tho vang? Tu nge thil tisualtute mi beihsak tûrin ding ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi ṭanpuitu ni suh sela chuan, Ka nunna hi rang takin hmun rehah a awm tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Ka ke a tleu ve,” ka tih khân, Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna chuan mi kai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka rilrua ngaihtuah tam tak ka neih lai chuan, I thlamuannate chuan ka nunna hi a tihlim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Suahsualna lalṭhutphah, dâna thil tihsualna siam ṭhîna chuan pâwlna che a nei dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi fel nunna beih tumin an pung khâwm hlawm ṭhîn a, Thisen sawisêl bo chu thiam loh an chantîr bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Nimahsela, Lalpa chu ka kulhbîng sâng a lo ni a; Ka Pathian chu ka inhumhimna lungpui a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan anmahni sualna ngei chu an chungah a tlâktîr a, Anmahni ṭhat lohna ngeiah chuan a tiboral ang a; Lalpa kan Pathian chuan a tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="95" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw lo kal rawh u, Lalpa chawimawiin hlim takin i zai ang u; Kan inchhandamna lungpui chawimawiin hlim takin i au vang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawiin a hmaah i kal ang u khai, Fakna hla saa amah chawimawiin hlim takin aw i chhuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu Pathian ropui tak a ni si a, Pathian zawng zawng chungah Lal ropui tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama kutah chuan lei hmun thûk takte chu a awm a; Tlâng chhîp sâng takte chu a ta a ni bawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuifinriat hi a ta a ni, ama siam a ni si a; Khawmual pawh hi a kutchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Aw lo kal ula, chibai bûkin i kûn ang u khai; Lalpa min Siamtu hmaah i ṭhingṭhi ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu kan Pathian a ni a, Keini hi a ran tlatna hmuna mi leh, a kuta berâmhote kan ni si a. Vawiin hian a aw chu lo hre teh ula aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Meriba-a an tih ang khân in thinlung tikhauh suh u, Thlalêra Masa ni ang khân:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan in thlahtute chuan mi thlêm a, Mi fiah a, ka thiltih chu an hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kum sawmli chhûng zet chumi chhuanho chungah chuan ka lungni lo va, “An thinlunga ngaihsual hmang mi an ni a, Ka kawngte pawh an hre lo,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, “Ka chawlhnaah chuan an lût lo vang,” tiin, thinurin chhia ka chham ta a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="96" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa chawimawiin hla thar sa ula; Leilung luah zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chawimawiin zai rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chawimawia hla sain a hming fak ula; Ni tin a chhandamna thu chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah a ropuizia hril ula, Mi tinrêngte zîngah a thilmak tihte chu hril rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ropui a, nasa taka fak tûr a ni si a; Pathian zawng zawng aia ṭih tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mipuiho pathiante chu milemte an ni si a, Lalpa erawh chuan vânte khi a siam a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chawimawina leh ropuina a hmaah an awm a; Chakna leh mawina chu a hmun thianghlimah an awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi tina chi tinrêngte u, Lalpa chu pe ula, Lalpa chu ropuina leh chakna pe rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu a hming ropuina chu pe ula; Thilhlan tûr kengin a biak in hung chhûng kawtlaiahte chuan lo kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw, thianghlim mawina inbelin Lalpa chu chibai bûk ula; Leilung luah zawng zawngte u, a hmaah khûr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah chuan, “ Lalpa chu lalah a ṭhu,” ti rawh u; Khawvêl pawh hi a nghîn theih lohna tûrin tihnghehin a awm a, Ani chuan thlei bîk nei lovin mi tin ro chu a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vânte khi lâwm takin awm sela, lei pawh hi hlim takin awm rawh se; Tuifinriat leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi ri hum hum rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lo leh a chhûnga awm zawng zawng hi lâwm takin awm rawh se: Chutih hunah chuan ramhnuaia thing zawng zawng hi hlimin an zai ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan; ani chu a lo kal dâwn a ni, Lei rorêl tûrin a lo kal dâwn si a; Khawvêl hi fel takin ro a rêlsak ang a, Mi tinte chu a thutakin ro a rêlsak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="97" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu lalah a ṭhu a; lei hi hlim takin awm sela; Thliarkâr tam takte chu lâwm takin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chhûmte leh thim chhah mup chu a vêlah a awm a; Felna leh rorêlna fel chu a lalṭhutthlêng nghahchhan a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hma lamah chuan mei a kal a, A vêla amah dotute chu a kâng ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kâwlphete chuan khawvêl hi a ên zawk zawk a; Lei hian a hmu a, a khûr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tlângte chu khawihnûn ang hian Lalpa hmaah a tui ral ta a, Khawvêl zawng zawng Lalpa hmaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vânte khian a felna chu a tlângaupui ṭhîn a, Mi tinrêng chuan a ropuizia an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Milem siam chawpte rawngbâwltu zawng zawng chu mualphovin awm rawh se, Milem chhuangtute chu. Nangni pathian zawng zawngte u, amah chu chibai bûk rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zion tlâng chuan a hria a, lâwm takin a awm a, Juda fanute chu hlim takin an awm bawk a, Aw Lalpa , i rorêlnate avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa , nang chu leilung zawng zawng chungah hian chungnung ber i ni si a; Nang chu pathian zawng zawng chung daihah chawimawiin i awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hmangaihtute u, sual haw rawh u. Ani chuan a mi thianghlimte nunna chu a vawng ṭha ṭhîn a; Anni chu mi suaksualte kut ata a chhan him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi felte tân khua a lo êng a, Thinlung dikte tân lâwmna a lo thleng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi felte u, Lalpa -ah lâwm takin awm ula; A hming thianghlim chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="98" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa chawimawiin hla thar sa rawh u; Thil mak takte a ti ta si a; A kut ding lam leh a bân thianghlim chuan a tân chhandamna a siamsak ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a chhandamna chu a hriattîr a; A felna chu hnam tin mit hmuhah chuan fiah takin a lantîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Israela chhûngte chunga a ngilneihzia leh a rinawmzia chu a hre reng a; Kâwlkila mi zawng zawng pawhin kan Pathian chhandamna chu an hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Leilung luah zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chawimawiin hlim takin au ula; Au chhuak ula, hlimin zai rawh u, a ni, fakna hla sa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ṭingṭang nên Lalpa fakin zai rawh u, Ṭingṭang leh fakna hla thâwm nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tawtawrâwtte leh tawtawrâwt bi nei ri nên, Lalber, Lalpa hmaah chuan, hlim takin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuifinriat leh a chhûnga thil awm zawng zawng hi ri hum hum rawh se; Khawvêl leh a chhûnga chêngte nên hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Luipuite chuan an kut bêng sela; Tlângte chu hlimin zai ho rawh se,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa hmaah chuan, lei rorêl tûrin a lo kal dâwn si a. Khawvêl hi fel takin ro a rêlsak ang a, Thlei bîk nei lovin mi tin ro chu a rêl ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="99" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu lalah a ṭhu a; mi tin chu khûr rawh se! Ani chu cherub-te chungah a ṭhu a; lei hi nghîng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chu Zion khaw chhûngah chuan ropui tak a ni a; Mi tinrêngte chungah chuan chungnung daih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Anni chuan i hming ropui tak leh hlauhawm tak chu fak rawh se- Amah chu a thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalber chakna chuan rorêlna a ngaina a; Nang chuan thlei bîk neih lohna i tinghet ṭhîn a, Nang chuan Jakob-ho zîngah ro i rêl a, fel takin i ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian chu chawimawi ula, A ke nghahchhan bulah chuan chibai bûk rawh u: Amah chu a thianghlim a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A puithiamte zîngah chuan Mosia leh Arona, A hming lamtute zîngah chuan Samuela; Anni chuan Lalpa chu an ko va, ani chuan a chhâng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chhûm dingah chuan an hnênah thu a sawi a: A thuhriattîrte leh thuruat a pêk chu an zâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa kan Pathian, nang chuan anni chu i chhâng a; Nang chu anmahni ngaidamtu Pathian i ni, An thiltih chungahte phuba la ṭhîn mah la.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian chu chawimawi ula, A tlâng thianghlimah chuan chibai bûk rawh u; Lalpa kan Pathian chu a thianghlim si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="100" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ram zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chawimawiin hlim takin au rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lâwm chungin Lalpa rawng bâwl ula; Hla sa chungin a hmaah lo kal rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu Pathian a ni tih hre rawh u; Min siamtu chu amah chu a ni a, ama ta kan ni; A mite leh a ran tlatna hmuna berâmhote chu kan ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawi chungin a kawngkhârah chuan lût ula, Fak chungin a biak in hung chhûng kawtlaiah chuan lût rawh u. A hnênah lâwmthu sawi ula, a hming chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ṭha si a; a ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm ang a; A rinawmna chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="101" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngilneihna leh rorêlna thu chu hlaah a sa ang a; Aw Lalpa , nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kawng ṭha famkimah chuan fing takin ka awm ang a: Aw, eng tikah nge ka hnênah i lo kal ang? Ka in chhûngah thinlung ṭha famkim puin ka awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thil ṭha lo rêng rêng ka mit hmuhah chuan ka dah lo vang; Kal pêngte thiltih chu ka hua a ni; Keimahah a bet lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thinlung luhlul chuan mi kalsan ang a; Thil sual rêng rêng ka hre lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tu pawh a vêngte a rûka rêl apiang chu, chu mi chu ka tiboral ang a; Mit sâng leh thinlung chapo pu mi chu ka ngaithei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />He rama mi rinawmte chungah hian ka mit a fu ang, ka hnêna an awm theih nân; Kawng ṭha famkim zawhtu chu, chu mi chuan ka rawng a bâwl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Bum hmang mi chu ka in chhûngah a awm lo vang a; Dâwt heh mi chu ka mit hmuhah tihnghehin a awm lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tûk tin he rama mi suaksual zawng zawng hi ka tiboral ang; Lalpa khawpui ata hi thil tisualtute zawng zawng tiboral tûrin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="102" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla la, Ka au thâwm hi i hnên thleng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka mangan nîah ka lakah hian i hmai thup suh la; Ka lamah hian i beng rawn dawh la; Ka koh hun che chuan mi chhâng thuai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng nite hi meikhu angin a zâm ral a, Ka ruhte hi thingthu nung angin a sâ a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka thinlung hi hlobet anga em hlumin a awm a, a vuai zo ta; Chaw ei pawh ka theihnghilh si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka rûm thâwm avângin ka ruhte hi ka tisaah a bet tlat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Thlalêr tuivalawng ang ka ni a; Khaw ram chhimbuk ang mai ka lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka meng reng a, Chawngzawng, in chunga amah chauhva awm ang ka lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi dotute chuan nilêngin mi sawi chhe ṭhîn a; Ka chunga kawlhte chuan keimah anga awm tûrin ânchhia an lawh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vut hi chaw angin ka ei a, Ka in tûr chu mittui nên ka pawlh ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I lungnih loh êm êm leh i thinur avângin, Nangin mi la kâng a, mi paih bo ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng nite hi hlim ral lam tung tawh ang a ni a; Hlobet angin ka vuai ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang erawh chu kumkhuain i awm ang a; Nangmah hriat rengna pawh chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I tho vang a, Zion tlâng chu i khawngaih ang; Ani chu khawngaih a hun tawh si a, a ni, hun ruat chu a thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte chuan a lungte chu an ngainain, A vaivut pawh an khawngaih si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutichuan, hnam tinin Lalpa hming chu an ṭih ang a, Leia lal zawng zawng chuan i ropuina chu an ṭih bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion khua chu a din leh ta si a, A ropuinaa inthuamin a lang ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachhiate ṭawngṭaina chu a ngaihsak a, An ṭawngṭaina chu a hmusit lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chu chu ṭhangthar lo la awm tûr tân chuan ziak a ni ang a, Siama lo la awm tûr hnam chuan Lalpa chu an fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan a hmun thianghlim sâng tak aṭangin a zuk en a; Lalpa chuan vân aṭang khian lei hi a hmu a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi tâng rûm chu ngaithla tûr leh, Thi tûra ruatte chu phelh tûrin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa rawngbâwl tûra mi tin leh ram tin an inkhâwm huna, Miten Lalpa hming chu Zion khuaa an hril theiha, A fakna thu chu Jerusalem khuaa an hril theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan kawng lakah hian ka tha a tiṭhum a; Ka dam chhûng hi a titawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Aw ka Pathian, ka vânglai niahte hian mi la bo suh ang che,” ka ti a; Nanga kumte chu chhuan awm chhûng zawng zawngin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Leilung nghahchhan chu hmasânga i phûm tawh a ni a; Vânte pawh i kutchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chûngte chu a la boral ang a, nang erawh chu i awm reng ang: A ni, chûng zawng zawngte chu silhfên angin a la hlui ang a; Puan angin i thlâk ang a, a lo danglam tawh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Nang erawh chu i pângngai fo va, I kumte chuan ral ni rêng a nei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />I chhiahhlawhte fate chu an awm reng ang a, An thlahte chu i hmaah tihnghehin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="103" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak la; Ka kawchhûnga awm zawng zawngte u, a hming thianghlim chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak la, A thiltih ṭhat zawng zawng chu theihnghilh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan i khawlohna zawng zawng a ngaidam ṭhîn a; I natna zawng zawng a tidam ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Boralna lak ata i nun chu a tlan ṭhîn a; Ngilneihna leh lainatnate a khumtîr ṭhîn chia;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I kâ chu thil ṭhain a titlai ṭhîn a; Chutichuan, i tleirâwlna chu mupui anga siam tharin a awm leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hnehchhiahna tuar zawng zawngte tân, Thil felte tihsakin, rote a rêlsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kawngte chu Mosia a hriattîr a, A thiltihte chu Israela thlahte a hriattîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu lainatnaa khat, mi khawngaih thei tak, Thinnel tak, ngilneihna ngah tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan a hau fo lo vang a; A thinur chu a pai kumkhua hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan sualnate angin kan chungah a ti lo va, Kan khawlohnate angin min thungrûl hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vân khi lei chung sâng taka a awm angin, Amah ṭihtute chunga a ngilneihna chu a nasa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chhak leh thlang a inhlat ang hian, Kan bawhchhiatnate chu kan hnên ata a dah sawn ta daih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pain a fate a khawngaih ang hian, Lalpa chuan amah ṭihtute chu a khawngaih ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan taksa siam dân hi a hriata, Vaivut mai kan ni tih a hriat reng avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihring zawng, a dam chhûng nite chu hlobet ang a ni a; Phûl pangpâr ang hian a vul ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thliin a chhêm a, a bo ṭhîn a ni, A awmna chuan a hre leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa ngilneihna erawh chu amah ṭihtute chungah chuan chatuan ata chatuan thlengin a awm ang a, A felna pawh an tuchhuan thlengin a awm ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thuthlun zâwm apiangte leh, A thuhrilhte âwih tuma hre reng apiangte chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a lalṭhutphah chu vânahte khian a tinghet a; A ram chuan engkim chungah ro a rêl a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A vântirhkohte u, a thu ngaithlaa a thu zâwm ṭhîn, chaknaa ropuite u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A sipaihote u, a duh zâwng ti ṭhîn, a rawngbâwltute u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A rorêlna hmun zawng zawnga a thiltih zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u; Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak rawh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="104" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak rawh. Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, nang chu i ropui êm êm a, Chawimawina leh ropuinain i inthuam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nang chuan êng chu puan angin i inbel a; Vânte khi puan in chung angin i kai pharh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan a pindan chungnung kalkhangte chu tuiahte khian a khang a, Chhûmte khi a tawlailîrah a siam a; Thli thla chungahte chuan a lêng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A vântirhkohte chu thli-ahte a chantîr a; A rawngbâwltute chu mei alh dur durah a chantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leilung nghahchhante chu a phûm a, Kumkhuaa a nghîn loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang chuan leilung hi tui thûk tak chu puan angin i sintîr a; Tuite chu tlâng chungahte chuan a awm po va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I zilhhauna avâng chuan a tlân bo va; I khawpui ri thâwm avâng chuan a kal bo ta thuai a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tlângahte a chho va, kawrahte a chhuk a, A tân hmun i buatsaih lamah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A pelh loh tûrin ri i kham a; Lei chîm pil tûra a lêt leh tawh lohna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan kawrahte chuan tuihnate a tîr chhuak a; Tlâng kârahte chuan a luang a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chûngte chuan ramsa tinrêngte in tûr a pe ṭhîn a; Ram sabengtungte chuan an tuihâl an tireh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A kamahte chuan chunglêng savaten awmna an nei ṭhîn a, Thing buk zîngahte chuan an hrâm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan a pindan chungnung aṭang te khian tlângte chu tuiin a châwm ṭhîn a, Lei hi i thiltih rahtein a tlai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hlobet chu rante tân a ṭotîr ṭhîn a, Thlai chu mihring hmanah a ṭotîr bawk ṭhîn; Lei aṭangin ei tûr a chhuahtîr theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihring thinlung tihlâwmna uain nên, A hmai tihmawmna tûr hriak nên, Mihring thinlung tihchakna chhang nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa thingte chu a tlai ṭhîn, Lebanon tlânga sidar thing a phunate chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutah chuan savaten bu an chhep ṭhîn, Vacha erawh chu fâr thingte chu a in a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tlâng sângte chu sathâr tân a ni a, Lungpuite chu sazupui tân inhumhimna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ani chuan thla khi hunbi hriat nân a ruat a, Ni khian a tlâk hun chu a hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang chuan thim i siam a, zân a lo ni ṭhîn a; Chumi hunah chuan ramhnuaia sa tinrêngte chu an tla chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sakeibaknei vânglaite chuan an sa seh tûr chu hâhum zuiin, Pathian hnên ata an ei tûr an zawng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ni a chhuak a, an kal bo va, An awmna pûk ṭheuhvahte chuan an mu ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mihring chu hna thawkin a chhuak a, Tlai lam thlengin a thawk rim ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thiltihte chu a va tam êm! Finnain i siam vek a ni: Leilung hi i hausaknain a khat a nih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sawta saw tuifinriat a awm, nasa tak, zau tak mai chu, Sawmi-ah sâwn thil bawkvâka kal chhiar sên loh a awm a, Sa tê leh sa liante chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Sawta saw lawngpuite a kal saw; Sawtah sâwn leviathan a awm, a chhûnga inkhêl tûra i siama chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chûng zawng zawng chuan an nghâk ṭheuh che a ni, A hun taka an chaw i pêk ṭheuh ṭhinna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Anmahni i pêk apiang an chhar ṭhîn a; I kut i phar a, ṭhatnain an tlai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />I hmai i thup a, an mangang ṭhîn a; An thaw chu i lâksak a, an thi a, An vaivutah chuan an kîr leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />I thlarau chu i tîr chhuak a, siamin an awm ṭhîn a; Lei chung pawh hi i siam thar leh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Lalpa ropuina chu kumkhuain awm sela; Lalpa chu a thiltihahte chuan hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ani chuan lei hi a en a, a khûr ṭhîn a; Tlângte chu a khawih a, a khu chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng zawngin Lalpa chawimawiin hla ka sa ang a, Ka nun chhûng zawngin ka Pathian fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka ngaihtuahna hi a tân thlum tak ni rawh se; Kei chu Lalpa -ah chuan ka hlim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mi sualte chu lei aṭang hian tihboralin awm sela, Mi suaksualte chu awm tawh suh se. Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak rawh. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="105" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lawm thu hril ula, a hming lam rawh u; Mi tin zîngah chuan a thiltihte chu hriattîr rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Amah chawimawiin hla sa ula, amah fakin zai rawh u; A thilmak tih zawng zawng thu chu tîtî rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hming thianghlim chu chhuang rawh u; Lalpa zawngtute thinlung chu hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa leh a chakna chu zawng ula; A hmêl chu zawng fo rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw, a chhiahhlawh Abrahama thlahte u, Jakoba thlah, a thlante u, A thilmak tihte hre reng rawh u; A thilmakte leh a kâa a rorêl chhuakte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chu Lalpa kan Pathian chu a ni a; A rorêlte chu lei chung zawng zawngah hian a awm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thuthlun chu kumkhuain a hre ṭhîn a, Chhuan sângkhat thlenga a thu lo pêk chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Abrahama hnêna a thuthlun leh, Isaaka hnêna a chhechham chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chu vêk chu thuruat atân Jakoba hnênah a tinghet a, Israela hnêna kumkhaw thuthlung atân:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kanaan ram hi ka pe ang che, I ro chanpual tûr chu,” tiin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi tlêm tê chauh an nih lai khan; A ni, tlêm tê mai, chumi ramah chuan mikhual an ni nghâl si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hnam hrang hrang hnênah an kal lâwr an kal lâwr a, Ram hrang hrang aṭangin mi hrang hrang hnênah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu ma hnehchhiah a phal lo va; A ni, anmahni avângin lalte pawh a zilhhau va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ka hriak thihate chu tawk suh ula, Ka zâwlneite pawi rêng rêng pawh khawih suh u,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi rama tla tûrin ṭâm a ko va; Ei tûr rêng a awm lohtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An hmaah mi a tîr a; Josefa chu chhiahhlawh atân hralhin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A kete chu kawlin a tina a; Thîr khaidiat bunin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu a thlen hma loh chuan, Lalpa thuin amah chu a fiah ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalber chuan mi a tîr a, a phelh a, A chhuah ta a, mi tin rorêltu ngei chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A chhûngte chunga hotuah leh, A sum zawng zawng chunga rorêltuah a siam a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A mi liante chu duh duha phuar tûr leh, A upaho tifing tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Israela pawh chu Aigupta ramah a kal a; Jakoba chu Hama ramah chuan a awm ta rih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A mite chu nasa takin a tipung a, Anmahni dotute aiin a tichak ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A mite haw tûrin an thinlung a inlamlêttîr a, A chhiahhlawhte chunga vervêk taka ti tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Mosia chu a tîr a, A mi thlan Arona nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Anni chuan a chhinchhiahnate chu an zîngah an entîr a, Hama ramah chuan thilmakte an entîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ani chuan thim a tîr a, a tithim ta a; Tichuan, a thute chu an hnial ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />An tuite chu thisenah a chantîr a, An sanghate chu a tihlum ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />An ram chu chungûin a khat ta a, An lalte pindanah lam pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chuan thu a sawi a; tichuan, tho tam tak an lo kal a, Hrik pawh an ram chhûng zawng zawngah a lo kal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />An hnênah ruah aiah rial a pe a, An ramah chuan mei alh zawk zawk a pe ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />An grêp hruite leh an theipui kûngte a tithi a; An rama thingte chu a titliak bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ani chuan thu a sawi a; tichuan, khaukhuapte an lo kal a, Pangangte nên, chhiar sên rual loh mai hian.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Chûngte chuan an rama thlai tinrêng chu an ei zo va, An lei rahte pawh an ei zo ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An rama fa tîr awm zawng zawng a tihlum a, An chakna zawng zawng rah hmasa berte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Tichuan, tangkarua leh rangkachak nên a hruai chhuak ta a, Ama hnamte zîngah chuan mi chak lo pakhat mah an awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />An chhuah lai chuan Aigupta-ho chu an lâwm a; Anni chu an lo hlauh tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Ani chuan hliahtu atân chhûm a zâmtîr a, Zâna ên tûrin mei a pe bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />An dîl a; tichuan, vahmîm a rawn hruai a, Vân chawin anmahni a titlai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Lungpui chu a hawng a; tichuan, tui a lo chhuak dur dur a, Hmun rovahte chuan lui ang maiin a luang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />A thu thianghlim kha a hre reng si a, A chhiahhlawh Abrahama nên khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tichuan, a mite chu hlim takin a hruai chhuak ta a, A mi thlante chu hla sa chung zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Tin, hnam tin ramte chu a peksak a; Anni chuan mi tin thawh chhuah sa chu an luah ta a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thuruatte chu an zawm theiha, A dânte chu an vawn ṭhat theih nân. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="106" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Aw Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u; ani chu a ṭha si a. A ngilneihna pawh kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tu nge Lalpa thiltih ropui takte chu sawi theia, A fakna zawng zawng hriattîr vek thei le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Rorêlna vawng ṭhate chu an eng a thâwl e, Eng lai pawha fel taka titu nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i mite i duhsaknain mi hre reng la, Aw, i chhandamna nên mi kan ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I mi thlante nihlawhna ka hmuh theiha, I ro chanho nêna ka chhuan theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kan thlahtute nên khân thil kan tisual a, Thil sual kan ti a, sual takin kan ti ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Min thlahtute khân Aigupta rama i thilmak tihte kha an hre thiam lo va; I ngilneihna nasa tak kha an hre reng ta lo va, Tuifinriatah an hel ta zâwk a, Tuifinriat Senah khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin ama hming avângin anni chu a chhandam ta a, A thiltihtheihna ropui tak chu a hriattîr theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuifinriat Sen chu a zilhhau va; tichuan, a kang ta a; Chutichuan, anni chu thlalêra hruai tlang ang maiin tui thûk takahte chuan a hruai tlang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Anmahni hawtu kut ata chu a chhandam a, Hmêlma kut ata chu a tlan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuite chuan anmahni dotute chu a khuh zo va. Pakhat mah dama chhuak an awm ta lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan a thute chu an ring a; A fakna hla an sa a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nimahsela, a thiltihte chu an theihnghilh ta thuai a; A remruat chu an nghâk peih lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thlalêrah chuan thil an châk êm êm a, Ram rovah chuan Pathian an fiah ta zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An thil dîl chu a pe a; Nimahsela, an nunnaah chuan chêrna a luhtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An riahhmunah chuan Mosia chu an îtsîk a, Lalpa mi thianghlim Arona nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lei chu a âng a, Dathana chu a lem a, Abirama pâwlte chu a khuh zo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An pâwl zîngah chuan mei tihalhin a lo awm a; Meialh chuan mi suaksualte chu a kâng ral ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Horeb tlângah chuan bâwngno lem an siam a, A lem chhûn chu an be ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an ropuina chu bâwngpa, hlobet ei mi ang lekah an chantîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Pathian, an chhandamtu chu an theihnghilh ta a, Aigupta rama thil ropui tak tak,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />(Hama ramah thilmak takte, Tuifinriat Sen kamah thil râpthlâk takte) titu chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chuvângin, a tiboral dah ang e, tia a thinrim tikîr tûrin, A mi thlan Mosia chu a luhna tûrah chuan a hmaah ding lo phei sela chuan, A tiboral ang tih a sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A ni, ram duhawm tak chu an ngainêp a, A thu chu an ring duh lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />An puan inahte chuan an phunnawi ta zâwk a, Lalpa aw chu an ngaithla duh lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Chuvângin, an lamah chuan a kut a phar a, Anniho chu thlalêra a tihtlûkna tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />An chi thlah tûrte chu hnam tin zînga a tihtlûka, Ram tina a tihdarhna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Baal-peor lamah chuan an bet a, Mitthi hnêna thilhlante chu an ei ve ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an thiltihtein ani chu an tithinur a; Tichuan, hri chu an chungah a lo lêng ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Chutih lai chuan Phinehasa chu a ding a, ro a rêl a; Tichuan, hri chu tihrehin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Chu chu a felnaa ruat a ni, Kumkhuain, chhuan zawng zawng thlengin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Meriba tuiahte pawh chuan ani chu an tithinur a, Chutichuan, anmahni avângin Mosia chungah thil ṭha lo a thleng ta hial a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />A thlarau chunga an hela, A hmuia ṭha lo taka a sawi avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Lalpan an hnêna tihboral thu a pêk angin mipuite chu an tiboral lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Hnam tin chu an pawlh a, An thiltihte chu an zir zâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />An milem rawng te an bâwl a; Chûng chu an tân thang a lo ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />A ni, ramhuai hnênah te chuan an fapate, an fanutein an inthawi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Thisen sawisêl bo, an fapate leh an fanute thisen ngei chu an chhuah ta a. Chûngho chu Kanaan ram milemte hnênah an inthawi a; Chumi ram chu thisenin a lo bawlhhlawh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Chutiang chuan an hnathawhtea tihbawrhbânin an awm a, An thiltihahte chuan an lo uirê ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa thin chu a mite chungah a thawk a, A ro chan chu a ten ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Tichuan, anni chu hnam tin kutah a pe a; Anmahni hawtute chuan an chungah ro an rêl ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Anmahni dotuten an hnehchhiah a, An kut hnuaiah chuan tihtlâwmin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Vawi tam tak anni chu a chhan him a; Nimahsela, a remruatnaah chuan an hel ṭhîn a, An khawlohnaah chuan tihhniamin an awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chuti chung pawhin ani chuan an au thâwm a hriat chuan, An mangang chu a ngaihsak a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />A thuthlun chu anmahni a hriatsak reng a, A ngilneihna nasat avângin a rilru a inlamlêt ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Sala hruaitu zawng zawngte chu Anmahni a khawngaihtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Aw Lalpa kan Pathian, min chhandam la, Hnam tin zîng ata min hruai khâwm ang che, I hming thianghlim chu fak tûr leh i fakna chhuang tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />Lalpa , Israel-te Pathian chu fakin awm rawh se, Chatuan ata chatuan thleng pawhin. Mi zawng zawng chuan, “Amen,” ti rawh se. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="107" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u, ani chu a ṭha si a; A ngilneihna pawh kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa mi tlante chuan chutiang chu sawi rawh se, Dotu kut ata a tlan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ram tin ata a hruai khâwm, Chhak leh thlang, chhim leh hmâr atate chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thlalêra ram ro kawngah chuan an vâk an vâk a; Mihring awmna khua rêng rêng an hmu lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Rilṭâm leh tuihâlin An nunna chu an kawchhûngah a chau ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chu veleh, an buainaah chuan Lalpa chu an au va, Ani chuan an manganna atate chu a chhan him a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihring awmna khuaa an kal theih nân kawng ngîl takah a hruai ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw, mihringte hian Lalpa chu a ngilneihna avâng leh, Mihring fate chunga a thilmak tihte avâng hian fak teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan nunna thil châk êm êm chu a titlaiin, Nunna rilṭâm chu ṭhatnain a tipuar si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thim hnuaiah leh thihna hlima ṭhua, Hrehawmna leh thîra phuarte chu;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pathian thu chungahte an hela, Chungnungbera remruat chu an ngaihnêp avângin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ani chuan an thinlung chu thawh rimnain a hmin ta a; An tlu a, ṭanpuitu tûr rêng rêng an awm si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chu veleh, an buainaah chuan Lalpa chu an au va, Ani chuan an manganna atate chu a chhandam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thim hnuai ata leh thihna hlim ata chu a hruai chhuak a, An phuarnate chu a tichat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aw, mihringte hian Lalpa chu a ngilneihna avâng leh, Mihring fate chunga a thilmak tihte avâng hian fak teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ani chuan dâr kawngkhârte chu a tichhia a, A kalhna thîr tlâwnte chu a tibung ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi âte chu an bawhchhiatna avâng leh, An khawlohnate avângin an intihrehawm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />An nunna chuan ei tûr tinrêng hi a ten a; Thihna kulh kawngkhârte chu an hnaih ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu veleh, an buainaah chuan Lalpa chu an au va, Ani chuan an manganna atate chu a chhandam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A thu chu a tîr chhuak a, anni chu a tidam ṭhîn a, An boralna tûr atate chu a chhan him ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw, mihringte hian Lalpa chu a ngilneihna avâng leh, Mihring fate chunga a thilmak tihte avâng hian fak teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chuan lâwmthu sawi inthawinate chu hlân sela, A thiltihte chu hla sain hril rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuifinriatah lawng liana zuk kala, Tui zau tak chungtea hnathawk ṭhînte chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Chûngte chuan Lalpa thiltihte leh, Tui thûk taka a thilmak tihte chu an hmu ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan thu a pe a, thlipui a tlehtîr a, Chu chuan a tuifâwnte chu a tisâng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Vânah an chho tual tual a, thûk takah an chhuk leh tual tual ṭhîn a: Manganna avângin an nunna chu a tui ral ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zu rui angin an thle an thle a, an pai thlawk thlawk a, Awm ngaihna rêng rêng an hre ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Chu veleh, an buainaah chuan Lalpa chu an au va, Ani chuan an manganna atate chu a hruai chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Thlipui chu a tibâng ṭhuap a; Chutichuan, a tuifâwnte chu a reh ṭhup ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tin, a reh tâk avângin an lâwm ṭhîn a; Ani chuan an ngaih tak thli ûpah chuan a hruai thleng ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Aw, mihringte hian Lalpa chu a ngilneihna avâng leh, Mihring fate chunga a thilmak tihte avâng hian fak teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Anni chuan mipui inkhâwmnaah amah chu fak sela, Upaho ṭhutnaah chuan fak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ani chuan luipuite chu thlalêrah a chantîr ṭhîn a, Tuihnate chu lei rovah a chantîr bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ram ṭha chu ram ro alah a chantîr ṭhîn, A chhûnga awmho suahsual avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Thlalêr chu dîlah a chantîr ṭhîn a, Ram ro chu tuihnaahte a chantîr bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Chutah chuan rilṭâmte chu a awmtîr ṭhîn, Awmna tûr khua an buatsaiha,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Lote an neiha, grêp huante an siama, A rah lo pungte chu an hmuh theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Anni chu mal a sâwm ṭhîn a; chutichuan, nasa taka tihpunin an awm a; An rante chu a pulh a phal ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Tin, hnehchhiahna te, hrehawmna te leh lungngaihna te avângin An hmuih ta telh telh a, an kun ta tlawk tlawk thung a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ani chuan mi liante chungah hmuhsitna a leihbaw ṭhîn a, Thlalêr, kawng rêng rêng awm lohnaah chuan a vah a vahtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Nimahsela, retheite chu hrehawmna aṭangin hmun sângah a hlâng ṭhîn a, Ran rual angin chhûngte a siamsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Mi dik takte chuan chu chu an hmu ang a, an lâwm ang; Khawlohna zawng zawng chuan a kâ a hup ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tu pawh a fing apiangin chûngte chu an vawng ṭha ang a, Lalpa ngilneihnate an ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="108" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ka thinlung hi a nghet a ni; Hla ka sa ang, a ni, fakna hla ka sa ang, ka ropuina ngeiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Perhkhuang leh ṭingṭangte u, harh rawh u! Kei chu zîng takah ka harh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi tin zîngah lâwmthu ka hrilh ang che, Hnam tin zîngah nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />I ngilneihna chu vân khûm khawpin a nasa si a, I thutak chuan vân dumte khi a tawng hial bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nang chu vân khûm daih khian chawimawiin lo awm ang che, I ropuina chu leilung zawng zawng chungah hian chawimawiin awm bawk rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I duh takte hi chhanhima an awm theih nân, I kut ding lamin chhandam la, min chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathianin a thianghlimnaah chuan heti hian a sawi a, “Ka hlim ang; Sekem khua chu ka sem ang a, Sukkoth ruam chu ka sem darh bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Gilead ram chu ka ta a ni a; Manase ram chu ka ta a ni a; Ephraim ram pawh chu ka lû humhimna a ni a; Juda ram chu ka laltiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Moab ram chu ka insilna bêl a ni a; Edom ramah chuan ka pheikhawk ka paih ang a: Philistia ram chu ka au khum ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Khawpui kulh neiah chuan tuin nge mi hruai lût ang? Edom ramah chuan tuin nge mi hruai ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangin min thlauthla a ni lâwm ni? Aw Pathian, kan sipaihote hnênah lah i chhuak ve ta si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dotute bei tûrin min ṭanpui ang che, Mihring ṭanpuina chu eng mah lo mai mai a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian zârah huai takin kan ti ang, Ani chu min dotute rap bettu tûr a ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="109" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, ka fak Pathian, ngawi reng suh ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi suaksual kâ leh ka bum hmang chu ka chungah an âng si a; Anni chuan lei dawtheiin ka hnênah thu an sawi a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Huatna thuin mi hual vêl a, Enga khaw lawi lovin mi do va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hmangaih avângin mi dotute an lo ni ta a; Nimahsela, kei chu ṭawngṭai tûrin ka inpe tlat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chuan thil ṭha chu thil sualin mi rûl a, Ka hmangaihna chu huatnain mi rûl bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangin a chungah mi sual dah la; A ding lamah hêktu ding rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Rorêlsaka a awm hunah thiam loh changin chhuak sela; A ṭawngṭaina chu sualnaah lo chang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A dam chhûng nite chu tlêm sela; A hotu nihna chu mi dangin chang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A fate chu pa lovin awm sela, A nupui chu hmeithaiin awm bawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A fate chu mi vâkvai lo niin, kut dawh sela; An ei tûr chu an hmun ramahte chuan zawng rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pung ûma tangka pûktîrtu chuan a neih zawng zawng chu lâksak vek sela; Mikhualte chuan rawk sela, a thawh rim rah chu lâksak rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A chunga ngilneihna lantîr zêltu tûr tu mah awm suh sela; A fa, pa nei lote chu khawngaihtu tûr tu mah awm hek suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thlahte chu tihboralin awm sela; Ṭhangthar lo awm lehah chuan an hming chu thai bovin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thlahtute khawlohna chu Lalpa hnênah hriat rengin awm sela; A nu sualna chu thai bovin awm suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chûngte chu Lalpa hmaah awm fo rawh se, Ani chuan anmahni hriat rengna chu lei ata a tihboral theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngilneihna lantîr nachâng a hriat lohva, Mi rethei, pachhia leh lungchhiate chu tihhlum tuma a tihduhdah zâwk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A ni, ânchhe lawh hi a duh zâwng a ni a; tichuan, ama chungah a lo thleng a; Mi malsâwmsak hi a lâwm zâwng a ni lo va; Tichuan, amah hlat daihah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kawrfuala inthuam angin ânchhe lawhnain a inthuam a, Chu chu a kawchhûngahte chuan tui angin a lût a, A ruhahte chuan hriak angin a lût bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Chu chu a tân a inbel ṭhin silhfên angin awm sela, A inhrên fona kâwnghrên ni bawk rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Chûng chu mi dotute leh ka nunna sawichhetute Lalpan a thungrulhna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nimahsela, aw Lalpa Pathian, nangin i hming avângin mi tihpui la: I ngilneihna a ṭhat avângin mi chhan him ang che,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Rethei leh pachhe tak ka ni a, Ka thinlung hi ka kawchhûngah hliamin a awm bawk si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hlim ral lam tung tawh ang hian ka ral a; Khaukhuap ang hian len bovin ka awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ka khûpte hi chaw nghei avângin a chak ta lo va; Ka tîsa hian thau rêng a pu ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Anmahni sawi chhiat ka lo ni ta a; Mi hmuh veleh an lû an thing ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw Lalpa ka Pathian, mi ṭanpui la; Aw, i ngilneihna avângin mi chhandam ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chu chu i kut a ni tih an hriat theiha, Lalpa , nangin i tih a ni tih an hriat theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Annin ânchhia lawh rawh se, nang erawh chuan malsâwm zâwk ang che; An thawh veleh an mualpho vang a, i chhiahhlawh erawh chu a hlim ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi dotute chu zahna puan sintîrin awm sela, Kawra intuam angin anmahni mualphonain intuam rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ka kâ hian Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu nasa tak ka sawi ang a; A ni, mipui zîngah amah chu ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Ani chu pachhe ding lamah a ding ang, A nunna rorêlsaktute laka chhandam tûrin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="110" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa thuchhuak chuan ka lalpa hnênah, “I hmêlmate i ke nghahchhana ka siam hma loh zawng, Ka ding lamah ṭhu rawh,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan i chakna tiang chu Zion tlâng aṭangin a tîr chhuak ang; Nangin nangmah dotute zîngah ro rêl rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I mite chu i thiltihtheihna nîah chuan mahni duh thuin an inpe ṭhîn; Thianghlim mawinaah, zîng pum chhûng aṭangin, I tleirâwl daifîm chu i nei a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpan chhia a chham a, a inlamlêt tawh lo vang, “Nang zawng Melkisedeka awm dân anga chatuana puithiam i ni e,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa , i ding lama awm chuan a thinur nîah chuan lalte a sât chhum rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hnam tin zîngah ro a rêl ang a, Hmunte chu ruangin a tikhat ang a, Ram tam takah chuan lû chu a sât phel rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kawng laka luitêa mi a in ang a; Chuvâng chuan a lû chu a chawisâng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="111" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Mi dik takte inrâwn khâwmnaah leh inkhâwmnaah chuan Ka thinlung zawng zawngin Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu ka hrilh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa thiltihte chu a ropui a, A chunga lâwm apiangten zawn chhuah a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hnathawh chu a zahawmin a ropui a, A felna chu kumkhuaa awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ani chuan a thilmak tihte chu a hriat rengtîr a; Lalpa chu mi khawngaih thei tak, lainatnaa khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Amah ṭihtute chu ei tûr a pe a; A thuthlun chu kumkhuain a hre reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A thiltihte thiltihtheihzia chu a mite hnênah a lantîr a, Hnam tin ro chan chu anmahni pein.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A kut thiltihte chu thutak leh rorêlna fel a ni a; A thununna thu zawng zawngte chu a rinawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng chu kumkhaw tlaitluan atân tihnghehin a awm a, Thutak leh dik taka tih a ni hlawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan a mite hnênah tlanna a rawn tîr a; A thuthlun chu kumkhua atân a ruat a: A hming chu a thianghlimin a zahawm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa ṭih chu finna bul a ni a; Chutianga ti apiangte chuan hriat thiamna ṭha an nei. Amah fakna chu kumkhuaa awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="112" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Lalpa ṭih mi chu a eng a thâwl e, A thupêkahte nasa taka lâwm mi chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thlahte chu leiah hian chak takin an awm ang a; Mi dik takte chhuan chu malsâwmin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A inah chuan sum leh hausakna a awm a; A felna chu kumkhuaa awm tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi dik tân chuan thimah chuan êng a lo chhuak ṭhin a; Ani chu mi khawngaih thei tak, lainatnaa khat, fel tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi khawngaiha pûktîr ṭhîn mi chu ṭhatin a vûr ṭhîn a; Ani chu fel takin a khawsa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Eng tikah mah a nghîng dâwn si lo va; Mi fel chu kumkhuaa hriat rengin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chanchin ṭha lo takte a hlau lo vang; Lalpa ringin a thinlung chu a nghet a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A thinlung chu a nghet a, a hlau lo vang, Amah dotute chunga a duhthusâm thleng chu a hmuh hma loh zawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sem darh a, pachhiate a pe a; A felna chu kumkhuaa awm tûr a ni; A ki chu ropui taka chawimawiin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi suaksual chuan chu chu a hmu ang a, a thinur ang a; A ha a ṭhial ang a, a tui ral ang; Mi suaksualte duh zâwng chu a boral ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="113" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Aw Lalpa chhiahhlawhte u, fak ula, Lalpa hming chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hming chu fakin awm rawh se, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni chhuahna aṭanga a tlâkna thlengin Lalpa hming chu fak tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu hnam tinrêngte chungah chuan chungnung daih a ni a, A ropuina chuan vânte khi a khûm daih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian, Chung lama ṭhutphah neia, Vâna thil awmte leh leia thil awmte en tûra Intihnuai ṭhîna ang hi tu nge awm?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan rethei chu vaivut ata a kai tho ṭhîn a, Pachhia chu êkdûr ata a chawi kâng ṭhîn;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi liante hnêna a awmtîr theihna tûrin, A mite zînga mi liante hnên ngeiah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan hmeichhe ching chu in lo a vawntîr a, Fanau nei nu hlim takah a siam ṭhîn. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="114" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel-ho chu Aigupta ram ata an chhuaha, Jakoba chhûngte ngei chu awze mi zîng ata an chhuah lai khân,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Juda-ho chu a hmun thianghlim an lo ni ta a, Israel-ho chu a rorêlna ram an lo ni ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tuifinriat chuan chu chu a hmu a, a tlân bo va; Jordan lui chu tihkîrin a awm ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tlâng liante chu berâmchalte angin an tualchai a, Tlâng tête chu berâmpatuai angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw nang tuifinriat, eng i ti nge ni i tlân bo tâk ni? Nang Jordan, eng i ti nge ni i kîr leh tâk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nangni tlâng liante u, eng in ti nge ni berâmchalte anga in tualchai tâk ni? Nangni tlâng tête u, eng in ti nge ni berâmpatuai anga in tualchai tâk ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nang leilung, Lalpa hmaah khûr rawh, Jakob-ho Pathian hmaah chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan lungpui chu dîlah a chantîr a, Meilung chu tuihnaah a chantîr bawk a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="115" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , keini min pe lovin, keimahni min pe lovin, I hming chu ropuina pe zâwk ang che, I ngilneihna leh i thutak avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Engati nge hnam tinin, “Khawiah nge an Pathian kha le?” an tih ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kan Pathian chu vânah a awm si a; A duh apiang a ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An milemte chu tangkarua leh rangkachak a ni a, Mihring kutchhuak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kâte an nei a, an ṭawng thei si lo va; Mitte an nei a, an hmu thei si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bengte an nei a, an hre thei si lo va; Hnârte an nei a, rim an hre thei si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kutte an nei a, eng mah an khawih thei si lo va; Kete an nei a, an kal thei si lo va; An hrawkin an ṭawng thei hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chûng siamtute chu chûng ang chuan an awm ang; A ni, chûng ringtu apiangte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Israel-hote u, Lalpa chu ring rawh u; Ani chu anmahni ṭanpuitu leh an phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw, Arona chhûngte u, Lalpa chu ring rawh u; Ani chu anmahni ṭanpuitu leh an phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa ṭihtute u, Lalpa chu ring rawh u; Ani chu anmahni ṭanpuitu leh an phaw a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan min hre reng a; mal min sâwm ang; Israela chhûngte chu mal a sâwm ang a; Arona chhûngte chu mal a sâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa ṭihtute chu mal a sâwm ang, A lian a têin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan tipung deuh deuh che u rawh se, Nangmahni leh in fate nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lalpa malsâwm dawngtu in ni, Ani chu lei leh vân siamtu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vânte khi Lalpa vânte a ni a; Leilung erawh hi chu mihring fate a pe a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mitthite chuan Lalpa chu an fak lo va, Hmun reh taka chhukte rêng rêng chuan an fak hek lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keini erawh chuan Lalpa chu kan fak tawh ang, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="116" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka hmangaih a ni, Ka aw leh khawngaih ka dîlnate chu a ngaihthlâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka lama a beng a rawn dawh avângin ka dam chhûng zawngin amah chu ka ko vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thihna hruihrualte chuan mi zem a, Seol natnate chuan mi man a; Manganna leh lungngaihna ka lo tâwk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chu veleh Lalpa hming chu ka lam a; “Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin ka nunna hi chhan him ang che,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi khawngaih thei tak leh fel tak a ni a; A ni, kan Pathian chu mi lainat thei tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mi mâwlte chu a humhim ṭhîn a; Tihhniamin ka awm a, ani chuan mi chhandam ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw ka nunna, i chawlhnaah chuan kîr leh rawh; Lalpa chuan i chungah ṭha takin a ti ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka nunna hi thihna lakah, ka mitte hi mittui lakah, Ka kete hi tlûkna lakah i chhan him si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi nung ramah hian Lalpa hmaah ka lêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ring a, thu ka sawi dâwn a nih hi; Nasa taka tihhrehawmin ka awm kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hamhaihin, “Mi zawng zawng dâwt an ni,” ka lo ti ta mai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka chunga a thiltih ṭhat zawng zawng avâng hian Lalpa chu eng nge ka pêk ve thung ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chhandamna no ka la ang a, Lalpa hming chu ka lam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka thutiamte chu Lalpa lakah ka hlen ang, A ni, a mite zawng zawng hmaah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A mi thianghlimte thihna chu Lalpa ngaih chuan hlu tak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhiahhlawh ka ni tak zet mai; I chhiahhlawh, i bâwihnu fapa chu ka ni a; Phuara ka awm chu mi phelh ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawi inthawina ka hlân ang chia, Lalpa hming chu ka lam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ka thutiamte chu Lalpa lakah ka hlen ang, A ni, a mite zawng zawng hmaah chuan;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lalpa biak in hung chhûng kawtlaiah, Aw Jerusalem, i lai takah ka hlen ang. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="117" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, hnam tinrêngte u, Lalpa chu fak ula; Mi tinrêngte u, amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngilneihna chu kan chungah a nasain, Lalpa thutak chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="118" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u; ni chu a ṭha si a: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm ang tih, Israel-hote chuan sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm ang tih, Arona chhûngte chuan sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm ang tih, Lalpa ṭihtute chuan sawi rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ka manganna aṭangin Lalpa chu ka ko va; Lalpa chuan mi chhâng a, hmun thâwl takah mi awmtîr ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka lama ṭang a ni; ka hlau lo vang. Mihringin eng nge mi tih theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka lama ṭang, mi ṭanpuitu a ni; Chuvângin, mi hawtute chungah ka duhthusâm chu q2 ka hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mihring rin ai chuan Lalpa a rinna nghah hi a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi liante rin ai chuan Lalpa a rinna nghah hi a ṭha zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hnam tinrêngin mi hual vêl a; Anni chu Lalpa hmingin ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Anni chuan mi hual vêl a; a ni, mi hual vêl a; Anni chu Lalpa hmingin ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuaite angin mi hual vêl a; Hlîng alh angin tihmihin an awm; Anni chu Lalpa hmingin ka tiboral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka tlûkna tûrin min chhun vak i tum zuau zuau va; Nimahsela, Lalpa chuan mi ṭanpui ta hlauh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka chakna leh ka hla a ni; Mi chhandamtu a lo ni ta bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lâwmna leh chhandamna thâwm chu mi felte puan inah a awm ṭhîn a; Lalpa kut ding lam chuan huai takin a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa kut ding lam chu chawimawiin a awm ṭhîn a; Lalpa kut ding lam chuan huai takin a ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka thi lo vang, ka dam ang a, Lalpa thiltihte chu ka hriattîr zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan nasa takin mi thunun a; Thihna hnênah erawh chuan mi pe êm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Felna kulh kawngkhârte hi mi hawnsak rawh u: Hêngah hian ka lût ang a, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu ka hril ang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hei hi Lalpa kawngkhâr a ni; Mi felte chu an lût ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />I hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi ang, nangin mi chhângin, Mi chhandamtu i lo ni ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />In satute lung duh loh kha, a kila lung ṭangkai ber a lo ni ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Chu chu Lalpa tih a ni a; Kan mit hmuhah a mak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Hei hi Lalpa ni ruat chu a ni a; Hemiah hian kan hlimin kan lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin chhandam la; Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin vânneihna rawn tîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lalpa hminga lo kal chu a eng a thâwl e: Lalpa in aṭang hian mal kan sâwm che u a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Lalpa chu Pathian a ni, ani chuan êng min pe a; Inthawina tûr chu hruihrualin thlung rawh u, maichâm ki ngeiahte chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Nang chu ka Pathian i ni a, lâwmthu ka hrilh ang chia; Ka Pathian i ni a, ka chawimawi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u, Ani chu a ṭha si a; A ngilneihna pawh kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="119" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kawnga mi ṭha famkimte chu an eng a thâwl e, Lalpa dân zawhtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thuhriattîrte zâwmtute chu an eng a thâwl e, Thinlung zawng zawnga zawngtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A ni, anni chuan fel lohna rêng rêng an ti lo va; A kawngahte chuan an kal ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nangin i thununna thute chu thupêkin min pe a, Ṭhahnemngai taka kan zawm theihna tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw, i thuruatte chu zâwm tûrin ka awm dânte hi tihnghehin awm teh sela aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi hunah chuan ka mualpho lo vang, I thupêk zawng zawng ka pawisak hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thinlung dik tak puin lâwmthu ka hrilh ang che, I rorêlna felte chu ka zir hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />I thuruat chu ka zâwm ang e; Aw, mi kalsan hlen suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tleirâwlin engtin nge a awm dân a tihthianghlim ang? I thu ang zêla a awm dân vêng ṭhain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka thinlung zawng zawng hian ka zawng chia; Aw, i thupêkte ka kal bosan chu phal lul suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I chunga thil ka tihsual loh nân i thu chu ka thinlungah ka khâwl khâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i eng a thâwl e; I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I kâa i rorêl chhuak zawng zawng chu ka hmuiin ka hriattîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I thuhriattîr kawngah chuan ka hlim a, Hausakna zawng zawnga ka hlim ang maiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I thununna thute chu ka ngaihtuah ang a, I kawngte chu ka ngaihsak bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I thuruat chungahte chuan ka lâwm ang a; I thu chu ka theihnghilh lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka nun theihna tûrin i chhiahhlawh chungah hian ṭha takin ti ang che; Chutichuan, i thu ka zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />I dân thu aṭanga thilmak ka hmuh theih nân, Ka mitte hi mi tihvârsak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Leiah hian mikhual ka ni a; I thupêkte chu ka lakah zêp suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka nunna hi keh sawmin a awm a, Eng lai pawha i rorêlnate a ngaih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mi chapo, ânchhe dawngte chu i zilhhau va, I thupêk vah bosan ṭhînte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sawichhiatna leh hmuhsitna hi ka hnên ata la bo vang che; I thuhriattîrte chu ka zâwm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi liante pawh an ṭhu a, mi sawisêl a; Nimahsela, i chhiahhlawh hian i thuruatte chu a ngaihtuah zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu ka lâwmna a ni a, Rem mi ruatsaktute pawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ka nunna hi vaivutah a bet tlat a; I thu ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka awm dânte chu ka hriattîr chia, nangin mi chhâng a; I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />I thununna kawng chu mi hriat thiamtîr ang che; Chutichuan, i thilmak tih thute chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ka nunna hi lungngaih avângin a tui ral ṭhîn; I thu ang zêlin mi tichak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Awm dân dik lo hi ka hnên ata la sawn la; Khawngaih takin i dân mi pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Awm dân rinawm ka thlang a; I rorêlnate chu ka hmaah ka awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />I thuhriattîrahte hian ka bet tlat a; Aw Lalpa , mi timualpho suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />I thupêk kawngah chuan ka tlân ang, Ka thinlung hi i tihzau hunah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thuruat kawng chu mi entîr ang che; Tichuan, a tâwp thlengin ka zawh dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Hriat thiamna mi pe ang che; tichuan, i dân chu ka vawng ṭha dâwn nia; A ni, ka thinlung zawng zawng hian ka zâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />I thupêk kawngah mi kaltîr ang che; Chumiah chuan ka lâwm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />I thuhriattîr lamah chuan ka thinlung hi thlêktîr ang che, Duhâmna lamah ni lovin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Thil eng mah lo mai mai en lo tûrin ka mit mi lâktîr la, I kawngahte chuan mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />I thu chu i chhiahhlawh hnênah hian tinghet ang che, Chu chu nangmah ṭihtu tân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Mi sawichhiatna ka hlauh hi la bo vang che; I rorêlte chu a ṭha si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />Ngai teh, i thununna thute chu hriat ka châk ṭhîn a; I felna avângin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihnate chu ka hnênah lo kal rawh se, I chhandamna ngei chu, i thu ang zêlin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" />Chutichuan, mi sawichhetu chhânna tûr ka nei ang; I thu ka ring si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" />Tin, thutak thu chu ka kâ ata hi la chhuak vek suh ang che; I rorêlnate chu ka beisei si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" />Chutichuan, i dân chu ka zâwm fo vang, Kumkhaw tlaitluanin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" />Tin, dîpdâl lohvin ka lêng ang; I thununna thute chu ka zawng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />I thuhriattîr thute chu lalho hmaah ka sawi ang a, Ka zak lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" />Tin, i thupêk ka ngainat chungahte chuan ka lâwm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" />I thupêk, ka ngainat lamahte chuan ka kutte ka phar ang a; I thuruatte chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hnêna thutiam chu hre reng ang che, Nangin mi beiseitîr avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" />Chu chu ka hrehawmnaah pawh ka thlamuanna a ni, I thu chuan mi tiharh ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" />Chapote chuan nasa takin mi nuihzatbûr a; Nimahsela, i dân chu ka kal kawisan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , hmasânga i rorêlte chu ka hre reng a, Ka inthlamuan ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" />Lungnih lohna nasa tak hian mi tlâkbuak ta a, Mi suaksual, i dân kalsantute avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" />Ka khualzinna inah hian i thuruatte chu ka hla a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , zânah chuan i hming ka hre reng ṭhîn a, I dân pawh ka zâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" />Chûng chu ka nei a, I thununna thute chu ka vawn ṭhat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka chanvo a ni; I thu ka zâwm ang tih ka sawi tawh kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" />Ka thinlung zawng zawngin i khawngaihna ka ngên a; I thu ang zêlin mi khawngaih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" />Ka awm dânte ka ngaihtuah a, I thuhriattîr lamah chuan ka ke ka pên ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" />I thupêkte zâwm tûrin ka hmanhmawh a, rei ka rial lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" />Mi suaksualho hruaihrualte chuan mi zem hlâwm reng a; Nimahsela, i dân chu ka theihnghilh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" />Zanlaiah lâwmthu hrilh tûr chein ka tho vang, I rorêl felte avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" />Nangmah ṭihtu zawng zawng leh, I thununna thu zâwmtute ṭhian ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , leilung hi i ngilneihnain a khat a ni; I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thu ang zêlin i chhiahhlawh hi i tiṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" />Ngaihtuah thiamna leh hriatna mi zirtîr ang che; I thupêkte chu ka ring si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" />Tihhrehawma ka awm hma khân ka vâk bo ṭhîn a; Tûnah erawh chuan i thu ka zâwm ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="68" style="v" />Nang chu i ṭha a, thil ṭha i ti bawk a; I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" />Chapote chuan ka chungah dâwt an phuah chawp a; Ka thinlung zawng zawng hian i thununna thute chu ka vawng ṭha ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" />An thinlung chu rîlbawh thau angin a thau va; Kei erawh chu i dân chungah ka lâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" />I thuruatte ka zir theih nân Tihhrehawma ka lo awm kha ka tân a ṭha a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" />Rangkachak leh tangkaraw sâng tam tak ai chuan, I kâa dân chhuak chu ka tân a ṭha zâwk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" />I kutin mi siamin, mi din a ni; I thupêkte chu ka zir theih nân hriat thiamna mi pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" />Nangmah ṭihtute chuan mi hmu ang a, an lâwm ang; I thu chu ka beisei ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="75" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i rorêlte chu a fel tih leh, Nang chuan rinawm takin a ni mi tihhrehawm ni tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh hnêna i thutiam ang zêlin, Khawngaih takin i ngilneihna chu ka thlamuanna tûr ni rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" />Ka nun theihna tûrin i lainatnate chu ka hnênah lo kal rawh se; I dân chu ka lâwmna a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" />Chapote chu mualphovin awm rawh se, dik lo takin mi titlâwm ta si a; Nimahsela, i thununna thute chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="79" style="v" />Nangmah ṭihtute chu ka lamah hawi rawh se; Tichuan, i thuhriattîrte chu an hre dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" />Ka mualpho lohna tûrin, Ka thinlung hi i thuruatahte chuan ṭha famkimin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="81" style="v" />Ka nunna hi i chhandamna ngaiin a chau ta a; Nimahsela, i thu ka beisei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="82" style="v" />I thu thlîr nân ka mit a vai zo ta a, “Nangin eng tikah nge mi thlamuan ang?” ka ti ka ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="83" style="v" />Meikhu ur savun peng ang chu ka lo ni ta si a; Nimahsela, i thuruatte chu ka theihnghilh lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="84" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh kum chin tûr hi eng zât nge ni dâwn? Mi tiduhdahtute chungah hian eng tikah nge ro i rêl dâwn?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="85" style="v" />Mi chapo, i dân anga awm lote chuan, Ka tlâk nân khuarkhurumte an lai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="86" style="v" />I thupêk zawng zawng chu a rinawm a ni; Anni chuan dik lo taka mi tihduhdah ṭhin hi; mi ṭanpui ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="87" style="v" />Anni chuan leiah hian mi tiboral ṭhelh ṭhelh a; Nimahsela, i thununna thute chu ka hawisan si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="88" style="v" />I ngilneihna ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che; Chutichuan, i kâa thuhriattîr chu ka zâwm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="89" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , kumkhua atân i thu chu vânah nghet takin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="90" style="v" />I rinawmna chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin a awm ang: Leilung hi i tinghet a, a awm reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="91" style="v" />Chûngte chu vawiin hian i rorêlte angin an awm reng a; Thil zawng zawng chu i chhiahhlawhte an ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="92" style="v" />I dân chu ka lâwmna ni suh sela chuan, Ka hrehawmnaah khân ka boral tawh tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="93" style="v" />I thununna thute chu eng tikah mah ka theihnghilh lo vang; Nangin chûng chuan mi tiharh ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="94" style="v" />I ta ka nih hi, mi chhandam ang che; I thununna thute chu ka zawng si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="95" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chuan mi tihboral tumin mi nghâk ṭhîn a; Nimahsela, i thuhriattîrte chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="96" style="v" />Ṭhat famkimna zawng zawng tâwp chu ka hmu ta a; I thupêk erawh chu a zau khawp mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="97" style="v" />Aw, i dân hi ka va ngaina êm! Nilênga ka ngaihtuah ṭhin a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="98" style="v" />I thupêkte chuan mi dotute aia fing zâwkin mi siam a; Kumkhuaa ka hnêna a awm fo ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="99" style="v" />Mi zirtîrtu zawng zawng aiin finna ka nei zâwk a ni; I thuhriattîrte hi ka ngaihtuah a nih ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="100" style="v" />Tarte ai chuan ka hre thiam zâwk a ni, I thununna thute hi ka vawn ṭhat avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="101" style="v" />I thu ka zawm theihna tûrin Kawng sualah rêng rêng chuan ka kete hi pên ka phal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="102" style="v" />I rorêlna lakahte chuan ka pêng lo; Nangin mi zirtîr avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="103" style="v" />I thute hi ka tân a va thlum êm! A ni, ka kâ atân chuan khawizû aiin a thlum zâwk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="104" style="v" />I thununna thute avângin hriat thiamna ka nei ṭhîn; Chuvângin, awm dân dik lo tinrêng hi ka hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="105" style="v" />I thu hi ka ke atânte hian khâwnvâr a ni a, Ka kawng atân êng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="106" style="v" />I rorêlna fel takte chu zâwm tûrin chhia ka chham a, Ka tinghet bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="107" style="v" />Nasa taka tihhrehawmin ka awm a; Aw Lalpa , i thu ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="108" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , khawngaih takin ka kâa duh thûa thilpêkte hi la la, I rorêlnate chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="109" style="v" />Ka nunna hi ka kutah a awm fo ṭhîn a; Nimahsela, i dân chu ka theihnghilh ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="110" style="v" />Mi suaksualte chuan ka awh nân thang an kam a; Nimahsela, i thununna thute chu ka vah bosan lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="111" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu kumkhuaa rochunah ka la a; Ka thinlung tihlimtu a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="112" style="v" />Kumkhuain, a tâwp thlengin, I thuruatte anga ti tûrin ka thinlung ka thlêktîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="113" style="v" />Rilru mumal nei lo mite chu ka hua a; I dân erawh chu ka ngaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="114" style="v" />Nang chu ka bihrûkna hmun leh ka phaw i ni a; I thu ka beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="115" style="v" />Nangni thil ṭha lo titute u, mi kalsan rawh u; Ka Pathian thupêkte ka vawn ṭhat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="116" style="v" />Ka nun theihna tûrin i thu ang zêlin mi chelh reng la, Ka beisei chungah hian zakin mi awmtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="117" style="v" />Mi kai ang che; tichuan, ka him ang a, I thuruatte chu ka pawisa fo dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="118" style="v" />I thuruatte vah bosantu zawng zawng chu i hmusit a; An bumna chu dâwt a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="119" style="v" />Leia mi suaksual zawng zawng chu englo êkchhia angin i tibo ṭhîn a; Chuvângin, i thuhriattîrte chu ka ngaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="120" style="v" />Ka tisa hi nangmah ṭihin a khûr a; I rorêlnate chu ka hlau bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="121" style="v" />Ro ka rêl a, fel takin ka ti ṭhîn a; Mi hnehchhiahtute lakah mi thlahthlam suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="122" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chungchâng thûah a ṭhatna tûrin a bul tum la; Chapoten mi hnehchhiah suh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="123" style="v" />I chhandamna thlîr nân ka mit a vai zo ta a, I thu fel tak thlîr nân nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="124" style="v" />I ngilneihna avângin i chhiahhlawh chungah hian ti la, I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="125" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh ka ni a, hriat thiamna mi pe ang che; I thuhriattîrte chu ka hriat theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="126" style="v" />Lalpa , thawh a hun ta; I dân hi eng mah lovah an siam ta si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="127" style="v" />Chuvângin, i thupêkte chu rangkachak aiin ka ngaina a ni, A ni, rangkachak thianghlim ai pawhin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="128" style="v" />Chuvângin, kawng tinrêng thûa i thununna thu zawng zawng chu dikin ka hria a; Awm dân dik lo tinrêng hi ka hua a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="129" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu a mak a; Chuvângin, ka nunna hian a vawng ṭha ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="130" style="v" />I thu hrilhfiah hian mite a tiêng a; Mi mâwlte chu a hriat thiamtîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="131" style="v" />Ka kâ ka âng zau va, ka thaw hlawp hlawp a; I thupêkte chu ka châk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="132" style="v" />Ka lam lo hawi la, mi khawngaih ang che, I hming ngainatute i khawngaih ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="133" style="v" />Ka ke pênte hi i thûah tinghet la; Sualna rêng rêng ka chungah thu neihtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="134" style="v" />Mihring hnehchhiahna lakah chuan mi chhan him ang che; Chutichuan, i thununna thute chu ka zâwm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="135" style="v" />I hmêlin i chhiahhlawh hi chhun êng la; I thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="136" style="v" />Ka mittui hi lui tui angin a luang thla a, I dân an zawm loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="137" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang chu i fel a, I rorêlte pawh a dik a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="138" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu fel tak leh Rinawm êm êmin thu i pe a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="139" style="v" />Ka ṭhahnemngaihna hian mi tiboral ta, Mi dotuten i thu an theihnghilh tâk avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="140" style="v" />I thu hi a thianghlim êm êm a; Chuvângin, i chhiahhlawh hian a ngaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="141" style="v" />Mi tê leh mi hmuhsit ka ni a; Nimahsela, i thununna thute chu ka theihnghilh ngai lo ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="142" style="v" />I felna chu kumkhaw felna tûr a ni a, I dân pawh thutak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="143" style="v" />Manganna leh thlaphânna chuan mi tlâkbuak ta a; Nimahsela, i thupêkte hi ka lâwmna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="144" style="v" />I thuhriattîrte chu kumkhua atân a fel a ni; Hriat thiamna mi pe ang che; tichuan, ka nung reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="145" style="v" />Ka thinlung zawng zawngin ka ko chia; aw Lalpa , mi chhâng ang che: I thuruatte chu ka vawng ṭha dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="146" style="v" />Ka ko ṭhîn chia; mi chhandam ang che. Tichuan, i thuhriattîrte chu ka zâwm dâwn nia.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="147" style="v" />Khawfîngchat chu ka khalh a, ka au ṭhîn a; I thute chu ka beisei ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="148" style="v" />I thu ka ngaihtuah theihna tûrin Ka mitin zân vênte chu a men khalh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="149" style="v" />I ngilneihna ang zêlin ka aw hi ngaithla la; Aw Lalpa , i rorêlnate ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="150" style="v" />Ngaihtuahna sual ûmho chuan an rawn hnaih a; Anni chu i dân hlata awm an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="151" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nang chu i hnai a; I thupêk zawng zawng chu thutak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="152" style="v" />Hmasângah, i thuhriattîrte aṭangin, Chûng chu kumkhua atân i tinghet tih ka lo hre tawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="153" style="v" />Ka hrehawmzia hi ngaihtuah la, mi chhan him ang che; I dân chu ka theihnghilh ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="154" style="v" />Ka thu mi sawipuiin, mi tlan la; I thu ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="155" style="v" />Chhandamna chu mi suaksualte lakah chuan a hla a ni; I thuruatte chu an zawn loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="156" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i lainatnate chu a nasa a ni; I rorêlnate ang zêlin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="157" style="v" />Mi tiduhdahtute leh mi dotute chu tam tak an ni; Nimahsela, i thu hriattîrte chu ka kal kawisan lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="158" style="v" />Vervêk taka titute chu ka en a, ka lungni lo va; I thu an zawm loh avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="159" style="v" />I thununna thute ka ngainatzia hi ngaihtuah la; Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna avângin mi tiharh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="160" style="v" />I thu infin khâwm chu thutak a ni a; I rorêlna fel tinrêng pawh hi kumkhuain a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="161" style="v" />Mi lianten enga khaw lawi lovin mi tiduhdah a; Nimahsela, ka thinlung chuan i thute a ni a hlauh ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="162" style="v" />I thûah hian ka hlim a ni, Thil ropui tak râllâka hmutu angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="163" style="v" />Dâwt hi ka huain ka ten a; I dân erawh chu ka ngaina a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="164" style="v" />Ni khatah vawi sarih ka fak ṭhîn che a ni, I rorêl felte avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="165" style="v" />I dân ngainatute chuan thlamuanna nasa tak an nei a; Tlûkna rêng rêng an nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="166" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhandamna ka beisei reng a, I thupêkte angin ka ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="167" style="v" />Ka nunna hian i thuhriattîrte chu a zâwm ṭhîn a; Ka ngaina êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="168" style="v" />I thununna thute leh i thuhriattîrte chu ka zâwm ṭhîn; Ka awm dân zawng zawng hi i hmaa awm a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="169" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka au thâwm hi i hmaah lo hnai rawh se; I thu ang zêlin hriat thiamna mi pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="170" style="v" />Khawngaih ka dîlna hi i hmaah thleng rawh se; I thu ang zêlin mi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="171" style="v" />Ka hmui hian fakna thu sawi rawh se; Nangin i thuruatte chu mi zirtîr ṭhin avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="172" style="v" />Ka lei hi i thu fakin zai rawh se; I thupêk zawng zawng chu felna a nih avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="173" style="v" />I kut chu mi ṭanpui tûra inpeih sain awm rawh se; I thununna thute chu ka thlang si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="174" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i chhandamna chu ka châk ṭhîn a; I dân chu ka lâwmna a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="175" style="v" />Ka nunna hi nung rawh se; tichuan, a fak dâwn che nia; I rorêlnate pawhin mi ṭanpui rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="176" style="v" />Berâm bo angin ka vâk bo va; i chhiahhlawh hi zawng ang che; I thupêkte chu ka theihnghilh ngai si lo va.
  </para>
  <chapter number="120" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka mangannaah chuan Lalpa chu ka au va; Tichuan, anin mi chhâng a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , hmui dawtheite lakah leh, lei mi bum hmang lakah chuan, Ka nunna hi chhan him ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Nang lei bum hmang, I hnênah eng nge an pêk ang chia, eng nge an belhchhah ang che?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi chak thal zum takte, Juniper thing lingte nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mesek-ho ramah ka awm leh, Kedar-ho puan in zîngah ka awm hi, ka chung a va pik êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka nunna hi remna hawtu hnênah hian a chêng rei lutuk tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kei chuan inrem ka duh a; Nimahsela, thu ka sawi veleh indo an duh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="121" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tlâng lamahte khian ka mit ka lên chho vang: Khawi lama mi nge mi ṭanpuina tûr lo thleng ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi ṭanpuina tûr chu Lalpa , Lei leh vân siamtu hnêna mi a lo thleng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ani chuan i ke chu tihsawn a phal lo vang a; Nangmah vêngtu chu a muthlu lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, Israel-ho vêngtu chu a muthluin, a muhîl hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu nangmah vêngtu a ni a; Lalpa chu i ding lama hliahtu che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chhûnah niin a em lo vang chia, Zânah thlain a em hek lo vang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan sual tinrêng lakah a vêng ang chia; I nunna chu a vêng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan i chhuak leh i lût chu a vêng ang che, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain.
  </para>
  <chapter number="122" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“ Lalpa inah i kal ang u,” Ka hnêna an tih lai khân ka lâwm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, i kulh kawngkhâr chhûngah kan kete chu a din tâk hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem, khawpui din thar, Rinawm taka rem chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa hming fak tûrin chutah chuan hnamte chu an chho ṭhîn, Lalpa hnamte chu, Israel-ho hnêna thupêk ang khân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chutah chuan rorêl nân lalṭhutphahte hûn a ni si a, Davida chhûngte lalṭhutphahte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Jerusalem thlamuanna tûr dîlsak rawh u: Nang ngainatute chu an thawveng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I kulh chhûngahte chuan thlamuanna awm sela, I lal inahte chuan thawvenna awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka unaute leh ka ṭhiante avângin “I chhûngah thlamuanna awm rawh se,” ka ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa kan Pathian in avâng chuan i ṭhatna tûr ka zawng ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="123" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, nang vâna ṭhu ṭhîn, I lamah ka mit ka len chhoh ṭhin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ngai teh, chhiahhlawhte mitin an pu kut lam a en ṭhîn ang leh, Chhiahhlawhnu mitin a pi kut lam a en ṭhîn angin, Keini mit pawhin Lalpa kan Pathian lam a en reng a ni, Min khawngaih hma loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , min khawngaih rawh, min khawngaih rawh; Hmuhsitnain kan khah nasat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi nuamsate deuna leh chapote hmuhsitnain Kan nunna hi a khat nasa hle.
  </para>
  <chapter number="124" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Kan lama ṭang chu Lalpa ni suh sela chuan,” Israel-hovin ti rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Miten min beih lai khân Kan lama ṭang chu Lalpa ni suh sela chuan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Khami lai ngei khân anni chuan kan nung chungin min lem tawh ang, Kan chunga an thin a thawh lai khân;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khami lai ngei khân tuite chuan min chîm pil tawh ang a, Lui chuan kan nunna hi a vûr pil tawh ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khami lai ngei khân tui lian chuan kan nunna hi a vûr pil tawh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sa anga seh tûra an hnêna min pe lotu Lalpa chu fakin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thang kamtute thang ata sava a chhuak angin kan nunna hi a chhuak ta; Thang chu a chhe ta a, keini hi kan chhuak ta hlauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Min ṭanpuina tûr chu Lalpa , lei leh vân siamtu hmingah a awm,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="125" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa ringtute chu Zion tlâng, tihnghîn rual loh, Kumkhuaa awm reng tûr ang chu an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tlângte chu Jerusalem vêla a awm angin, Lalpa chu a mite vêlah a awm ṭhîn, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suahsualna laltiang chu mi fel ram chan chhûngah chuan a innghat dâwn si lo; Mi felte chuan an kuttea khawlohna an ban loh nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ṭha taka awmte chungah chuan ṭha takin ti ang che, An thinlunga dik taka awmte chungah pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />An kawng kawitea pêngho erawh hi zawng, Lalpa chuan thil tisualtute nên a hruai chhuak ang. Israel-ho chungah chuan thlamuanna awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="126" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpan Zion salte a hruai kîr leh lai khân, Mumanga mangtute ang mai kan ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chumi lai chuan kan kâ chu nuihin a khat a, Kan lei chu hla sakin. Chumi lai chuan hnam tin zîngah, “ Lalpan an tân thil ropui takte a tihsak a ni,” an ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan thil ropui takte min tihsak a, Kan lâwm hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , sala kan tâng hi min hruai kîr leh ang che, Chhim rama luite angin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mittui tla chunga tuhte chuan hlim takin an ât ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ṭap chungin buh chi feh chhuahpui mah sela, A buhphalte kengin hlim takin a lo haw leh ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="127" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpan in a sak loh chuan, A satute chuan an thawk rim thlâwn mai a ni; Lalpan khawpui a vawn ṭhat loh chuan, A vêngtu chu a meng thlâwn mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Zîng takah in tho va, tlai takah in châwl a, Thawh rimna chaw in ei ṭhin hi, in tân a thlâwn mai a ni; Hetiang hian a mi duh tak chu a muthilhtîr ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ngai teh, fanaute hi Lalpa laka kan ro chan an ni a, Rîla rah hi a lâwmman min pêk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vânglai fate chu Mi chak kuta thal awmte ang hi an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A thal bâwm faa khat nei mi chu a nihlawh e; Kulh kawngkâa an dote an biak lai pawhin an mualpho lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="128" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa ṭih apiang chu an eng a thâwl e, A kawng zawhtute chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I kut thawh rim rah chu i ei dâwn si a; Lâwm takin i awm ang a, thawvengin i awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />I nupui chu i in chhûngrilah chuan, grêp hrui rah duh mi tak angin a awm ang a; I fate chu, i dawhkân vêlah chuan olive ṭiakte angin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa ṭih mi chu chutiang chuan malsâwmin an awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion aṭangin mal a sâwm ang che; Tichuan, i dam chhûng zawngin Jerusalem ṭhatna i hmu ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A ni, i tute chu i la hmu ang. Israel-ho chungah chuan thlamuanna awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="129" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Ka naupan têt ata miten vawi tam tak mi timangang a,” Israel-hovin ti rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Ka naupan têt ata miten vawi tam tak mi timangang a; Nimahsela, mi hneh si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Leilettuten ka hnungzângah hian lei an let a; An leileh rîn khawh thlûrte chu an tisei hle a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu a fel a ni; Mi suaksualte hruihrual chu a zai chat ta a,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Anni chu mualpho leh tlânchhiattîrin awm rawh se, Zion hawtu zawng zawngte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />In chunga hlobet, a ṭhan sân hmaa Vuai mai ṭhîn angin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tu mân chu chu an ât khâwm lo va, Tu mân seng tûrin an têl hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“ Lalpa malsâwmna in chungah awm rawh se; Lalpa hmingin mal kan sâwm che u hi,” A kal pêltuten an ti ngai hek lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="130" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tui thûk tak aṭang hian ka au a che. Lalpa , ka aw hi ngaithla ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawngaih ka dîlna aw hi i bengin ngaithla rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , nangin khawlohnate i chhinchhiah chuan, Aw Lalpa , tu nge ding ang le?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nimahsela, i hnênah ngaihdamna a awm a ni, Ṭiha i awm theih nân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu ka nghâk reng a, ka nunna hian a nghâk reng a, A thu pawh ka beisei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vêngtuten khawvâr an thlîr aia nasain, A ni, vêngtuten khawvâr an thlîr aia nasa mahin, Ka nunna hian Lalpa chu a thlîr reng ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Israel-hote u, Lalpa chu beisei rawh u; Lalpa hnênah chuan ngilneihna a awm si a, A hnênah tlanna tam tak a awm bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tichuan, ani chuan Israel-ho chu An khawlohna zawng zawng ata a chhan chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="131" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , ka thinlung hi a chapo lo va, ka mitte hi a sâng hek lo; Thil ropui takahte ka intelh ngai hek lo va, Ka tâna thilmak lutukahte pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka nunna hi ka awi tleiin ka tikhui ta ngei a; Naupang hnute hnêk bân tawh a nu hnêna a awm angin, Ka nunna hi naupang hnute hnêk bân tawh angin ka hnênah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Israel-hote u, Lalpa chu beisei rawh u, Tûn aṭanga kumkhuain.
  </para>
  <chapter number="132" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , Davida chu a hrehawm tuarna zawng zawng hriatpui ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa hnêna chhia chhama, Jakoba Mi Chaka hnêna thu a tiamzia kha:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Ka awmna inah ka lût hauh lo vang a, Ka khumah ka kai hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka hahchâwl lo vang a, Mutmu ka tuah hek lo vang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa hmun tûr ka zawn chhuah hma loh chuan, Jakoba Mi Chaka awmna tûr chu,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai teh, Ephratha-ah a chanchin kan hria a, Jaar phûlah kan hmu ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A awmnaah chuan kal ila, A ke nghahchhan bulah chibai i bûk ang u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , tho la, i chawlh hmun tûrah chuan lût ang che; Nang nên, i chakna bâwm nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I puithiamte chu felnain inthuam sela; I mi thianghlimte chu hlimin au rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh Davida avângin i hriak thiha hmêl chu hawi kîrtîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Davida hnênah thutakin chhia a chham ta a; Chu chu a hawisan lo vang: “I taksa raha mi i lalṭhutphahah chuan ka ṭhuttîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I fate chuan ka thuthlun leh, Ka thuhriattîr, anmahni ka la zirtîr tûr chu an zawm chuan, An fate pawh kumkhuain i lalṭhutphahah chuan an ṭhu zêl ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Zion chu a thlang si a. A awmna atân a duh a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Hei hi kumkhua atâna ka chawlh hmun tûr a ni: Hetah hian ka awm reng ang; ka duh zâwng a ni si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ei tûrah mal ka sâwm rei rui ang a; A mi retheite chu chhangin ka titlai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A puithiamte chu chhandamnain ka thuam ang a; A mi thianghlimte chu hlimin an au chiam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutah chuan Davida ki chu ka chawr chhuahtîr ang; Ka hriak thiha tân chuan khâwnvâr ka ruat ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Amah dotute chu mualphonain ka thuam ang a; Ani chungah erawh chuan a lallukhum chu a tle sur ang,” tiin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="133" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh, unaute nngeih dial diala awm khâwm hi A va ṭhain, a va nuam êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lua hriak hlu tak, khabe hmula luang thla, Arona khabe hmul ngeia luang thlaa, A kawrfual hmâwra luang thla ang kha a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hermon daifîm, Zion tlângtea tla ṭhîn ang hi a ni; Chutah chuan Lalpan malsâwmna thu a pe a, Kumkhuaa nunna tûr chu.
  </para>
  <chapter number="134" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Lalpa chhiahhlawh, Lalpa ina zâna ding ṭhîn zawng zawngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />In kutte chu hmun thianghlim lamah phar ula, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpan Zion aṭangin malsâwm che rawh se; Lei leh vân siamtu ngei chuan.
  </para>
  <chapter number="135" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Lalpa hming chu fak ula; Aw Lalpa chhiahhlawh, Lalpa ina dinga, kan Pathian in hung chhûng kawtlaia dingte u, Amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u, Lalpa chu a ṭha si a; A hming fakin zai rawh u, a nuam si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jakob-ho hi ama tân a thlang si a, Israel-ho hi a ro bîk atân a thlang bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lalpa chu ropui tak a ni tih leh, Kan Lalpa chu pathian zawng zawng aiin a chungnung a ni tih ka hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a duh apiang a ti ṭhîn a, Vânah te, leiah te, tuifinriatah te, tui thûk tak zawng zawngah te pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan kâwlkil aṭangin chhûmte a chhohtîr ṭhîn a; Kâwlphete ruah tân a siam ṭhîn a; A sum in aṭangte chuan thli a la chhuak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan Aigupta rama fa tîrte chu a tihlum a, Mihring leh sate pawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Aigupta ram, ani chuan chhinchhiahnate leh thilmakte i chhûngah a rawn tîr a, Pharaoa chungah leh a chhiahhlawh zawng zawngte chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chuan hnam tam tak a tihlum a, Lal ropui tak takte a that a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Sihona, Amor-ho lal leh, Oga, Basan ram lal leh, Kanaan rama mi zawng zawng chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />An ram chu ro chan atân a pe a, A mi Israel-ho ro chan atân.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i hming chu kumkhuain a awm ang a; Aw Lalpa , nangmah hriat rengna chu chhuan awm chhûng zawngin a awm bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a mite chu ro a rêlsakin, A chhiahhlawhte chung thûah chuan a rilru a lamlêt dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hnam tin milemte chu tangkarua leh rangkachak an ni a, Mihring kutchhuak an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kâte an nei a, an ṭawng thei si lo va; Mitte an nei a, an hmu thei si lo va;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Bengte an nei a, an hre thei si lo va; An kâah chuan thaw rêng rêng a awm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chûng siamtute chu chûng ang chuan an awm ang; A ni, chûng ringtu apiangte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Israela chhûngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u: Aw Arona chhûngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Aw Levia chhûngte u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u: Lalpa ṭihtute u, Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lalpa chu Zion aṭanga fakin awm rawh se, Jerusalem-a awma chu. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="136" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u; ani chu a ṭha si a: A ngilneihna pawh kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Aw, pathiante Pathian hnênah chuan lâwmthu hril rawh u: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw, lalpate Lalpa hnênah lâwmthu hril rawh u: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Amah chauhva thilmak ropui tak ti ṭhîntu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Finnaa vân siamtu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lei hi tui chunga dah duaitu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Êntu ropui tak: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Nî, chhûna rorêltu atân: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thla leh arsiho, zâna rorêltu atâna siamtu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kut chak leh bân pharin: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aigupta-ho fa tîrte tihhlumsaka: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Israel-ho an zîng ata hruai chhuaktu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tuifinriat Sen tiṭhen phawka, A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Israel-ho a lai taka kaitîra; A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pharaoa leh a sipaiho erawh Tuifinriat Sena tiboraltu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A mite thlalêra hruaitu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lal ropui tak takte tihluma: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lal hmingthang tak tak: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sihona, Amor-ho lal leh: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Oga, Basan ram lalte thata: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />An ram ro chana: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A chhiahhlawh Israela ro chana petu hnênah chuan: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ani chuan kan hnam tlâwm lai khân min hre reng a: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Min dotute lakah min chhan him a: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ani chuan tisa zawng zawng hnênah ei tûr a pe ṭhîn: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Aw, vân Pathian hnênah chuan lâwmthu hril rawh u: A ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="137" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Babulon lui kamahte, Chutah kan ṭhu a, a ni, kan ṭap ṭhîn, Zion kan ngaihtuahin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lui laia tuipuisuthlahahte chuan kan ṭingṭangte chu kan bâng ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />“Zion hla pakhat min saksak rawh u,” tiin, Chutah chuan sala min hruaituten hla saah min ngên a, Min tiretheituten hlimah min ngên bawk si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi ramahte chuan Lalpa hla engtin nge kan sak theih ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, ka theihnghilh che chuan, Ka kut ding lam hian a thil thiam hi theihnghilh ve rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka hriat reng loh che chuan, Ka lei hi ka dangah bet tlat rawh se; Ka hlimna ber aia Jerusalem ka duh zâwk loh chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , Jerusalem ni chu Edoma thlahte chungah a chhe lamin hre reng ang che; “A lungphûm lam pawhin tichim rawh u, tichim rawh u,” titute kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Babulon fanu, tihborala awm tûr, Kan chunga i tih anga thungrûl tûr che chu lâwm takin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />I fanau tê tête chhuhsaka, lungpui vuak nâna hmangtu tûr chu Lâwm takin a awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="138" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />I hnênah ka thinlung zawng zawngin lâwmthu ka sawi ang a; Pathianho hmaah pawh nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I biak in thianghlim lam hawiin chibai ka bûk ang chia, I ngilneihna leh i thutak avângin i hming ka fak ang; I thu chu i hming rêng rêng ai chuan i tilian ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka auh ni che khân nangin mi chhâng a, Ka nunna tichakin mi fuih a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , leia lal zawng zawng chuan lâwmthu an hrilh ang che, I kâa thuchhuakte chu an hre si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A ni, Lalpa awm dân thute chu hlaah an sa ang; Lalpa ropuizia chu a nasa si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chu chungnung tak a ni na a, mi tlâwmte chu a ngaihsak ṭhîn a; Mi chapote erawh chu hla tak aṭangin a hre ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Manganna zîngah lêng mah ila, nangin mi tiharh ang; Mi dotute thinur bei tûrin i kut i phar ang a, I kut ding lamin mi chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka chungchânga a tih tûr chu a hlen ang: Aw Lalpa , i ngilneihna chu kumkhuain a awm ang a; Nangma kut thiltihte hi bânsan suh ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="139" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangin ngun takin mi en chhuak a, mi hre ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangin ka ṭhut leh ka din hi i hre ṭhîn a, Ka ngaihtuahna hi hla tak aṭang pawhin i hre thiam ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka kal leh ka mu hi mi en ngun ṭhîn a, Ka awm dân zawng zawng hi i hre vek a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngai teh, aw Lalpa , nangin i hriat fai vek loh chu, Ka leiah hian thu rêng rêng a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangin ka hnung lam leh ka hma lamah mi hual a, Ka chungah i kut i nghat bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chuti kauva hriatna chu ka tân a mak lutuk a; A sâng êm a, ka phâk lo a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I thlarau hnên ata hi khawiah nge ka kal ang? I hma ata hi khawiah nge ka tlân bo vang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vânah han lâwn ila, chutah chuan i awm si a; Seol-ah mutna siam ila, ngai teh, chutah chuan i awm bawk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zîng thla zârin, Tuifinriat tâwp daihah va awm ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chutah pawh chuan i kutin mi hruai ang a, I kut ding lamin mi chelh dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Thimin mi khuh bo tlat se, Ka vêla êng hi zân thim ni se,” ti mah ila,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thim pawhin i lakah chuan eng mah a hliah lo va, Zân hi chhûn angin a êng zâwk a ni; I tân chuan thim leh êng hi thuhmun reng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nangmah ngeiin ka rilru i nei a; Ka nu pum chhûngah mi khuh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I hnênah lâwmthu ka hrilh ang che, hlauhawm tak leh mak taka siam ka ni si a; I thiltihte hi mak tak a ni a; Chu chu ka nunna hian a hre chiang hle a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A rûka siama ka awma, Lei hmun hnuaihnung bera mawi taka siama ka awm lai khân ka ruhrel chu i lakah thupin a awm lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ka rîruang la famkim lo chu i mitin a hmu a, I lehkhabuah chuan ka pêngte zawng zawng hi ziak vek a ni a, A ni têla siamin a awm zêl a, A pakhat mah la awm hmain.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Aw Pathian, i ngaihtuahnate chu ka tân a va hlu êm! A infin khâwm chu a va nasa êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Chhiar dâwn ila, a tam lam chu ṭiau vaivut aiin a tam zâwk ang; Ka han men chuan, i hnênah ka la awm cheu ṭhîn a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Aw Pathian, mi suaksualte chu i that ngei dâwn si a; Chutichuan, nangni thisen chhuah châk mite u, mi kalsan rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Anni chuan sual takin an sawi chhe si chia, Nangmah dotute chuan i hming chu an sawi nawmnah ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , nangmah hawtute chu ka haw lo vem ni? Nangmah beitute chungah chuan ka lungni lo lo vem ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Anni chu huat tak têin ka hua a: Mi dotuahte ka ruat hlawm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aw Pathian, ngun takin mi en chhuak la, ka thinlung hi hria ang che; Mi fiah la, ka ngaihtuahnate hi hria ang che;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tin, keimahah hian suahsualna kawng rêng rêng a awm nge awm lo en la, Chatuan kawngah chuan mi hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <chapter number="140" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi sual lakah chuan mi chhan him la; Mi nunrâwng lakah chuan mi humhim ang che:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Anni chuan an thinlungah thil tihsualte an ngaihtuah ṭhîn a; Do tûrin an inkhâwm fo ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An lei chu rûl angin an tihriam a; An heh chhûngah chuan rûlrial tûr a awm a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi suaksual kut lakah chuan mi vawng ṭha la; Mi nunrâwng lakah chuan mi humhim ang che: Anni chuan ka ke pênte hi nam kawi an tum a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi chapote chuan ka awh nân thang an kam ru a, hruihrualte nên; Kawng sîrah chuan lên an phah a; Ka awh nân thangte an kam a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa hnênah chuan, “Nang chu ka Pathian i ni a: Aw Lalpa , khawngaih ka dîlna awte hi lo bengkhawn ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw, Lalpa Pathian, mi chhandamna tichaktu, Nang chuan inbeih nîah chuan ka lû mi khuhsak a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi suaksual duh zâwngte chu phal suh la; An ngaihtuahna sual chu puitlintîr suh ang che; Chuti lo chuan, an inchawimawi dah ang e,” ka ti a. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi hual vêltute lû chu, Anmahni hmuia an thu sual sawi chuan khuh rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Meilingte an chungah tla sela: Meia paihin awm sela; An thawh leh tawh lohna tûrin khuarkhurum thûk takahte paihin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu ṭha lo sawitu chu leiah hian tihnghehin a awm lo vang a; Mi nunrâwng tichhe tûrin thil ṭha lovin a pêl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hrehawm tuarte chu an thûah a ṭan ang tih ka hria, Pachhiate chu an tâna âwm rêngah nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Matheilovin mi felte chuan i hming an fak ang a; Mi dikte chu i hmaah an awm ang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="141" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , ka koh che hi; ka hnênah lo kal thuai la: Ka koh chein ka awah hian beng lo chhi ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ṭawngṭaina hi englo rimtui tak angin i hmaah tihchhuahin awm sela; Ka kut phar hi tlai lam inthawina angin awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ka bulah hian vêngtu ṭhuttîr la; Ka hmui kawngkhâr hi vêng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Suahsualna thilte thil tisual mite tihpui tûr chuan, Ka thinlung hi thil ṭha lo rêng rêng lamah chuan thlêktîr suh la; An ei tui tak takte chu mi eitîr suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi fel chuan mi vaw rawh se, khawngaihna a ni ang; Mi zilhhau rawh se, lua hriak thih ang a ni ang; Ka luin duh lo suh se. An suahsual pawhin ka ṭawngṭai zêl dâwn si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An rorêltute chu lungpui sîrah paih thlâkin an awm a; Anni chuan ka thute chu an ngaithla tawh ang; a thlum si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi’n a lei a leh a, a tisawm ang hian, Kan ruhte hi thlân kovah tihdarhin a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aw Lalpa Pathian, ka mitin i lam a en si ṭhîn a; Nangmahah chuan ka rinna ka nghat ṭhîn; Ka nunna hi saruakin hnutchhiah suh ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka awh nâna thang an kam lakah chuan mi humhim ang che. Thil tisualtute thang lakah te nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Keiin ka kal pelh lai takin, Mi suaksualte chu anmahni lênahte chuan tlu lût rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="142" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka awin Lalpa chu ka au va; Ka awin Lalpa hnênah khawngaihna ka dîl ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A hmaah ka mangan thu ka sawi a; A hmaah ka buaina ka hriattîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka thlarau ka chhûngah a chauh lai khân, nangmah ngeiin ka kawng chu i hria a. Ka kalna kawngah hian ka awh nân thang an kam ru a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ka ding lam hi thlêk la, en teh, tu mah mi hria rêng rêng an awm tâk loh hi; Ka inhumhimna a awm ta lo va; Tu mah rêng rêngin ka nunna hi an ngaihsak ta lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka au chia; “Nang chu ka inhumhimna, Mi nung rama ka chanvo i ni,” ka ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka au thâwm hi ngaithla ang che, Nasa taka tihhniamin ka awm ta si a; Mi tiduhdahtute lakah hian mi chhan him ang che, ka aiin an chak zâwk si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I hming ka fak theih nân, ka nunna hi tân in aṭangin hruai chhuak ang che; Mi felte chuan mi hual vêl ang, Nangin ṭha taka mi tih dâwn avângin.
  </para>
  <chapter number="143" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , ka ṭawngṭaina hi ngaithla la; khawngaih ka dîlnaah hian beng lo chhi la; I rinawmna avâng leh i felna avângin mi chhâng ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />I chhiahhlawh chungah hian rorêl suh ang che; I mit hmuhah chuan mi nung rêng rêng thiam chang an awm dâwn si lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Dotu chuan ka nunna a tiduhdah si a; Ka nun hi leiah a vaw thlu a; Thi tawh daihte angin, hmun thim takahte mi awmtîr a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chuvângin, ka thlarau hi ka kawchhûngah a chau va; Ka thinlung hi ka kawchhûngah a mangang ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hmasâng nite chu ka hre reng ṭhîn a; I thiltih zawng zawng chu ka ngaihtuah ṭhîn a; I kut hnathawhte chu ka chhût ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ka kutte hi i lamah ka phar ṭhîn a; Ka nunna hi ram ro tak angin nangmah châkin a tuihâl ṭhîn. (Selah)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi chhâng thuai ang che; ka thlarau a chauh dâwn hi. Ka lakah hian i hmai thup suh ang che; Chuti lo chuan, khuarkhuruma chhukte ang maiin ka lo awm dah ang e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zîngah chuan i ngilneihna thu mi hriattîr ang che; Nang ka ring si ṭhîn chia; Ka kalna tûr kawng chu mi hriattîr ang che; Ka rilru hi i hnênah ka dah tlat si ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , mi dotute lakah chuan mi chhan him ang che; I mi thuhrûk tûrin i hnênah ka lo tlân a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />I duh zâwng tih mi zirtîr ang che, ka Pathian i ni si a; I thlarau chu a ṭha a ni; ram dik takah chuan mi hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i hming avângin mi tiharh la; I felna avângin ka nunna hi manganna ata hruai chhuak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />I ngilneihna avângin mi dotute chu tiboral la, Ka nunna timangangtu zawng zawng chu tiboral ang che; I chhiahhlawh ka ni si a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="144" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa , ka lungpui chu fakin awm rawh se, Ani chuan ka kutte hi râl kah a zirtîr ṭhîn a, Ka kut zungṭangte hi bei tûrin a zirtîr bawk ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka ngilneihna leh ka kulhpui, Ka kulhbîng sâng leh mi chhanhimtu, Ka phaw leh ka rinna nghahna, Ka hnuaia ka mite tudawl ṭhîntu chu a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa , mihring hi eng nge maw a niha, i hriat ṭhin ni? Mihring fapa pawh hi eng nge maw a niha, i ngaihtuah ṭhin ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mihring hi eng mah lo mai ang a ni a; A dam chhûng nite chu hlim ral ṭhîn ang hi a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i vânte tikûnin lo chhuk la; Tlângte chu khawih ang che; tichuan, a khu chhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kâwl phêttîr la, anniho chu tidarh ang che; I thalte chu kâp chhuak la, tibuai nuaih ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chung lam aṭangin i kut rawn ban la; Mi chhan chhuak la, tui lian atate hi mi chhan him ang che, Mikhualte kut ata hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An kâ chuan dâwt a sawi a, Chhechham chung pawhin dâwt an sawi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Aw Pathian, nangmah chawimawiin hla thar ka sa ang a; Perhkhuang hrui sâwm nei mi nên nangmah fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah chu a ni lalho hnêna chhandamna pea, Khandaih mi tikhawlo thei laka a chhiahhlawh Davida chhan chhuaktu chu ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mi chhan chhuak la, mikhualte kut ata hi mi chhan him ang che, An kâ chuan thu eng mah lo mai mai an sawi ṭhîn a, An kut ding lam chu bumnain a khat a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thlai ṭhang duang ang maiin kan fapate ṭhang duang sela; Kan fanute pawh lal in kil lung chher mawi ang lo ni se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kan buhzêmte lo khatin thil tinrêng awm rei ruiin, Kan berâmte pawhin no sâng tam tak, Sîng tam tak kan phûlahte hring sela;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kan bâwngpaten phur thûr thûr sela, Kan ran rualte rawktu leh hruai botu awm lovin; Kan kawtthlêrahte mangang au thâwm awm lo sela.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Chutiang mite chu lâwm takin an awm ṭhîn a; A ni, Lalpa Pathiana neih mite chu lâwm takin an awm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <chapter number="145" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Aw Lalber, ka Pathian, ka chawimawi ang chia; I hming hi kumkhaw tlaitluanin ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ni tin ka fak ang chia; I hming hi kumkhaw tlaitluanin ka fak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chu a ropui a, nasa taka fak tûr a ni; A ropuizia chu chhui chhuah rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Chhuan khatin chhuan dang hnênah i thiltihte chu an fak chhâwng zêl ang a; I thiltih ropui takte chu an hriattîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nangmah chawimawina ropui tak leh, I thilmak tihte chu ka ngaihtuah ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Miten i thiltih râpthlâk takte chakzia chu an sawi ang a; Kei pawhin i ropuizia ka hriattîr bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I ṭhatna ropui tak an hriat reng chu an sawi ang a, I felna thu hi hlim takin hlaah an sa ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chu mi khawngaih thei, lainatnaa khat, Thinnel, ngilneihna nasa tak nei a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chu engkim chungah pawh a ṭha a ni; A lainatnate chu a thilsiam zawng zawng chungah a awm a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Aw Lalpa , i thilsiam zawng zawng chuan i hnênah lâwmthu an hril ang a; Mi thianghlimte pawhin an fak ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />I ram ropuizia thu sawiin, I thiltihtheihna thu chu tîtîah an la hmang ang;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mihring fate hnênah a thiltih ropui takte leh, A ram mawina ropuizia hriattîr tûrin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I ram chu chatuan ram tûr a ni a, I thuneihna chu chhuan awm chhûng zawngin a awm reng ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Lalpa chuan tlute zawng zawng chu a chelh reng ṭhîn a, Kun ngawih ngawiha awm zawng zawng chu a kai tho ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />I thilsiam zawng zawng mitte chuan an nghâk ṭhîn che a; Nangin a hun takah an chaw i pe ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />I kut i phar a, Thil nung zawng zawng châkna chu i tihrehsak ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa chu a awm dân zawng zawngah a felin, A thiltih zawng zawngah mi khawngaih thei tak a ni ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a kotu zawng zawngte chu a hnaih ṭhîn a. Tihtak zeta amah kotu zawng zawngte chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amah ṭihtute duh chu a hlawhtlintîr ang a; An au thâwm a hria ang a, anni chu a chhandam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa chuan amah hmangaihtu zawng zawng chu a vawng ṭha ṭhîn a; Mi suaksualte erawh chu a tiboral vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka kâ hian Lalpa fakna thu a sawi ang; Tin, tisa zawng zawng hian a hming thianghlim chu kumkhaw tlaitluanin fak rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="146" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Aw ka nunna, Lalpa chu fak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka dam chhûng zawngin Lalpa chu ka fak ang a; Ka nun chhûng zawngin ka Pathian fakin ka zai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi liante chu ring suh ula, Mihring fapa, ṭanpuina rêng rêng awm lohna chu ring hek suh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thawin a chhuahsan a, ani chu a leilungah a kîr leh a; Chumi ni ngei chuan a ngaihtuahnate chu a bo nghâl a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jakoba Pathian ṭanpuitua nei chu lâwm takin a awm ṭhîn, Lalpa Pathiana beiseina neitu chu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chu lei te, vân te, Tuifinriat te leh an chhûnga awm zawng zawng siamtu a ni; Ani chuan kumkhua atân thutak a vawng ṭha ṭhîn a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ani chuan hnehchhiahna tuarte tân ro a rêl ṭhîn a, Ani chuan rilṭamte hnênah chaw a pe ṭhîn. Lalpa chuan mi tângte chu a chhuah ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mitdelte mit a tivâr ṭhîn a; Lalpa chuan kun ngawih ngawihte chu a kai tho ṭhîn a; Lalpa chuan mi felte chu a hmangaih ṭhîn a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan mikhualte chu a vawng ṭha ṭhîn a; Pa nei lo leh hmeithai chu a chelh reng ṭhîn a; Mi suaksualte kawng erawh chu a tiletling ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lalpa chu kumkhuain lalah a ṭhu ang a, Aw Zion, i Pathian chu chhuan zawng zawng thlengin lalah a ṭhu ang. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="147" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u; Kan Pathian faka zai hi a ṭha si a; Chu chu a nuamin, fak hi a âwm rêng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Jerusalem chu a din leh a; Israel hnawh chhuahhote chu a hruai khâwm leh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lungchhiate chu a tidam a, An hliamte chu a tuam ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Arsi tam chin a chhiar a; An hming a vuah ṭheuh hlawm ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kan Lalpa chu a ropui a, thiltihtheih lamah pawh chak tak a ni a; A finna chuan tawpintai a nei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thuhnuairawlhte chu a chelh reng a; Mi suaksualte chu leiah a titlâwm ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lâwm thu sawia Lalpa chawimawiin hla sa ula; Ṭingṭang nên kan Pathian fakin zai rawh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ani chuan vân khi chhûm a zâm hliahtîr a, Leilung tân ruah a buatsaih a, Tlângahte chuan hlobet a ṭotîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan sa hnênah ei tûr a pe ṭhîn, Choâk no hrâm hrâmte hnênah nên.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ani chu sakawr chakna chungah chuan a lâwm lo va; Mihring ke chungahte pawh lâwmna rêng rêng a nei ṭhîn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan amah ṭihtute chungah chuan a lâwmna a nei ṭhîn, A ngilneihna beiseitute chungah chuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Aw Jerusalem, Lalpa chu fak rawh; Aw Zion, i Pathian chu fak rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ani chuan i kulh kawngkhârte kalhna thing tlâwnte chu a tikhauh va; I chhûnga i fanau awmte chu mal a sâwm si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I ramri chhûngah chuan remna a siam a; Buh ṭha ber chiin a tikhat ṭhîn che a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thupêk chu leiah hian a tîr chhuak a; A thu chu chak takin a tlân ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Vûr sûr chu berâm hmul angin a pe a; Vûr tla chu vut angin a theh darh ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A tui khal chu chhang them nawi angin a paih chhuak ṭhîn a; Ama vawhna hmaah chuan tu nge ding thei ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A thu chu a tîr chhuak a, chûng chu a titui a; A thli a tlehtîr a, chutichuan, tuite chu a lo luang ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A thu chu Jakob-ho hnênah a lantîr a, A thuruatte leh a rorêlte pawh chu Israel-ho hnênah a lantîr ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ani chuan eng hnam chungah mah chutiang chuan a ti ve ngai lo; A rorêlte lah chu an hre hek lo. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="148" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Vân aṭangte khian Lalpa chu fak ula; Chung lamahte khian amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A vântirhkoh zawng zawngte u, amah chu fak ula; A sipai zawng zawngte u, amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ni leh thlate u, amah chu fak ula; Arsi êng zawng zawngte u, amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vân sângte u, amah chu fak ula, Vân chunga tui awmte u, amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chûngho chuan Lalpa hming chu fak rawh se; Ani chuan thu a pe a, siamin an lo awm ta si a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan chûngho chu kumkhaw tlaitluan atân a tinghet a; Thu, boral lo tûr chu a ruat a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei aṭang hian, Nangni dragon-te leh tui thûk zawng zawngte u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mei leh rial te, vûr sûr leh chhûmte u; A thu zâwm ṭhîn thlipuite u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tlâng lian leh tlâng tê zawng zawngte u; Thing rah duhte leh sidar thing zawng zawngte u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ramsate leh ran zawng zawngte u; Rannungte leh chunglêng savate u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Leia lalte leh mi tinrêngte u; Mi liante leh leia rorêltu zawng zawngte u;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nula leh tlangvâlte; Putar leh naupangte u; Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chûngho chuan Lalpa hming chu fak rawh se, A hming chauh chu chawi sânin a awm si a; A ropuina chuan lei leh vân a khûm daih a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A mite ki chu a chawimawi bawk a, A mi thianghlim zawng zawng fakna chu; Israel fa, a kianga mite fakna chu. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="149" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Lalpa chawimawiin hla thar sa ula, Mi thianghlimte inkhâwmnaah chuan a fakna hla sa rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Israel-ho chu an siamtu chungah chuan lâwm sela; Zion fate chu an Lalber chungah chuan hlim rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hming chu lâmin fak sela; Khuangtê leh ṭingṭang nên amah fakin zai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chu a mite chungah a lâwm si ṭhîn a; Thuhnuairawlhte chu chhandamnain a timawi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi thianghlimte chu ropuinaah lâwm takin awm sela; An khum laizâwlah hlimin zai rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian chawimawia fakna chu an kâah awm sela, Khandaih hriam tawn an kutah awm bawk rawh se;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hnam tin chunga phuba laa, Mi tin chunga hremna thlentîr tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An lalte chu khaidiata phuara, An mi ṭhate chu thîr kawlte buntîr tûr leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Rorêl ziak saa an chunga rêl tûrin: Chu chawimawina chu a mi thianghlim zawng zawng chuan an nei hlawm a. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <chapter number="150" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu fak rawh u. Pathian chu a hmun thianghlimah chuan fak ula; A thiltihtheihna boruak zau takah khian amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thiltih ropui takte avângin amah chu fak ula; A ropui nasatzia ang zelin amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tawtawrâwt riin amah chu fak ula; Perhkhuang leh ṭingṭangin amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Khuangtê leh lâmin amah chu fak ula; Ṭingṭang chi hrang hrang leh phênglâwngin amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Dârbenthek ri thûm miin amah chu fak ula; Dârbenthek ri fiak miin amah chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Engkim, thaw thei tawh phawt chuan Lalpa chu fak rawh se. Lalpa chu fak rawh u.
  </para>
</usx>
